<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">- YAO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">Kuŵalanga</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Kuŵalanga chichalembekwe ni Musa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kuŵalanga</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kuŵa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kuŵalanga</para>
  <para style="mt1">Chitabu cha Kuŵalanga chichalembekwe ni Musa</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuŵalanga</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Kuŵalanga chikukunguluchila ulendo wa yaka alobaini kwa Ŵaisilaeli kupitila mwipululu, akanaŵe kwinjila mu chilambo chiŵalanjilwe yaani chilambo cha ku Kanaani. Chitabu chi chikuŵilanjikwa Kuŵalanga pakuŵa kwana mauto gaŵili gagakusala hesabu ja achalume ŵaŵaputanaga ngondo ŵaŵaliji mu kila lukosyo lwa Ŵaisilaeli. (Sula ja 1 ni sula ja 26) Ŵaumanyilisi akumanyilila yakuti chitabu cha Kuŵalanga chili chitabu chimo mwa itabu ya malamulo yailembekwe ni che Musa yaani Ndanadililo, Kutyoka, Indu yapanganyisye Ŵalawi, ni Chikumbuchisyo cha malamulo. Usyene wu ukuloleka mu chitabu chisyene cha Kuŵalanga apala pachikutanda kwa kusala kuti Ambuje Akunnungu ŵakungulwiche ni che Musa. (Kuŵalanga 1.1) Ikukomboleka nombe che Musa ŵalembile mwamujinji mu chitabu cha Kuŵalanga ni ŵakulemba ŵa malembo ŵajonjechesye malo gampepe mu yaka iyakuiye. Ikuŵa yakulimba kuganisya kuti che Musa akakombwele kulilembela nsyene kulilapa kulitulusya kwakwe mu liunjili lya 12.3.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ulendo wao wa mwipululu, Ŵaisilaeli ŵalalatile ni kunkana Ambuje Akunnungu kakajinji, nombewo ŵajamuchikwe kwa ipanganyo yao. Chisyayo chimo nkati chindu cho, chili katema ŵandu ŵa Isilaeli paŵajogopaga ni kulalata kuti Ŵakanaani akwete machili gamakulungwa kwapunda ŵanyawo (Kuŵalanga 14:1-4). Malinga ni chindu cho Akunnungu ŵatite uŵelesi wu wose wa Ŵaisilaeli ngaajinjila mu chilambo chiŵalanjilwe. Kaichile katema nombe che Musa nsyene nganiŵajitichisya Akunnungu, ni malinga ni yele nganajinjila mu chilambo chiŵalanjilwe. Namose yeleyo ŵandu ŵajendelechele kwakana Akunnungu, nambo Akunnungu ŵajendelechele kwagosa. Katema ŵammagongo ŵa Ŵaisilaeli paŵanjigele jwakulondola jwaunami jwakuŵilanjikwa cha Balaamu asale maloŵe gakwalwesya Ŵaisilaeli, Akunnungu ŵantesile che Balaamu asale maloŵe gakwapa upile pamalo pa kwalwesya. (Kuŵalanga 22-24)</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaili mwelemo</para>
  <para style="io">Ngani jankati kuŵalanjikwa kwa Ŵaisilaeli ni ukotopasyo ŵa chigono chao, masengo ga ŵambopesi ni mbopesi sisyatyochekwe ni kila lukosyo katema chilisa ni Lisakasa lya kupopelela payatendekwe kuŵa ya Ambuje Akunnungu. Mu sula jaandanda mpaka sula ja kumi msitali wa kumi na moja.</para>
  <para style="io">Pakumala yeleyo chitabu cha Kuŵalanga chikusalilichisya ulendo wa ŵandu ŵa Isilaeli mu chipululu. Mu sula ja kumi msitali wa kumi na mbili mpaka mu sula ja ishilini na tano.</para>
  <para style="io">Kuŵalanjikwa kwaaŵili kwa Ŵaisilaeli ni malajisyo gane pamo ni meena ga mauto gaŵaŵisile igono Ŵaisilaeli ali mu ulendo wakwaula ku chilambo chiŵalanjilwe, ni itajile kuchigaŵanya chilambo cho kwa ngosyo syose, katema katajinjile mu chilambo chao achinsyene. Mu sula ja ishilini na sita mpaka sula ja selasini na sita.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1" />
  <para style="s">Ŵaisilaeli akuŵalanjikwa kaandanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1" />Pa lyuŵa lyaandanda lya mwesi waaŵili pakumala Ŵaisilaeli kutyoka ku Misili, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵakungulwiche ni che Musa ku chipululu cha Sinai mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. Ŵaasalile kuti, <verse eid="NUM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2" />“Mmwe ni che Haluni mwaŵalanje Ŵaisilaeli malinga ni mitundu jao ni minango jao, kila jwannume kwa liina lyakwe, jumojumo. <verse eid="NUM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3" />Timwaŵalanje ŵandu malinga ni mitundu jao, achalume wose ŵaali ni yaka ishilini ni kupunda ŵaali ni ukombole wa kuputana ngondo. <verse eid="NUM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4" />Sooni jwannume jumo mu kila lukosyo jwaali chilongola jwa lukosyo lyo tankamusye kuŵalanga.” <verse eid="NUM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5" />Gelega gali mena ga ŵandu ŵatachinkamusya: Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa che Lobeni jwaliji che Elisuli mwanache jwa che Shedeuli.<verse eid="NUM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa che Simeoni jwaliji che Shelumieli mwanache jwa che Sulishadai,<verse eid="NUM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7" />kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa che Yuda, jwaliji che Nashoni mwanache jwa che Aminadabu,<verse eid="NUM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8" />kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Isakali, jwaliji che Netaneli mwanache jwa che Suali,<verse eid="NUM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9" />kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Sabuloni, jwaliji che Eliabu mwanache jwa che Heloni,<verse eid="NUM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10" />Kwa ŵanache ŵa che Yusufu: Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Efulaimu; jwaliji che Elishama mwanache jwa che Amihudi. Ni kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Manase; jwaliji che Gamalieli mwaanche jwa che Pedasuli.<verse eid="NUM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Benjamini, jwaliji che Abidani mwanache jwa che Gidioni.<verse eid="NUM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Dani, jwaliji che Ahieseli mwanache jwa che Amishadai.<verse eid="NUM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Asheli, jwaliji che Pagieli mwanache jwa che Okilani.<verse eid="NUM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Gadi, jwaliji che Eliasafu mwanache jwa che Deueli.<verse eid="NUM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Nafutali, jwaliji che Ahila mwanache jwa che Enani.<verse eid="NUM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16" />Ŵele ni uŵasagulikwe pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli wose, ŵaliji ilongola ŵa ngosyo syao ni ilongola ŵa mitundu jao.<verse eid="NUM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17" />Nipele, che Musa ni che Haluni ŵaasongangenye ŵandu wose ŵasasikwe meena, <verse eid="NUM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18" />pa lyuŵa lilalila lyandanda lya mwesi waaŵili, ŵaasongangenye ŵandu wose uŵaŵalanjikwe. Ŵandu ŵaŵanjikwe malinga ni mitundu jawo ni ulongo wao, nombe achalume wose uŵaliji ni yaka ishilini ni kupunda ŵalembekwe meena gao jumojumo, <verse eid="NUM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19" />mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite kwalamulila che Musa. Kwayele ŵaŵalasile ŵandu ŵa, kuchipululu cha Sinai kula.<verse eid="NUM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20" />Kutyochela mu uŵelesi wa che Lobeni juŵaliji jwakwitiwo jwa Isilaeli juŵaŵilanjikwe che Yakubu, ŵandu wose ŵaŵaliji ni yaka ishilini ni kupunda ŵaŵaliji ni ukombole wa kuputana ngondo ŵalembekwe meena gao, jumojumo malinga ni iŵelesi yao ni mitundu jao ni minango jao. <verse eid="NUM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21" />Ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe mu lukosyo lwa Lobeni ŵaliji ŵandu elufu alubaini na sita na mia tano.<verse eid="NUM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Simeoni malinga ni iŵelesi yao ni mitundu jao ni minango jao, malinga ni uŵalanje ŵa meena gao jumojumo, ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka ishilini ni kupunda ŵakusachilwa kwinjila mu mpingo ŵa ŵandu ŵa ngondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23" />ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe mu lukosyo lwa Simeoni ŵaliji ŵandu elufu amsini na tina na mia tatu.<verse eid="NUM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Gadi ŵandu wose ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka ishilini ni kupunda ŵakusachilwa kwinjila mu mpingo wa ŵandu ŵa ngondo ŵalembekwe meena gao, malinga ni mitundu jao ni minango jao, <verse eid="NUM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25" />ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe mu lukosyo lwa Gadi ŵalinji ŵandu elufu alubaini na tano ni miasita ni amsini.<verse eid="NUM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26" />Ŵandu ŵaŵakuiye ŵaliji ŵandu kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Yuda malinga ni mitundu jao ni ulongo wao malinga uŵalanje wa meena gao, ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka ishilini ni kupunda ŵakusachilwa kwinjila mu mpingo wa ŵandu ŵangondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27" />ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe mu lukosyo lwa Yuda waliji ŵandu elufu sabini na nne na mia sita.<verse eid="NUM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28" />Ŵakuiye ŵandu kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Isakali, ŵandu wose ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka ishilini ni kupunda ŵakusachilwa kwaula ku ngondo ŵalembekwe meena gao malinga ni mitundu jao ni minango jao, <verse eid="NUM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29" />ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe mu lukosyo lwa Isakali ŵaliji ŵandu elufu amsini na nne ni mia nne.<verse eid="NUM 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30" />Ŵakuiye ŵandu kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Sabuloni, ŵandu wose ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka ishilini ni kupunda ŵakusachilwa kwaula ku ngondo ŵalembekwe meena gao malinga ni mitundu jao ni minango jao, <verse eid="NUM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31" />ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe mu lukosyo lwa Sabuloni, ŵaliji ŵandu elufu amsini na saba na mia nne.<verse eid="NUM 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32" />Ŵaŵakuiye ŵaliji ŵandu kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Efulaimu mwanagwe che Yusufu, ŵandu wose ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka ishilini ni kupunda ŵakusachilwa kwaula ku ngondo ŵalembekwe meena gao malinga ni mitundu jao ni minango jao, <verse eid="NUM 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33" />ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe mu lukosyo lwa Efulaimu ŵaliji ŵandu elufu alubaini na mia tano.<verse eid="NUM 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Manase mwanagwe che Yusufu, ŵandu wose ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka ishilini ni kupunda ŵakusachilwa kwaula ku ngondo ŵalembekwe meena gao malinga ni mitundu jao ni minango jao, <verse eid="NUM 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35" />ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe mu lukosyo lwa Manase ŵaliji ŵandu elufu salasini na mbili na mia mbili.<verse eid="NUM 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵandu wose ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka ishilini ni kupunda ŵakusachilwa kwaula ku ngondo ŵalembekwe meena gao malinga ni mitundu jao ni minango jao, <verse eid="NUM 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37" />ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe mu lukosyo lwa Benjami ŵaliji ŵandu elufu salasini na tano na mia nne.<verse eid="NUM 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Dani ŵandu wose ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka ishilini ni kupunda ŵakusachilwa kwaula ku ngondo ŵalembekwe meena gao malinga ni mitundu jao ni minango jao, <verse eid="NUM 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39" />ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe mu lukosyo lwa Dani ŵaliji ŵandu elufu sitini na mbili na mia saba.<verse eid="NUM 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40" />Ŵaŵakuiye ŵaliji ŵandu kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Asheli, ŵandu wose ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka ishilini ni kupunda ŵakusachilwa kwaula ku ngondo ŵalembekwe meena gao malinga ni mitundu jao ni minango jao, <verse eid="NUM 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41" />ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe mu lukosyo lwa Asheli ŵaliji ŵandu elufu alubaini na moja na mia tano.<verse eid="NUM 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42" />Ŵakuiye ŵandu kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Nafutali, ŵandu wose ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka ishilini ni kupunda ŵakusachilwa kwaula ku ngondo ŵalembekwe meena gao malinga ni mitundu jao ni minango jao, <verse eid="NUM 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43" />ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe mu lukosyo lwa Nafutali ŵaliji ŵandu elufu amsini na tatu na mia nne.<verse eid="NUM 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44" />Ŵeleŵa ni ŵandu ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe ni che Musa ni che Haluni achikamuswaga n ilongola kumi na mbili ŵa Isilaeli, kila jumo achijimililaga ntundu wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45" />Kwayele achalume wose ŵa Isilaeli ŵaali ni lisusa lwa yaka ishilini ni kupunda, ŵaŵasachilwe kwaula ku ngondo mu chilambo cha Isilaeli malinga ni ulongo wao; <verse eid="NUM 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46" />ŵaliji ŵandu laki sita na elufu tatu na mia tano na amsini.<verse eid="NUM 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47" />Nambo Ŵalawi nganaŵalanjikwa pamo ni aŵala ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sine, <verse eid="NUM 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48" />pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49" />“Nkaaŵalanga ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Laŵi pamo ni Ŵaisilaeli ŵane. <verse eid="NUM 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50" />Nambo chimwasagule aŵe ŵakwimilila ŵa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, ni yoombo yakwe yose ni kila chindu chachili munkati mwakwe; tachiŵa ŵakwigala Lisakasa pamo ni yoombo yakwe yose. Tachitumichila mwelemo ni kuŵika chigono chao kulisyungula Lisakasa lyo. <verse eid="NUM 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51" />Sooni katema Lisakasa palikutyosyekwa kwaligongo lya kwendelechela ni ulendo, Ŵalawi ni utalityosye ni katema ka kulijimika pa kuŵika chigongo Ŵalawi jikape ni utalijimiche. Mundu jwine jwajulijose jutasejelele chiŵandi ni Lisakasa lyo taulajikwe. <verse eid="NUM 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵane wose taŵiche igono yao mipingomipingo, kila mundu pa chigono chakwe nsyene pamalo pajili bendela ja mpingo wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53" />Nambo Ŵalawi taŵiche igono yao kusyungula Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, ali nkulindilila kuti mundu jwalijose akaliŵandichila kuti ching'ang'a cha Akunnungu chikaasimana nsongangano wa Ŵaisilaeli. Ŵalawi pe ni utapanganye masengo pa Lisakasa lyo.” <verse eid="NUM 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54" />Kwayele Ŵaisilaeli ŵatesile mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite pakunlajisya che Musa.<verse eid="NUM 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2" />
  <para style="s">Ukotopasyo wa ngosyo pa igono ya Ŵaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵapele che Musa ni che Haluni malajisyo ga: <verse eid="NUM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2" />“Waisilaeli taŵiche igono yao kila mundu tatame pamalo pachili chilosyo chakwe ni bendela ja nnango wakwe. Tataŵe igono yao kulisyungula Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu.”<verse eid="NUM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3" />“Cha kungopochelo lyuŵa kulola kwalikutyochela lyuŵa, chigono cha mipingo ja Yuda taŵiche chigono pamalo pajili bendela jao. Chilongola jwao taŵe che Nashoni mwana jwa che Aminadabu. <verse eid="NUM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4" />Mpingo wakwe ŵaliji ni achalume elufu sabini na nne na mia sita. <verse eid="NUM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5" />Ŵachakuye kuŵika chigono pakumala ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda tachiŵa ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Isakali, chilongola jwao achiŵaga che Nesaneli mwana ju che Suali, <verse eid="NUM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6" />mpingo wakwe mpela iŵatite kuŵalanjikwa waliji ni achalume elufu amsini na nne na mia nne. <verse eid="NUM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7" />Nipele lukosyo lwa Sabuluni chilongola jwao achiŵaga che Eliabu mwana jwa che Heloni, <verse eid="NUM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8" />mpingo wakwe mpela iŵatite kuŵalanjikwa waliji ni achalume elufu amsini na saba ni mia nne. <verse eid="NUM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9" />Ŵandu wose ŵatachiŵa mu chigono cha ŵandu ŵa Yuda malinga ni mipingo jao, ali ŵandu laki moja elufu semanini na sita na mia nne. Ŵanyawo ni ŵatachiŵa ŵakulongolela pa ulendo.”<verse eid="NUM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10" />“Cha kulujenda aŵala ŵaali pamalo pajili bendela ja mpingo wa Lobeni malinga ni mipingo jao, chilongola jwao tachiŵa che Elisuli mwana jwa che Shedeuli, <verse eid="NUM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11" />mpingo wakwe mpela iŵatite kuŵalanjikwa waliji ni ŵandu elufu alobaini na sita na mia tano. <verse eid="NUM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12" />Nipele aŵala ŵatachiŵika chigono mumbali mwa ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Lobeni tachiŵa ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Simeoni, chilongola jwao tachiŵa che Shelumieli mwana jwa che Suli Shadai, <verse eid="NUM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13" />mpingo wakwe mpela iŵatite kuŵalanjikwa waliji ni ŵandu elufu amsini na tisa na mia tatu. <verse eid="NUM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14" />Lukosyo lwa Gadi tilukuye, chilongola jwao achiŵaga che Eliasafu mwana jwa che Deueli, <verse eid="NUM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15" />mpingo wakwe mpela iŵatite kuŵalanjikwa waliji ni ŵandu elufu alubaini na tano na mia sita na amsini. <verse eid="NUM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16" />Achalume wose ŵatachiŵa mu chigono cha Lobeni malinga ni mipingo jao taŵe ŵandu laki moja na elufu amsini na moja na mia nne na amsini. Ŵeleŵa ni ŵatachiŵa mpingo waaŵili pa ulendo.”<verse eid="NUM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17" />“Nipele, Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu ni chigono cha lukosyo lwa Ŵalawi, chiiŵe pasikati ja igono yose. Ŵanyawo tajende kwa ukotopasyo ulaula mpela muŵaŵisile igono, kila mundu pamalo pakwe nsyene pamalo pajili bendela jakwe.”<verse eid="NUM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18" />Cha kumaswelelo lyuŵa, aŵala ŵaali pamalo pa bendela ja mpingo wa Efulaimu tachiŵika chigono malinga ni mipingo jao, chilongola jwao tachiŵa che Elishama mwana jwa che Amihudi, <verse eid="NUM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19" />mpingo wakwe mpela iŵatite kuŵalanjikwa chiuŵe ni ŵandu elufu alubaini na mia tano. <verse eid="NUM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20" />Namala pe lukosyo lwa Ŵaefulaimu tilukuye lukosyo lwa Manase: Chilongola jwao achiŵaga che Gamalieli mwana jwa che Pedasuli, <verse eid="NUM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21" />mpingo wakwe mpela iŵatite kuŵalanjikwa chiuŵe ni ŵandu elufu salasini na mbili na mia mbili. <verse eid="NUM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22" />Lukosyo lwa Benjamini tilukuye. Chilongola jwao ali che Abidani mwana jwa che Gideoni, <verse eid="NUM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23" />mpingo wakwe mpela iŵatite kuŵalanjikwa chiuŵe ni ŵandu elufu salasini na tano na mia nne. <verse eid="NUM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24" />Ŵandu wose ŵatachiŵa mu chigono cha Efulaimu malinga ni mipingo jao ni ŵandu laki moja na elufu nane na mia moja. Mpingo wo tiuŵe waatatu kutyoka.<verse eid="NUM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25" />Cha Kumpoto, tikuŵe ni mipingo ja chigono cha Dani, pamalo pajili bendela jao. Chilongola jwao tachiŵa che Ahieseli mwana jwa che Amishadai, <verse eid="NUM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26" />mpingo wakwe mpela iŵatite kuŵalanjikwa chiuŵe ni ŵandu elufu sitini na mbili na mia saba. <verse eid="NUM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27" />Lukosyo lwa Asheli tiluŵiche chigono chao chiŵandi ni chigono cha lukosyo lwa Dani. Chilongola jwao tachiŵa che Pagieli mwana jwa che Okilani, <verse eid="NUM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28" />mpingo wakwe mpela iŵatite kuŵalanjikwa chiuŵe ni ŵandu 41,500.<verse eid="NUM 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29" />Lukosyo lwa Nafutali tilukuye. Chilongola jwao tachiŵa che Ahila mwana jwa che Enani, <verse eid="NUM 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30" />mpingo wakwe mpela iŵatite kuŵalanjikwa chiuŵe ni ŵandu elufu amsini na tatu na mia nne. <verse eid="NUM 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31" />Ŵandu wose ŵatachiŵa mu chigono cha Dani malinga ni mipingo jao taŵe ŵandu laki moja na elufu amsini na saba na mia sita. Mpingo wo tiuŵe wambesi kutyoka, paasi pa bendela jao.<verse eid="NUM 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32" />Ŵele ni Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe malinga ni minango jao. Ŵanawose aŵala ŵaali pa chigono pa mipingo jao, ali ŵandu laki sita na elufu tatu na mia tano na amsini. <verse eid="NUM 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33" />Nambo Ŵalawi nganaŵalanjikwa pamo ni Ŵaisilaeli achinjawo mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵalajichisye che Musa.<verse eid="NUM 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34" />Kwayele Ŵaisilaeli ŵatesile kila chindu mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite pakwalajisya che Musa. Yele ni iŵatite pakuŵika igono yao pamalo pasili bendela syao, ni sooni yele ni iŵatite pakutyoka, kila mundu ali pa ntundu wakwe ni ulongo wakwe.<verse eid="NUM 2:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3" />
  <para style="s">Ŵanache ŵa che Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1" />Awu uli uŵelesi u che Haluni ni che Musa katema Ambuje Akunnungu paŵakungulwiche ni che Musa pa chitumbi cha Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2" />Gelega ni meena ga ŵanache ŵa che Haluni: Che Nadabu jwakwitiwo jwakwe, che Abihu ni che Eleasali ni che Itamali. <verse eid="NUM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3" />Gelega ni meena ga ŵanache ŵa che Haluni ŵaŵasagulikwe kwa kwajitilila mauta kuti aŵe ŵambopesi. <verse eid="NUM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4" />Nambo che Nadabu ni che Abihu ŵawile paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu paŵantyochesyaga Ambuje Akunnungu mbopesi kwa mooto wangakundikwa paujo pakwe ku chipululu cha Sinai. Ŵanyawo nganakola ŵanache, kwa yele che Eleasali ni che Itamali pe ŵatumikaga nti ŵambopesi katema ka umi wa che Haluni atati ŵao.<verse eid="NUM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵalawi akusagulikwa kwatumichila ŵambopesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6" />“Mwaichisye ŵandu ŵa lukosyo la Ŵalaŵi kwa jwambopesi che Haluni kuti ŵakamuchisye masengo. <verse eid="NUM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7" />Tapanganye masengo kwaligongo lyakwe ni kwaligongo lya ŵandu wose pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, pakutumichila mu Lisakasa. <verse eid="NUM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8" />Tachigosa yoombo yose ya mu Lisakasa ni kupanganya masengo pamalo pa Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9" />Nombe chimwape che Haluni ni achiŵanagwe Ŵalawi wose, ŵelewo ni Ŵaisilaeli ŵatiŵapanganyichisye masengo che Haluni ni achiŵanagwe. <verse eid="NUM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10" />Chimwaŵiche che Haluni ni achiŵanagwe kwa ligongo lya Ambuje kuti atende masengo ga umbopesi; nambo mundu jwalijose jwine jutaŵandichile peuto papaŵichikwe kwaligongo lyangu tachiulajikwa.”<verse eid="NUM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajendelechele kwasalila che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12" />“Naasagwile Ŵalawi pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli wose, pamalo pa kila jwakwitiwo jwa chilume pa kila nnango wa Ŵaisilaeli. Ŵalawi ali ŵangu, <verse eid="NUM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13" />pakuŵa ŵakwitiwo wose pa Isilaeli ali ŵangu. Panauleje ŵakwitiwo kwele ku Misili, naatyosisye kwaligongo lyangu ŵakwitiwo ŵa pa Isilaeli; kila mwanache jwakwitiwo jwa mundu pane chinyama; tachiŵa jwangu. Une ndili Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="NUM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuŵalanjikwa kwa Ŵalawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14" />Kanyuma Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa ku chipululu cha Sinai kuti, <verse eid="NUM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15" />“Mwaŵalanje ŵana ŵa che Lawi wose malinga ni mitundu jao ni ulongo wao, kila jwannume kutandilia ŵanache ŵa mwesi umo ni kupunda.” <verse eid="NUM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16" />Kwayele, che Mose ŵaŵalasile mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite pakwalajisya.<verse eid="NUM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17" />Aŵaŵa ni ŵaŵaliji ŵanache ŵa che Lawi: Che Gelishoni ni che Kohati ni che Melali. <verse eid="NUM 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18" />Mena ga ŵanache ŵa che Gelishoni malinga ni mitundu jawo: Che Libini ni che Shimei. <verse eid="NUM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19" />Ŵanache ŵa che Kohati malinga ni mitundu jawo: Che Amulamu ni che Ishali ni che Hebuloni ni che Usieli. <verse eid="NUM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20" />Ŵanache ŵa che Melali malinga ni mitundu jawo: Che Mahili ni che Mushi. Ŵele ŵaliji ngosyo sya Ŵalaŵi malinga ni minango jao.<verse eid="NUM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21" />Kwaliji ni mitundu ja Ŵalibini ni Ŵashimei jijatyochele ni che Gelishoni; Jeleji ni jijaliji mitundu ja Ŵagelishoni. <verse eid="NUM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22" />Achalume wose ŵaŵaliji ni mwesi umo pane kupunda ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe ŵaliji elufu saba na mia tano. <verse eid="NUM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23" />Mitundu ja Ŵagelishoni jasachilwe kuŵika chigono chawo cha kulikuswelela lyuŵa panyuma pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24" />Chilongola jwa Ŵagelishoni ŵaliji che Eliasafu mwana jwa che Laeli. <verse eid="NUM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25" />Masengo ga ŵanache ŵa che Gelishoni galiji kuligosa Lisakasa lya Akunnungu, lisakasa pamo ni chiunichilo chakwe ni nguo ja lusasa ja pannango wa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, <verse eid="NUM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26" />nguo sya lusasa sya lutenje lwaluli pasikati ja Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana ni chilisa, ni nguo ja lusasa ja pa nnango wa lutenje ni ngonji syakwe ni kila chindu chichasachikwe kwa kupanganyichisya masengo gakwe.<verse eid="NUM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27" />Mitundu ja Ŵaamlami ni Ŵaishali ni Ŵahebuloni ni Ŵausieli jatyochele ni che Kohati; Jele ni jijaliji mitundu ja Ŵakohati. <verse eid="NUM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28" />Malinga ni iŵatite kuŵalanjikwa achalume wose kutandilila ŵaali ni lisusa lya mwesi umo ni kupunda ŵaliji ŵandu elufu nane na mia sita, ŵaŵatumikaga kupagosa peuto papaŵichikwe kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29" />Mitundu ja ŵanache ŵa che Kohati ŵasachilwe kuŵika chigono chao cha kulujenda kwa Lisakasa lya Akunnungu, <verse eid="NUM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30" />nombe che Elisafani mwanache jwa che Usieli ŵaliji chilongola jwa mitundu ja Ŵakohati. <verse eid="NUM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31" />Masengo gao galiji kuligosa lisanduku lya lilangano, mesa jakuŵichila mikate, ni chindu chakuŵichila lumuli ni chilisa pamo ni yoombo yaikutumika peuto papaŵichikwe kwaligongo lya Akunnungu ni lipasia, ni kila chindu chichasachikwe kwa ligongo lya kutumichila.<verse eid="NUM 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32" />Chilongola jwankulu jwa Ŵalawi ŵaliji che Eleasali mwanache jwa jwambopesi che Haluni. Ŵaŵichikwe kuŵa jwankulu jwa ŵakutumika kupagosa peuto papaswela.<verse eid="NUM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33" />Kutyochela ni che Melali kwaliji ni mitundu ja Ŵamahili ni Ŵamushi; jeleji ni mitundu ja Ŵamelali. <verse eid="NUM 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34" />Achalume wose ŵaali ni lisusa lya chaka chimo pane kupunda ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe ŵaliji elufu sita na mia mbili. <verse eid="NUM 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35" />Chilongola jwa mitundu ja Melali ŵaliji che Sulieli mwana jwa Abihaili; ŵanyaŵa ŵasachilwe kuŵika chigono chao chakumpoto kwa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36" />Ŵanyawo ŵaapele masengo ga kugosa felemu sya Lisakasa lya Akunnungu, ni mitambalapanya, sichi ni itamichilo ni indu yose ya kukamulila lisakasa; ni kila masengo gagasachilwe kupanganyikwa ni indu yo. <verse eid="NUM 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37" />Nombe ŵasachilwe kugosa sichi sya lutenje sisyasyungwile ni itamichilo yakwe pamo ni igingi ya lisakasa ni ngonji syakwe.<verse eid="NUM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38" />Che Musa ni che Haluni ni ŵanache ŵao ŵasachilwe kuŵika chigono chao paujo pa Lisakasa lya Akunnungu chakungopochelo lyuŵa chichilolaga kwalikukopoka lyuŵa. Masengo gao galiji kwimilila masengo gose gagatendekwe peuto papaŵichikwe kwaligongo lya Akunnungu kwa ligongo lya Ŵaisilaeli. Mundu jwine jwalijose juŵasejele peuto papaŵichikwe kwaligongo lya Akunnungu ŵaulajikwe. <verse eid="NUM 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39" />Ŵalawi wose malinga ni ulongo wao, achalume wose kutandilila ŵanache ŵaali ni mwesi umo ni kupunda, ŵati che Musa ni che Haluni ŵaŵalasile kwa lilajisyo lya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaliji ŵandu elufu ishilini na mbili.<verse eid="NUM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵalawi akupegwa sehemu ja ŵanache ŵakwitiwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, “Mwaŵalanje ŵakwitiwo ŵachilume wose ŵa Ŵaisilaeli kutandilila ŵaali ni mwesi umo ni kupunda. <verse eid="NUM 3:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41" />Timwaŵiche pajika Ŵalawi kwaligongo lyangu pamalo pa ŵakwitiwo ŵa Ŵaisilaeli, nombe ilango ya Ŵalawi pamalo pa kila chiŵelesi chandanda cha inyama ya Ŵaisilaeli. Uneji ndili Ambuje Akunnungu.” <verse eid="NUM 3:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42" />Nipele che Musa ŵajitichisye, ŵaŵalasile ŵakwitiwo wose ŵa ŵandu ŵa Isilaeli mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite pakwalajisya <verse eid="NUM 3:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43" />ŵakwitiwo ŵa chilume ŵaali ni lisusa lya mwesi umo ni kupunda, ŵaŵalembekwe kwa meena gawo ŵaliji ŵandu elufu ishilini na mbili na mia mbili na sabini na tatu.<verse eid="NUM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45" />“Sambano mwatende aŵe ŵangu Ŵalawi wose pamalo pa ŵakwitiwo ŵa Ŵaisilaeli. Iyoyo peyo mwatende aŵe ŵangu ilango ya Ŵalawi wose pamalo pa iŵelesi yandanda kupagwa ya ilango ya Ŵaisilaeli, Une ndili Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 3:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46" />Sooni kwa kwawombola ŵakwitiwo mia mbili sabini na tatu ŵa Ŵaisilaeli, ŵati apundile winji wa Ŵalawi, <verse eid="NUM 3:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47" />timpochele kwa kila jwannume ipande nsano ya madini ga feza malinga ni chipimo cha peuto papaŵichikwe kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 3:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48" />Mwape che Haluni ni achiŵanagwe mbiya syo kwa ligongo lya kwawombola Ŵaisilaeli ŵapundile.” <verse eid="NUM 3:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49" />Kwayele che Musa ŵasongangenye feza sya chiwombolo kutyochela kwa aŵala ŵandu ŵaŵapundile aŵala ŵaŵawombolekwe ni Ŵalawi. <verse eid="NUM 3:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50" />Ŵapochele kutyochela kwa ŵanache ŵa kwitiwo ŵa Ŵaisilaeli, madini ga feza ipande ya shekeli elufu moja na mia tatu na sitini na tano, malinga ni chipimo cha peuto papaŵichikwe kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, <verse eid="NUM 3:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51" />ŵaapele che Haluni ni achiŵanagwe feza sya kuwombolela syo mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite kwalajisya che Musa.<verse eid="NUM 3:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4" />
  <para style="s">Masengo ga Ŵakohati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa ni che Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2" />“Mwaŵalanje Ŵakohati ŵali mu lukosyo lwa Ŵalawi, malinga ni mitundu jao ni minango jao; <verse eid="NUM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3" />chimwalembe achalume wose ŵaali ni yaka selasini mpaka hansini ŵakukombola kupanganya masengo ga mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana. <verse eid="NUM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4" />Gelega chigaŵe masengo ga Ŵakohati mu Lisakasa lyakusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, tachiigosa indu yeswela nnope.”<verse eid="NUM 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5" />Katema pakusaka kuchisamisya chigono, che Haluni ni achiŵanagwe tajinjile mu lisakasa ni kulitulusya lipasia lyalili paujo pa lisanduku lya lilangano, ni kuliunichila kwa lipasia lyo. <verse eid="NUM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6" />Pachanya pakwe taŵiche chiunichilo cha lipende lyakwepepala lya chinyama cha mu bahali, nipele taŵiche chitambaa cha langi ja chibuluu chakusalala. Kumbesi tajinjisye itela ya kunyakulila lisanduku lyo.<verse eid="NUM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7" />Pachanya pa mesa ja kutyochesya mikate jajikuŵichikwa paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu taŵiche chitambaa cha chibuluu chati pachanya pakwe taŵiche sahani, ni isahani ya ubani, bakuli ni gilasi kwa ligongo lya kutyochesya mbopesi sya ya kung'wa. Moŵa gose chikuŵe ni mkate pachanya pa mesa. <verse eid="NUM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8" />Nipele taunichile yoombo yose yi kwa chitambaa chechejeu, ni pachanya pakwe taŵiche chiuichilo cha lipende lyakwepepala lya chinyama cha mu bahali. Pelepo tajinjisye itela yakwe yakunyakulila.<verse eid="NUM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9" />Tajigale chitambaa cha chibuluu chati taunichile chindu chakuŵichila lumili ni imuli yakwe, mikasi jakwe ni masinia ni yoombo yose yaikutumika kuŵichila mauta. <verse eid="NUM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10" />Tachiŵiche pamo ni yoombo yakwe yose mu lipende lyakwepepala lya chinyama cha mu bahali chachikuŵilanjikwa pomboo ni kuŵika pachanya pa felemu jakwe.<verse eid="NUM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11" />Sooni taŵiche chitambaa cha chibuluu pa chilisa cha sahabu ni kuchiunichila kwa lipende lyakwepepala lya chinyama cha mu bahali chachikuŵilanjikwa pomboo pachanya pakwe. Pelepo tajinjisye itela ya kunyakulila. <verse eid="NUM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12" />Taijigale yoombo yose yaikutumika peuto papawichikwe kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, taitaŵe kwa chitambaa cha chibuluu ni kuiunichila kwa lipende lyakwepepala lya chinyama cha mu bahali chachikuŵilanjikwa pomboo, nipele taŵiche pachanya pa felemu jakwe. <verse eid="NUM 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13" />Tatyosye liu kutyochela pa chilisa ni pachanya pakwe taŵiche chitambaa cha sambalau. <verse eid="NUM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14" />Nipele taŵiche yoombo yose yaikutumika paakupopela pa chilisa. Sepetu, isyano yaili ni meeno, mitiko ni mabakuli gakusuluchisya miasi. Nipele pachanya pakwe taŵiche chiunichilo cha lipende lyakwepepala lya chinyama cha mu bahali chachikuŵilanjikwa pomboo ni kwinjisya itela ya kunyakulila. <verse eid="NUM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15" />Pakumala che Haluni ni achiŵanagwe kuunichila indu yeswela pamo ni yoombo yakwe yose, ni ŵandu pataŵe chile kutanda ulendo, ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Ŵakohani taiche ni kuijigala. Nambo ŵanyawo ngakuŵajilwa kuikwaya yoombo yo akaika kuŵa. Gele ni masengo ga lukosyo lwa Ŵakohati katema kose patalisamisye Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16" />Che Eleasali mwana jwa jwambopesi che Haluni ni jutachigagosa mauta ga miseituni kwaligongo lya lumuli ni ubani wakununjila kwannope ni mbopesi sya magowolo ga kila lyuŵa ni mauta ga kupakasya kuti kuiŵika pajika indu kwa ligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu mu lisakasa lyo.<verse eid="NUM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa ni che Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18" />“Nkaaleka ŵandu ŵa ntundu wa Ŵakohati aulajikwe. <verse eid="NUM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19" />Nipele pakuti ŵaŵambasye akaika kuulajikwa kwa kuiŵandichila yoombo yeswela yo chintende yeleyi: Che Haluni ni achiŵanagwe tajinjile peuto papaŵichikwe kwaligongo lya Akunnungu ni kwapanjila kila mundu masengo gakwe gatapanganye. <verse eid="NUM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20" />Nambo Ŵokohati ngaajinjila ng'oo kukuilola indu yeswela yo, atendaga yeleyo tawe.”<verse eid="NUM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masengo ga Ŵagelishoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22" />“Mwaŵalanje ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Gelishoni, malinga ni minango jao ni mitumdu jao; <verse eid="NUM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23" />timwaŵalanje achalume wose ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka selasini mpaka hansini, ŵakuŵajilwa kwinjila mu masengo ga mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24" />Masengo gao tigaŵe: Kujigala mapasia ga Lisakasa lya Akunnungu ni Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana pamo ni <verse eid="NUM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25" />chiunichilo chakwe cha lipende lya kwepepala lya chinyama cha mu bahali chachikuŵilanjikwa pomboo chachili pachanya pa lipasia lya nnango, <verse eid="NUM 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26" />ni mapasia ga lutenje lwalusyungulile chilisa ni peuto papaswela pamo ni ngonji sya Lisakasa ni chilisa, mapasia ga nnango wa kwinjilila ni indu yose yaikutumika pa masengo ga kutaŵa lisakasa lyo. Ŵanyawo akusachilwa atende indu yose yaikusachilwa kutendekwa. <verse eid="NUM 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27" />Che Haluni ni achiŵanagwe ni ŵatachapanjila masengo gose Ŵagelishoni iŵeje indu yakujigala pane kupanganya masengo gane. Timwapanjile indu yose yakusachilwa kwigala.” <verse eid="NUM 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28" />Gele ni masengo ga ntundu wa Ŵagelishoni ku Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu; Tatende masengo achilongoswaga ni che Itamali mwana jwa jwambopesi che Haluni.<verse eid="NUM 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masengo ga Ŵalawi ŵa ntundu wa Ŵamelali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29" />Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa kuti, “Iyoyopeyo timwaŵalanje Ŵamelali malinga ni mitundu jao ni minango jao. <verse eid="NUM 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30" />Timwaŵalanje achalume wose ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka selasini mpaka hansini, ŵakuŵajilwa kwinjila mu masengo ga mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31" />Ŵanyawo masengo gao pakupanganya masengo pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana tigaŵe: Kujigala sichi ya lisakasa ni mafelemu ni mitambalapanya yakwe ni itamichilo, <verse eid="NUM 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32" />ni sichi sya ndenje sya kusyunguchisya mosemose ni itamichilo yakwe, ni igingi ni ngonji pamo ni yombo yakwe yose ni kila chindu chachikusachilwa kwa kutumichila. Kila mundu mumpanjile indu itasachilwe kujigala. <verse eid="NUM 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33" />Gele ni masengo ga ntundu wa Ŵamelali ku Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu; Tatende masengo kwa kulongoswa ni che Itamali mwana jwa jwambopesi che Haluni.”<verse eid="NUM 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵalawi akuŵalanjikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34" />Nipele che Musa ni che Haluni pamo ni ilongola ŵa nsongangano wose ŵaaŵalasile Ŵakohati malinga ni mitundu jao ni minango jao. <verse eid="NUM 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35" />Ŵaalembile ŵandu wose ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka selasini mpaka hansini, jwalijose jwakuŵajilwa kwinjila mu masengo ga mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana. <verse eid="NUM 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36" />Ŵandu wose ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe kwa mitundu jao ŵaliji ŵandu elufu mbili na mia saba na hansini. <verse eid="NUM 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37" />Ŵelewa ali ŵandu wose ŵa ntundu wa Ŵakohati ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana, ŵati che Musa ni che Haluni ŵaaŵalasile mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite pakwalajisya che Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38" />Ŵagelishoni ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe malinga ni mitundu jao ni minango jao, <verse eid="NUM 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39" />ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka selasini mpaka hansini, ŵakuŵajilwa kupanganya masengo mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana, <verse eid="NUM 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40" />ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe malinga ni mitundu jao ni ulongo wao ŵaliji ŵandu elufu mbili na mia sita na selasini. <verse eid="NUM 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41" />Ŵanyaŵa ni aŵala ŵandu ŵa ntundu wa Ŵagelishoni ŵaŵatumiche mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana. Che Musa ni che Haluni ŵaŵalasile mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite pakulajisya. <verse eid="NUM 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42" />Ŵamelali ŵaŵalanjikwe malinga ni mitundu jao ni ulongo wao. <verse eid="NUM 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43" />Achalume wose kutandilila ŵa yaka selasini mpaka hansini, ŵaŵaiche kutumichila pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana, <verse eid="NUM 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44" />ŵaliji ŵandu elufu tatu na mia mbili. <verse eid="NUM 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45" />Ŵanyaŵa ni ŵandu wose ŵa ntundu wa Ŵamelali. Che Musa ni che Haluni ŵaŵalasile mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite pakwalamulila che Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46" />Kwayele Ŵalawi wose ŵalembekwe ni che Musa pamo ni che Haluni ni ilongola ŵa Ŵaisilaeli, malinga ni mitundu jao ni minango jao. <verse eid="NUM 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47" />Achalume ŵaali ni lisusa lya yaka selasini mpaka hansini, ŵaŵaiche kupanganya masengo ku Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana ni kujigala Lisakasa lyo, <verse eid="NUM 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48" />ŵaliji ŵandu elufu nane na mia tano na semanini. <verse eid="NUM 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49" />Kila mundu ŵapegwile masengo gakwe ga kupanganya ni ŵasalilwe chakujigala ku Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite pakwalajisya che Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5" />
  <para style="s">Ŵangakundikwa paujo pa Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2" />“Mwalamule Ŵaisilaeli ŵatyosye paasa pa chigono kila mundu jwaali ni matana, ni jwakukopoka uwou ni jwangakukundikwa pakwapopelela Akunnungu ligongo agakwaiye malilo. <verse eid="NUM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3" />Timwatyose paasa pa chigono ŵandu wose ŵa, achalume ni achakongwe, kuti akaika kupatenda pakakundikwa paujo pangu pachigono pao pati une gutama pasikati jao.” <verse eid="NUM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵatesile yele, ŵaatopwele paasa pa chigono. Ŵatesile mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵalajichisye che Musa.<verse eid="NUM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malipilo kwaligongo lya kuleŵa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6" />“Mwasalile Ŵaisilaeli kuti, mundu jwalijose jwannume pane jwankongwe anneŵelaga njakwe kwa litala lyalili lyose, ni kuŵa jwangakulupilichika kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, mundu jo aneŵele une. <verse eid="NUM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7" />Mundu jo akusachilwa kwitichisya sambi jatesile, akusachilwa alipile lileŵa lyakwe, ni sooni aŵiche lipwati lya liunjili limo mwa maunjili nsano pa malipilo go, ni kumpa mundu jwanneŵele. <verse eid="NUM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8" />Nambo iŵaga mundu jo awile ni nganakola alongo ŵachiŵandi, jwati akukombola kupochela malipilo go, nipele, malipilo ga kuleŵa ko tigaŵe gakwe Ambuje Akunnungu. Tachipegwa jwambopesi, pamo ni ngondolo tonde jitatumiche kwa kutendela ujilanyo kwa ligongo lyakwe. <verse eid="NUM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9" />Chachilichose chachikutyosekwa ni Ŵaisilaeli kwa Ambuje Akunnungu tichiŵe cha jwambopesi. <verse eid="NUM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10" />Kila chindu chachityosyekwe kwa Akunnungu ni kuchijausya kwa jwambopesi chichiŵe chakwe jwambopesi jo.”<verse eid="NUM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malajisyo gankati jwannume jwakumuhisi ŵankwakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12" />ŵaasalile Ŵaisilaeli: Naga jwankongwe jwa mundu atesile yangalumbana ni kuleka kulupilichika kwa ŵankwakwe <verse eid="NUM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13" />kwa kugona ni jwannume jwine kwa chisyepela pangaimanyilila ŵankwakwe pane mundu jwine jwalijose; alitesile jwangakundikwa kwa mapopelo nachiŵamuno nganapagwa jwammweni patesile yeleyo namose kwakamula ugoni. <verse eid="NUM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14" />Nipele, jwannume jo akolaga wiu ni kunsimonga ŵankwakwe, nombejo asakaga kwimanyilila iŵaga ŵankwakwe jo atesile yeleyo pane ngaŵa, <verse eid="NUM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15" />nipele ŵana wose ŵaŵili wo tajaule kwa jwambopesi ni kupeleka mbopesi jajikusachilwa, yaani liunjili lya kumi lya shayili, nambo pangataga mauta ni ubani, pakuŵa jili mbopesi ja utandi ja jwannume jwaakunsimonga ŵankwakwe, mbopesi jo jikutyochekwa kulosya kuti jwankongwe jo atesile chileŵo pane ngaŵa.<verse eid="NUM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16" />Jwambopesi tachinnyichisya jwankongwe jo, ni kunjimika paujo pa chilisa. <verse eid="NUM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17" />Nipele tajitile mesi gamaswela mu choombo cha lilongo ni kujigala luundu kutyochela paasi papasilinje mu lisakasa lyeswela ni kulutaga mmesi go. <verse eid="NUM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18" />Pakumala jwambopesi kunjimika jwankongwe jo paujo pa chilisa ni kummunukula umbo ni kwapa mbopesi ja magowolo mmakono mwakwe jajikutyochekwa kwa ligongo lya wiiu wa jwannume. Jwambopesi nsyene takamulile achila choombo chachili ni meesi gagakuŵaŵa gagakuichisya malweso. <verse eid="NUM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19" />Sooni jwambopesi tanlumbisye jwankongwe jo achitiji, “Iŵaga nganapagwa jwannume jwine jwagonile ni mmwe, akuno nli nlombekwe nipele aga meesi gagakuŵaŵa gagakuichisya malweso gakammenga mmwe. <verse eid="NUM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20" />Nambo iŵaga ngonile ni jwannume jwine akuno nli nlombekwe ni kulinyakasya kwa kugona ni jwannume jwine jwangaŵa ŵankwenu, <verse eid="NUM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21" />nipele Ambuje Akunnungu anjamuche nlweseche, ŵandu ŵenu anlwesye ni kunkana, nkaŵeleka ni lutumbo lwenu luyimbe. <verse eid="NUM 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22" />Meesi gagakuichisya malweso gajinjile nnutumbo mwenu ni kuntenda nkaŵeleka ni lutumbo lwenu lunyale.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 5:22">Jwankongwe tajanje, “Elo, Elo.”<verse eid="NUM 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23" />Nipele jwambopesi tagalembe malwesyo gose mu chitabu chekolochekwe ni lipende ni kochesya mmeesi gagakuŵaŵa gala. <verse eid="NUM 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24" />Jwambopesi taching'wesya jwankongwe meesi gagakuichisya malweso nombego tigajinjile mu lutumbo ni kuntesya gampoteche nnope, <verse eid="NUM 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25" />nipele jwambopesi tajigale ajila mbopesi ja utandi kwa ligongo lya wiu kutyochela kwa jwankongwe jo ni kujinyakula paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu ni kujipeleka pa chilisa. <verse eid="NUM 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26" />Nipele, tasapule mwigasa mbopesi ja utandi kwa chikumbuchisyo ni kujitinisya pa chilisa. Kumbesi tang'wesye jwankongwe jo meesi go. <verse eid="NUM 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27" />Naga alinyakesye kwa ungakulupilika wakwe kwa ŵankwakwe, meesi go gagakuichisya malweso tigampeteche kwannope, lutumbo lwakwe lwa uŵelesi tulualibiche ni ngaakombola kuŵeleka. Ni ŵandu wose taimanyilile kuti jwankongwe jo alweseche. <verse eid="NUM 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28" />Nambo iŵaga jwankongwe jo ali jwakulupulichika ni nganakola chilewo, nipele ngagaaŵenga ni takombole kuŵeleka ŵanache.<verse eid="NUM 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29" />Nipele, gelega gali malajisyo gankati ligambo lya wiu iŵaga jwankongwe alombekwe, paakutyoka ni kugona ni jwannume jwine, <verse eid="NUM 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30" />pane jwannume akolaga wiu ligongo lya ŵankwakwe. Tanjimiche jwankongwe jo paujo pa chilisa, ni jwambopesi tatumie lilamulo li kwa jwankongwe jo. <verse eid="NUM 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31" />Jwannume ngaakola ni chilewo chilichose, nambo jwankongwe talamulikwe kwa chilewo chakwe.<verse eid="NUM 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6" />
  <para style="s">Lilamulo lyankati kuŵika nasili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2" />ŵape Ŵaisilaeli malajisyo ga: Iŵaga jwankongwe pane jwannume taŵiche nasili kwa kulumbila, nasili ja kulityosya nsyene kwa ligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu, <verse eid="NUM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3" />nipele, ngasang'wa divai namose nkologo, ngasang'wa chakungwa chachilichose chekolochekwe kutyochela ni sabibu pane chakung'wa chichilichose chakuŵaŵa, ngasang'wa meesi ga sabibu namose kulya sabibu syejiu pane syejumu. <verse eid="NUM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4" />Katema kose katachiŵa mu nasili ngasalya chilichose chachikutyochela ni msabibu, iŵeje mbeju atamuno makoŵa gakwe.<verse eid="NUM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5" />“Moŵa gose ga nasili jakwe ja kuliŵika pajika kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu, ngaamyola umbo syakwe mpaka pachamalichisye ndaŵi sya nasili jakwe ja kuliŵika pajika kwa ligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu, taŵe jwakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, tasilechelele umbo syakwe sileupe. <verse eid="NUM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6" />Moŵa gose pataliŵiche aŵe ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, mundu jo akaŵandichila malilo, <verse eid="NUM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7" />atamuno gaŵeje malilo ga atati ŵao pane achikulugwe, alongo pane alumbugwe akaika kulinyakasya pakuŵa chilosyo cha kuliŵika pajika kwa ligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu chili muntwe mwakwe. <verse eid="NUM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8" />Katema kose katachiŵa mu nasili tachiŵa jwakwe Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="NUM 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9" />“Iŵaga mundu jwalijose awile chisisimuchile chiŵandika najo ni kusitenda umbo syakwe syagosile kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu sikakundikwa, tamyole pa lyuŵa lyakuswejeswa, yaani pa lyuŵa lya saba. <verse eid="NUM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10" />Pa lyuŵa lya nane tapeleche njuŵa siŵili pane ngunda siŵili sya mwana kwa jwambopesi pa nnango wa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11" />Jwambopesi tatyosye jimo jakwe jiŵe mbopesi ja kutyosya sambi ni jine jiŵe mbopesi ja kutinisya, nombejo tantendele ujilanyo, pakuŵa ŵatesile sambi kwa kugaŵandichila malilo. Lyuŵa lilyolyo, tauswejesye ntwe wakwe kwaligongo lya Akunnugu. <verse eid="NUM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12" />Talityosye sooni kwa ligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu kwa moŵa galagala gaŵaliŵichile nasili kuundanda. Moŵa ga ndanda go ngagaŵalanjikwa pakuŵa umbo syakwe syeleu sinyakeswe. Pakuti alityosye sooni kwa Ambuje Akunnungu tatyosye ngondolo tonde jamwana ja chaka chimo jiŵe mbopesi kwalogongo lya chileŵo cho.”<verse eid="NUM 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13" />“Lyele lili lilamulo lya mundu jwaŵisile nasili katema pachamale kutindimisya moŵa gakwe ga kuliŵika pajika kwaligongo lya Ambuje. Tannyichisye pa nnango wa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, <verse eid="NUM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14" />ni kwatyochesya Ambuje Akunnungu inyama yangalema kuŵa mbopesi: Tonde ja ngondolo jamwana ja chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja kutiniswa, ngondolo jankolo ja chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja sambi, ni ngondolo tonde kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja chitendewele, <verse eid="NUM 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15" />pamo ni mbopesi ja utandi ni ja yakung'wa, ni chitundu chachili ni mikate jangataga amila, ni maandasi ga utandi wesyajiche yambone wewanganye ni mauta, ni mikate jakunyilila jepache mauta.”<verse eid="NUM 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16" />“Jwambopesi tantyochesye Ambuje Akunnungu indu yose yo pamo ni mbopesi jakwe ja sambi ni mbopesi ja kutinisya. <verse eid="NUM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17" />Tantyochesye Ambuje Akunnungu ngondolo nti mbopesi ja chitendewele pamo ni chitundu chachili ni mikate jangataga amila ni mbopesi ja utandi ni mbopesi ja yakung'wa. <verse eid="NUM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18" />Pannango wa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, jwanasili jo tamyole umbo syakwe ni kusitaga pa mooto wauli paasi ja mbopesi ja chitendewele.”<verse eid="NUM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19" />“Nipele jwambopesi tajigale likoyo lya ngondolo tonde jila lili lyeteleche pamo ni liandasi limo pamo ni nkate wakunyilila kutyochela mu chitundu, yose yangataga amila, ni kumpa jwa nasili jula, amalaga kumyola umbo syakwe. <verse eid="NUM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20" />Nipele jwambopesi tainyakule indu yo kuŵa mbopesi ja kunyakula paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu; yose yo ili yeswela kwa jwambopesi pamo ni chidali chenyakule ni chiiga chetyosyekwe kuŵa mbopesi. Pakumala yele yose jwa nasili akukombola kung'wa divai.”<verse eid="NUM 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21" />“Gelega ni malamulo kwaligongo lya mundu jwaŵisile nasili juŵalumbilile kwichisya yakupeleka kwa Ambuje Akunnungu. Akukombola kuichisya yakupeleka yakupunda kwa iŵaga akupakombola nambo akusachilwa aichisye kila chindu chalanjile paŵalumbilile paŵaŵikaga nasili jawo.”<verse eid="NUM 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵambopesi kwaŵendela ŵandu upile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23" />“Mwasalile che Haluni ni achiŵanagwe kuti, yele ni itinjile pakwapa upile Ŵaisilaeli:<verse eid="NUM 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24" />Ambuje Akunnungu ampe upile ni kungosa;<verse eid="NUM 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25" />Ambuje Akunnungu annolechesye kwa umbone wakwe ni kuntendela yaili yambone;<verse eid="NUM 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26" />Ambuje Akunnungu annosye chanasa chakwe ni kumpa chitendewele.”<verse eid="NUM 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27" />Kwayele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatite, “Iŵaga che Haluni ni achiŵanagwe tachimenda une kuti naape upile Ŵaisilaeli, tinjapa upile.”<verse eid="NUM 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7" />
  <para style="s">Mbopesi jijatyochekwe ni Ilongola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1" />Che Musa paŵamasile kulijimika Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, ŵalijitilile mauta ni kulitenda liŵe lyakwe Akunnungu pamo ni yoombo yakwe yose, sooni ŵachijitilile chilisa mauta ni kuchitenda chiŵe chakwe Akunnungu pamo ni yoombo yakwe yose. <verse eid="NUM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2" />Pelepo ilongola wa Isilaeli, aŵala achakulu wa mitundu ŵaŵaliji ilongola ŵa ngosyo ŵaŵajimilile ŵandu ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe ŵala, ŵapeleche mbopesi. <verse eid="NUM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3" />Ŵapelechele nti yakupele kwa Ambuje Akunnungu; Mutuka syeunichile sita syakukwekwelemwa ni ng'ombe syankambaku kumi na mbili syasikulima, ng'ombe jimo kwa kila chilongola ni mutuka jimo kwa ilongola ŵaŵili. Pakumala kuityosya paujo pa lisakasa lyeswela, <verse eid="NUM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5" />“Mpochele yaakupeleka yi kuti itumiche kwa masengo ga mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, mwape Ŵalawi, kila mundu malinga ni masengo gatagapanganye.” <verse eid="NUM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6" />Nipele che Musa ŵajigele mutuka syakukwekwelemwa, ni ng'ombe sya nkambaku ni kwapa Ŵalawi. <verse eid="NUM 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7" />Ŵagelishoni ŵapatile mutuka syakukwekwelemwa siŵili ni mikambaku ja ng'ombe ncheche, malinga ni yaikusachilwa pa masengo gawo, <verse eid="NUM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8" />ni Ŵamelali ŵapatile mutuka ncheche syakukwekwelemwa ni ng'ombe syankambaku nane, malinga na yaikusachilwa pa masengo gao. Ni masengo gao gose galiji paasi pa jwakwimilila che Itamali mwana jwa jwambopesi che Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9" />Nambo che Musa nganiŵapa chilichose Ŵakohati pakuŵa ŵanyawo ŵaliji ni masengo ga kugosa indu yeswela yati yasachilwe kujigalikwa mmakoyo.<verse eid="NUM 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10" />Pa lyuŵa lya kuchitenda chilisa chiŵe cha Ambuje Akunnungu kwa kuchijitilila mauta, ilongola wosepe ŵapeleche mbopesi syao paujo pa chilisa. <verse eid="NUM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, “Kila lyuŵa chilongola jumo tatyosye mbopesi jakwe kwa ligongo lya kuchitenda chilisa chiŵe cha Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="NUM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12" />Nipele ajula juŵatyosisye mbopesi pa lyuŵa lyaandanda jwaliji che Nashoni mwana jwa che Aminadabu jwa lukosyo lwa Yuda. <verse eid="NUM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13" />Mbopesi jakwe jaliji: Sahani jimo ja madini ga feza ja chisilo cha kilogilamu moja ni nusu ni bakuli jimo ja feza jajili ni chisilo cha gilamu mia nane malinga ni ipimo yaiŵichikwe pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu; sasahani ni bakuli ili igumbele utandi wesyajiche yambone wewanganye ni mauta ga miseituni kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja utandi; <verse eid="NUM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14" />kasahani kamo ka sahabu kakali ni chisilo cha gilamu mia moja na kumi kali kagumbele ubani; <verse eid="NUM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15" />ng'ombe jankambaku jangakomala; ngondolo tonde jimo ni ngondolo tonde ja chaka chimo, kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja kutinisya: <verse eid="NUM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16" />mbusi tonde jimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja kutyosa sambi; <verse eid="NUM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17" />ng'ombe siŵili syankambaku, ngondolo tonde nsano, mbusi tonde nsano ni ngondolo tonde nsano sya chaka chimo, kwa ligongo lya mbopesi sya chitendewele. Jele jaliji mbopesi ji che Nashoni mwana jwa Aminadabu.<verse eid="NUM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18" />Lyuŵa lyaaŵili, che Netaneli mwana jwa che Suali, chilongola jwa ntundu wa Isakali ŵatyosisye sadaka. <verse eid="NUM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19" />Che Netaneli ŵatyosisye: Sahani jimo ja madini ga feza ja chisilo cha kilogilamu moja ni nusu ni bakuli jimo ja feza jajili ni chisilo cha gilamu mia nane malinga ni ipimo yaiŵichikwe pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu; sahani ni bakuli ili igumbele utandi wesyajiche yambone wewanganye ni mauta ga miseituni kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja utandi; <verse eid="NUM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20" />kasahani kamo ka sahabu kakali ni chisilo cha gilamu mia moja na kumi kali kagumbele ubani; <verse eid="NUM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21" />ng'ombe ja nkambaku jimo jangakomala, ngondolo tonde jimo ni ngondolo tonde jimo ja chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi jakutinisya; <verse eid="NUM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22" />mbusi tonde jimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja sambi; <verse eid="NUM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23" />ng'ombe ŵaŵili syankambaku, ngondolo tonde nsano, mbusi tonde nsano ni ngondolo tonde sya chaka chimo nsano, kwa ligongo lya mbopesi sya chitendewele. Jele jaliji mbopesi ji che Netaneli mwana jwa che Suali.<verse eid="NUM 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24" />Pa lyuŵa lyatatu jaliji samu ja che Eliabu mwana jwa che Heloni chilongola jwa lukosyo lwa Sebuloni. <verse eid="NUM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25" />Mbopesi jakwe jaliji: Sahani jimo ja madini ga feza ja chisilo cha kilo moja ni nusu ni bakuli jimo ja feza jajili ni chisilo cha gilamu mia nane malinga ni ipimo yaiŵichikwe pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, sahani ni bakuli jo ili igumbele utandi wesyajiche yambone wewanganye ni mauta ga miseituni kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja utandi; <verse eid="NUM 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26" />kasahani kamo ka sahabu ka gilamu mia moja na kumi kali kagumbele ubani; <verse eid="NUM 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27" />ng'ombe jankambaku jimo jangakomala, ni ngondolo tonde jimo, ni ngondolo tonde jangakomala ja chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja kutinisya; <verse eid="NUM 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28" />mbusi tonde jimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja sambi; <verse eid="NUM 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29" />mikambaku ja ng'ombe jiŵili, ngondolo tonde nsano, mbusi tonde nsano ni ngondolo tonde syangakomala nsano sya chaka chimichimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja chitendewele. Jele jaliji mbopesi ja che Eliabu mwana jwa che Heloni.<verse eid="NUM 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30" />Lyuŵa lya ncheche jaliji samu ja che Elisuli mwana jwa che Shedeuli, chilongola jwa lukosyo lwa Lobeni. <verse eid="NUM 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31" />Mbopesi jo jaliji; Sahani jimo ja feza ja kilo jimo ni nusu ni bakuli jimo ja feza ja gilamu mia nane malinga ni ipimo yaiŵichikwe pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, sahani ni bakuli ili yegumbale utandi wesyajiche yambone wewanganye ni mauta ga miseituni kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja utandi; <verse eid="NUM 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32" />kasahani kamo ka sahabu ka gilamu mia moja na kumi kali kagumbele ubani; <verse eid="NUM 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33" />ng'ombe jankambaku jimo jamwana, ni ngondolo tonde jimo, ngondolo tonde jangakomala ja chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja kutinisya; <verse eid="NUM 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34" />mbusi tonde jimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja kutyosya sambi; <verse eid="NUM 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35" />ng'ombe sya nkambaku siŵili, ngondolo tonde nsano, mbusi tonde nsano ni ngondolo tonde syangakomala sya chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja chitendewele. Jele jaliji mbopesi ja che Elisuli mwana jwa che Shedeuli.<verse eid="NUM 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36" />Lyuŵa lya nsano lya kutyosya mbopesi jaliji samu ja che Shelumieli mwana jwa che Suli Shadai chilongola jwa lukosyo lwa Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37" />Mbopesi jakwe jaliji: Sahani jimo ja feza ja kilo jimo ni nusu ni bakuli jimo ja feza ja gilamu mia nane malinga ni ipimo yaiŵichikwe pa lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, sahani ni bakuli ili igumbele utandi wesyajiche yambone wewanganye ni mauta ga miseituni kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja utandi; <verse eid="NUM 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38" />kasahani kamo ka sahabu ka gilamu mia moja na kumi kali kagumbele ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39" />ng'ombe jankambaku jimo jangakomala, ni ngondolo tonde jimo, ngondolo tonde jangakomala ja chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja kutinisya, <verse eid="NUM 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40" />mbusi tonde jimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi jakutyosya sambi; <verse eid="NUM 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41" />ng'ombe syankambaku siŵili, ngondolo tonde nsano, mbusi tonde nsano ni ngondolo tonde syangakomala sya chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja chitendewele. Jele jaliji mbopesi ja che Shelumieli mwana jwa che Suli Shadai.<verse eid="NUM 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42" />Lyuŵa lya sita lyakutyosya mbopesi jaliji samu ja che Eliasafu mwana jwa che Deuli chilongola jwa lukosyo lwa Gadi. <verse eid="NUM 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43" />Mbopesi jakwe jaliji: Sahani jimo ja feza ja kilogilamu jimo ni nusu ni bakuli jimo ja feza ja gilamu mia nane malinga ni ipimo yaiŵichikwe pa lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, sahani ni bakuli ili igumbele utandi wesyajiche yambone wewanganye ni mauta kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja yakulya; <verse eid="NUM 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44" />kasahani kamo ka sahabu ka gilamu mia moja na kumi kali kagumbele ubani; <verse eid="NUM 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45" />ng'ombe jankambaku jimo jangakomala, ni ngondolo tonde jimo, ngondolo tonde jangakomala ja chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja kutinisya, <verse eid="NUM 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46" />mbusi tonde jimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi jakutyosya sambi, <verse eid="NUM 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47" />ng'ombe makambaku gaŵili, ngondolo tonde nsano, mbusi tonde nsano ni ngondolo tonde syangakomala sya chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja chitendewele. Jele jaliji mbopesi ja che Eliasafu mwana jwa che Deueli.<verse eid="NUM 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48" />Juŵaichenawo mbopesi pa lyuwa ya saba ŵaliji che Elishama mwana jwa che Amihudi, chilongola jwa lukosyo lwa Efulaimu. <verse eid="NUM 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49" />Mbopesi jakwe jaliji; Sahani jimo ja feza ja njisilo cha kilo jimo ni nusu ni bakuli jimo ja feza ja gilamu mia nane malinga ni ipimo yaiŵichikwe pa lisakasa lyeswela, sahani ni bakuli ili igumbele utandi wesyajiche yambone wewanganye ni mauta kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja yakulya; <verse eid="NUM 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50" />kasahani kamo ka sahabu ka gilamu mia moja na kumi kali kagumbele ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51" />ng'ombe jankambaku jimo jangakomala, ni ngondolo tonde jimo, ngondolo tonde jangakomala ja chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja kutinisya; <verse eid="NUM 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52" />mbusi tonde jimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi jakutyosya sambi; <verse eid="NUM 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53" />ng'ombe mikambaku jiŵili, ngondolo tonde nsano, mbusi tonde nsano ni ngondolo tonde syangakomala sya chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja chitendewele. Jele jaliji mbopesi ja che Elishama mwana jwa che Amihudi.<verse eid="NUM 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54" />Lyuŵa lya nane kutyosya mbopesi jaliji samu ja che Gamalieli mwana jwa che Pedasuli, chilongola jwa lukosyo lwa Manase. <verse eid="NUM 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55" />Mbopesi jao jaliji; Sahani jimo ja feza ja kilo jimo ni nusu ni bakuli jimo ja feza ja gilamu mia nane malinga ni ipimo yaiŵichikwe pa lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, sahani ni bakuli ili igumbele utandi wesyajiche yambone wewanganye ni mauta ga miseituni kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja utandi, <verse eid="NUM 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56" />kasahani kamo ka sahabu ka gilamu mia moja na kumi kali kagumbele ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57" />ng'ombe jankambaku jimo jangakomala, ni ngondolo tonde jimo, ngondolo tonde jangakomala ja chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja kutinisya, <verse eid="NUM 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58" />mbusi tonde jimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi jakutyosya sambi; <verse eid="NUM 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59" />ng'ombe mikambaku jiŵili, ngondolo tonde nsano, mbusi tonde nsano ni ngondolo tonde syangakomala sya chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja chitendewele. Jele jaliji mbopesi ja che Gamalieli mwana jwa che Padasuli.<verse eid="NUM 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60" />Lyuwa lya tisa kutyosya mbopesi jaliji samu ji che Abidani mwana jwa che Gideoni, chilongola jwa lukosyo lwa Benjamini. <verse eid="NUM 7:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61" />Mbopesi jao jaliji; Sahani jimo ja feza ja kilo jimo ni nusu ni bakuli jimo ja feza ja gilamu mia nane malinga ni ipimo yaiŵichikwe pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana ni Akunnungu. Sahani ni bakuli ili igumbele utandi wesyajiche yambone wewanganye ni mauta ga miseituni kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja utandi <verse eid="NUM 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62" />kasahani kamo ka sahabu ka gilamu mia moja na kumi kegumbale ubani; <verse eid="NUM 7:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63" />ng'ombe jankambaku jimo jangakomala, ni ngondolo tonde jimo, ngondolo tonde jangakomala ja chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja kutinisya; <verse eid="NUM 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64" />mbusi tonde jimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi jakutyosya sambi; <verse eid="NUM 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65" />ng'ombe sya nkambaku siŵili, ngondolo tonde nsano, mbusi tonde nsano ni ngondolo tonde syangakomala sya chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja chitendewele. Jele ni jijaliji mbopesi ji che Abidani mwana jwa che Gideoni.<verse eid="NUM 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66" />Lyuŵa lya kumi kutyosya mbopesi jaliji samu ja che Ahieseli mwana jwa che Amishadai, chilongola jwa lukosyo lwa Dani. <verse eid="NUM 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67" />Mbopesi jakwe jaliji: Sahani jimo ja feza ja kilo jimo ni nusu ni bakuli limo lya feza lya gilamu mia nane malinga ni ipimo yaiŵichikwe pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. Sahani ni bakuli ili igumbele utandi wesyajiche yambone wewanganye ni mauta ga miseituni kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja utandi; <verse eid="NUM 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68" />kasahani kamo ka sahabu ka gilamu mia moja na kumi kegumbale ubani; <verse eid="NUM 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69" />ng'ombe jankambaku jimo jangakomala, ni ngondolo tonde jimo, ngondolo tonde jangakomala ja chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja kutinisya; <verse eid="NUM 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70" />mbusi tonde jimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi jakutyosya sambi; <verse eid="NUM 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71" />ng'ombe mikambaku jiŵili, ngondolo tonde nsano, mbusi tonde nsano ni ngondolo tonde syangakomala sya chaka chimochimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja chitendewele. Jele ni jijaliji mbopesi ja che Ahieseli mwana jwa che Amishadai.<verse eid="NUM 7:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72" />Lyuŵa lya kumi na moja kutyosya mbopesi jaliji samu ji che Pagieli mwana jwa che Okilani chilongola jwa lukosyo lwa Asheli. <verse eid="NUM 7:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73" />Mbopesi jakwe jaliji: Sahani jimo ja feza ja kilo jimo ni nusu ni bakuli jimo ja feza ja gilamu mia nane malinga ni ipimo yaiŵichikwe pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. Sahani ni bakuli ili igumbele utandi wesyajiche yambone wewanganye ni mauta ga miseituni kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja utandi, <verse eid="NUM 7:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74" />kasahani kamo ka sahabu ka gilamu mia moja na kumi kegumbale ubani; <verse eid="NUM 7:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75" />ng'ombe nkambaku umo wangakomala, ni ngondolo tonde jimo, ngondolo tonde jangakomala ja chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja kutinisya; <verse eid="NUM 7:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76" />mbusi tonde jimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi jakutyosya sambi; <verse eid="NUM 7:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77" />ng'ombe mikambaku jiŵili, ngondolo tonde nsano, mbusi tonde nsano ni ngondolo tonde syangakomala sya chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja chitendewele. Jele ni jijaliji mbopesi ja che Pagieli mwana jwa Okilani.<verse eid="NUM 7:77" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78" />Ni lyuŵa lya kumi na mbili lya kutyosya mbopesi jaliji samu ji che Ahila mwana jwa che Enani chilongola jwa lukosyo lwa Nafutali. <verse eid="NUM 7:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79" />Mbopesi jakwe jaliji: Sahani jimo ja feza ja kilo jimo ni nusu ni bakuli jimo ja feza ja gilamu mia nane malinga ni ipimo yaiŵichikwe pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. Sahani ni bakuli ili igumbele utandi wesyajiche yambone wewanganye ni mauta ga miseituni kwaligongo lya mbopesi ja utandi, <verse eid="NUM 7:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80" />kasahani kamo ka sahabu ka gilamu mia moja na kumi kegumbale ubani; <verse eid="NUM 7:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81" />ng'ombe nkambaku umo wangakomala, ngondolo tonde ja chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja kutinisya; <verse eid="NUM 7:81" /><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82" />mbusi tonde jimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi jakutyosya sambi; <verse eid="NUM 7:82" /><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83" />ng'ombe mikambaku jiŵili, ngondolo tonde nsano, mbusi tonde nsano ni ngondolo tonde syangakomala sya chaka chimo kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja chitendewele. Jele ni jijaliji mbopesi ja che Ahila mwana jwa Enani.<verse eid="NUM 7:83" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84" />Mbopesi syose sya ilongola ŵa Isilaeli kwa ligongo lya chilisa, pa lyuŵa liŵachityosisye chiŵe cha Ambuje Akunnungu kwa kwitilila mauta, jaliji, Sahani sya feza kumi na mbili, bakuli sya feza kumi na mbili, tusahani kumi nambili twa sahabu. <verse eid="NUM 7:84" /><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85" />Kila sahani ja feza jaliji ni chisilo cha kilo jimo ni nusu ni kila bakuli ja feza jakunyuluchisya jaliji ni gilamu mia nane. Sahani syose syaliji ni chisilo cha kilo ishilini na saba ni gilamu mia sita malinga ni ipimo yaiŵichikwe pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu.<verse eid="NUM 7:85" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86" />Atula tusahani twa sahabu kumi na mbili tutwaliji ni ubani, kila chimo chaliji ni chisilo cha gilamu mia moja na kumi malinga ni ipimo yaikusachilwa pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. Chisilo cha tusahani tose chaliji kilo moja ni gilamu mia tatu na ishilini. <verse eid="NUM 7:86" /><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87" />Inyama yose iyatyosyekwe kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja kutinisya yaliji ng'ombe mikambaku jangakomala kumi na mbili ni ngondolo tonde kumi na mbili, ngondolo tonde sya chaka chimo kumi na mbili, pamo ni mbopesi ja utandi ni mbusi tonde kumi na mbili kwa ligongo lya mbopesi jakutyosya sambi. <verse eid="NUM 7:87" /><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88" />Kwa ligongo lya mbopesi ja chitendewele, inyama yose iyatyosekwe yaliji ng'ombe mikambaku ishilini na nne, ngondolo tonde sitini, mbusi tonde sitini, ni ngondolo tonde sya chaka chimo sitini. Jele jaliji mbopesi jijatyochekwe kwa ligongo lya kuchitenda chilisa chiŵe chakwe Akunnungu, paŵamasile kuchijitilila mauta chilisa.<verse eid="NUM 7:88" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89" />Katema che Musa paŵajinjile mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu ku kukunguluka ni Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵapikene liloŵe cha pachanya pa chiunichilo cha Lisanduku lya lilangano, chichaliji pachanya pa lisanduku lya lilangano, lyalikuŵanjikwa chitengu cha chanasa, kutyochela pasikati pa aila yegumbikwe iŵili yaili ni mapapiko.<verse eid="NUM 7:89" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8" />
  <para style="s">Yakuti pakuŵika imuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2" />“Mwasalile che Haluni kuti katema kachimmiche aila imuli saba mu chindu chakuŵichila imuli, ikusachilwa imulichile kulangusya cha kummbujo kwa chindu chakuŵichila lumuli.” <verse eid="NUM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3" />Che Haluni ŵatesile yeleyo, ŵaiŵisile imuli yo imulichile cha kummbujo kwa chindu chakuŵichila lumuli, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite pakwalajichisya che Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4" />Yele ni iyatite kukolochekwa chindu chakuŵichila lumuli; Chakolochekwe kwa sahabu jesyane kutandilila ku chitamilo chakwe mpaka pa uluwa wakwe. Chindu chakuŵichila lumuli cho chakolochekwe malinga na chisyasyo chati Ambuje Akunngu ŵaalosisye che Musa.<verse eid="NUM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵalawi akuŵichikwa pajika kwaligongo lya Ambuje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5" />Sooni Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6" />“Mwaŵiche pajika Ŵalawi kutyoka kwa Ŵaisilaeli, ni mwatende akundikwe kwa masengo gakupopelela. <verse eid="NUM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7" />Yeleyi ni yachintende: Timwanyuluchisye meesi ga kwaswejechesya, nipele mwasalile amyole chiilu chose, achape yakuwala yao kwayele chaŵe ŵasalele. <verse eid="NUM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8" />Nipele tinjigale ng'ombe nkambaku jangakomala pamo ni mbopesi jakwe ja utandi wesyajiche yambone wewanganye ni mauta ga miseituni, ni mmwe tinjigale ng'ombe nkambaku wine kwa ligongo lya mbopesi jakutyosya sambi. <verse eid="NUM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9" />Timwasonganganye Ŵaisilaeli wose ni kwaichisya Ŵalawi ajime paujo pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10" />Patimwaichisye Ŵalawi kwima paujo pangu, Ŵaisilaeli tiŵasajichile makono pa mitwe, <verse eid="NUM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11" />nipele che Haluni taachaŵika ŵanyawo mbujo nti mbopesi jakunyakula kutyochela kwa Ŵaisilaeli kuti andumichile. <verse eid="NUM 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12" />Nipele, Ŵalawi taŵiche makono gao pa mitwe ja ngombe mikambaku jiŵili jo. Jumo timuntyosye aŵe mbopesi jakutyosya sambi, ni jine timuntyosye aŵe mbopesi jakutinisya, kuti ntendele ujilanyo kwa ligongo lya Ŵalawi.”<verse eid="NUM 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13" />“Nipele timwajimiche Ŵalawi paujo pa che Haluni ni achiŵanagwe, nipele timwatyose nti mbopesi ja kunyakula kukwangu. <verse eid="NUM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14" />Yele ni itimwaŵiche pajika Ŵalawi pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli ŵane kuti aŵe ŵangu. <verse eid="NUM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15" />Pakumala kwatenda aŵe ŵakukundikwa kwa mapopelelo Ŵalawi ni kwatyosya nti mbopesi ja kunyakula tajinjile kuti andumichile mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana. <verse eid="NUM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16" />Ŵanyawo atyosyekwe kukwakungu kusyenesyene, pamalo pa ŵakwitiwo ŵa Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17" />Pakuŵa ipago yaandanda yose pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli ali ŵangu une, iŵeje ŵandu pane inyama; ligongo panauleje ŵanache ŵa kwitiwo wose ŵa pa Misili naaŵisile ŵanyawo pajika aŵe ŵangu nansyene. <verse eid="NUM 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18" />Sambano naajigele Ŵalawi pamalo pa ipago ya kwitiwo ya Ŵaisilaeli, <verse eid="NUM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19" />ni naapele che Haluni ni achiŵanagwe nti ntuka kutyochela kwa Ŵaisilaeli, kuti atende masengo mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwa ligongo lya Ŵaisilaeli ni kwatendela ujilanyo, kuti pakatyochela yangalumbana yaikukombola kwaputa Ŵaisilaeli patachiŵandichila peuto papaswela.”<verse eid="NUM 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20" />Kwayele che Musa ni che Haluni ni nsongangano wose wa Ŵaisilaeli ŵatyosisye Ŵalawi aŵe ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite pakwalajisya che Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21" />Ŵalawi ŵaliswejesye sambi syao ni kuchapa yakuwala yao, che Haluni ŵaatyosisye nti mbopesi ja kunyakula paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. Nombe che Haluni ŵatesile ujilanyo kwa ligongo lya kwaswejesya. <verse eid="NUM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22" />Pakumala yeleyo, Ŵalawi ŵatandite kupanganya masengo gawo pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu kwakuimililwa ni che Haluni ni achiŵanagwe, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵalajisye che Musa.<verse eid="NUM 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24" />“Kila Mlawi jwannume jwali ni yaka ishilini na tano pane kupunda, tatumichile pa Lisakasa lyangu lya Kusimanilana, <verse eid="NUM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25" />nambo pataichile lisusa lya yaka hansini akajendelechela kupanganya masengo. <verse eid="NUM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26" />Pelepo akukombola kwakamusya Ŵalawi achinjao patachitumichila pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, nambo jwalijose ngaakundikwa kutumichila jika. Yele ni itimwapanjile masengo Ŵalawi.”<verse eid="NUM 8:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9" />
  <para style="s">Pasaka jaaŵili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1" />Nipele, pa mwesi wandanda wa chaka chaaŵili pakumala Ŵaisilaeli kutyoka ku Misili, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵakungulwiche ni che Musa ku chipululu cha ku Sinai achitiji, <verse eid="NUM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2" />“Waisilaeli atende chindimba cha Pasaka katema kakaŵichikwe. <verse eid="NUM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3" />Yele chiiŵe pa lyuŵa lya kumi na nne lya mwesi wu, katema ka ligulo tatende yeleyo malinga ni malajisyo gakwe ni malamusi gakwe.” <verse eid="NUM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4" />Kwayele, che Musa ŵaasalile Ŵaisilaeli atende chindimba cha Pasaka, <verse eid="NUM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5" />nombe ŵanyawo ŵatesile yeleyo ku lipululu lya Sinai katema ka lyuŵa kutiŵila, pa lyuŵa lya kumi na nne lya mwesi waandanda. Ŵaisilaeli ŵatesile kila chindu mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite kwalajichisya che Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6" />Nambo, ŵandu ŵane nganakombola kutenda chindimba cha Pasaka palyuŵa lila, pakuŵa ŵaliji akwaiye malilo ŵaliji ŵangakundikwa pa paujo pa akunnungu. Ŵanyawo ŵajaulile che Musa ni che Haluni lyuŵa lilalila, <verse eid="NUM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7" />ŵaasalile cha Musa, “Uweji tuli ŵangakundikwa paujo pa Akunnungu pakuŵa tugakwaiye malilo, nambo kwa chichi ngatukukundikwa kwatyochesya Ambuje Akunnungu mbopesi syakwe ni Ŵaisilaeli achinjetu kwa katema kakaŵichikwe?”<verse eid="NUM 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8" />Che Musa ŵajanjile, “Nlinde kaje mpaka pachimbate malajisyo gagakungamba ŵanyamwe kutyochela kwa Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="NUM 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9" />Pelepo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10" />ŵaasalile Ŵaisilaeli kuti, “Jumo jwenu pane jumo mwa iŵelesi yenu aŵaga ngakukundikwa ni Akunnungu kwa ligongo lya kugakwaya malilo pane aŵaga mu ulendo namose yeleyo akukombola kutenda chindimba cha Pasaka ja Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11" />Mundu jwanti yele akukombola kutenda yele mwesi umo waukukuya, ligulo lya lyuŵa lya kumi na nne pa mwesi waaŵili. Tatende kwa kulya ngondolo jangakomala ni mikate jangataga amila ni mboga jajikuŵaŵila. <verse eid="NUM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12" />Akasigasya chakulya chilichose mpaka kundaŵi, namose kukasanya liupa limo lya chinyama cha Pasaka. Tatende chindimba cha Pasaka malinga ni mashelaiti gakwe gose. <verse eid="NUM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13" />Nambo mundu jwalijose jwakukundikwa ni nganaŵa mu ulendo, naga ngakutenda chindimba cha Pasaka, tachiŵikwa kwa kutalichila ni ŵandu ŵakwe pakuŵa nganandyochesya mbopesi kwa katema kakaŵichikwe. Mundu jo tajamuchikwe kwa ligongo lya sambi jakwe.”<verse eid="NUM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14" />“Iŵaga kwana jwannendo jwakutama pamo ni ŵanyamwe ni akusaka kutenda chindimba cha Pasaka, mundu jo akusachilwa atende yeleyo malinga ni malamusi ni malajisyo gose ga Pasaka. Kila mundu tagakuye malamusi galagala aŵe jwannendo pane nsyene musi.”<verse eid="NUM 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liunde lya mooto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 40:34-38">Kutyoka 40:34-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15" />Pa lyuŵa lilyajimichikwe Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, liunde lyatulwiche ni kuliunichila Lisakasa lyo. Katema ka chilo liunde lyo lyawoneche nti mooto mpaka kundaŵi. <verse eid="NUM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16" />Yeleyo ni iyatendekwaga kila lyuŵa, liunde lyaunichilaga Lisakasa muusi ni chilo lyawonekaga nti mooto. <verse eid="NUM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17" />Katema kose liunde lyo palyatokaga pachanya pa Lisakasa, Ŵaisilaeli ŵasyamisye chigono ni kuŵika chigono sooni liuto lyalikwima liunde lyo. <verse eid="NUM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18" />Ŵajesile kwa malajisyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu ni kuŵika chigono sooni kwa malajisyo ga Akunnungu. Katema kose liunde lyo palyaliji pachanya lisakasa, ŵandu ŵasigele pachigono cho. <verse eid="NUM 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19" />Katema liunde palyasigalile pachanya lisakasa kwa moŵa gamajinji, Ŵaisilaeli ŵaajitichisye Ambuje Akunnungu ni nganatyoka. <verse eid="NUM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20" />Katema kane liunde lyo nganilitamilisya pachanya lisakasa, kwa malajisyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu akaŵisile chigono ni sooni kwa malajisyo gakwe akatyosile. <verse eid="NUM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21" />Katema kane liunde lyatemi pachanya lisakasa kutandilila ligulo mpaka kundaŵi, ni palyatokaga kundaŵi ŵandu ŵautandaga ulendo. Naga lili pachanya lisakasa muusi wose ni chilo ŵanyawo nganatyokaga mpaka palyatokoga liunde. <verse eid="NUM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22" />Yaŵaga liunde litemi pachanya lisakasa kwa moŵa gaŵili pane mwesi pane chaka, Ŵaisilaeli nganaasamaga; nambo liunde palyanyakulikwaga nombe ŵanyawo ŵasamile. <verse eid="NUM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23" />Ŵaŵisile chigono kwa lilajisyo lya Ambuje Akunnungu, ni sooni ŵajesile kwa lilajisyo lya Ambuje. Ŵakamwile lilamulo lya Ambuje Akunnungu mpela iŵatite pakulajisya kwa litala lya che Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10" />
  <para style="s">Mapenenga gakolochekwe kwa madini ga feza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2" />“Njigale madini ga feza nkasyane mapenenga gaŵili. Mapenenga go tintumie katema ka kwaŵilanga ŵandu ni katema ka kusamisya chigono. <verse eid="NUM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3" />Mapenenga gose gaŵili gagombekwaga kwanakamo, ŵandu wose tasongangane paujo penu pa nnango wa kwinjilila pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4" />Nambo lyagombekwaga lipenenga limo pe, nipele ilongola wa ngosyo sya Isilaeli pe tasongangane paujo penu. <verse eid="NUM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5" />Katema patikupikaniche kusona kwa lipenenga kwa kumanyisya kutanda ulendo, ŵakutama mu igono ya kungopochelo lyuŵa tautande ulendo. <verse eid="NUM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6" />Kwapikanikaga kusona kwaaŵili kwanti iyoyo, aŵala ŵaali mu igono yaili chakulujenda tatande kutyoka. Chimanyisyo cha kusona kwa lipenenga lyo chichityosekwe kila katema ka kuutanda ulendo. <verse eid="NUM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7" />Katema ka kwaŵilanga ŵandu asongangane pamo, mapenenga tigagombekwe, nambo nkagomba mapenenga kwa kusona kwakukumanyisya kuutanda ulendo. <verse eid="NUM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8" />Mapenenga go tigagombekwe ni ŵanache ŵa che Haluni, ŵaali ŵambopesi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 10:8">“Lyele tiliŵe lilajisyo lya moŵa gose mu iŵelesi yenu yose. <verse eid="NUM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9" />Katema kachimputane ngondo ni achammagongo ŵenu ŵakungunguluchila mu chilambo chenu, tinchigomba mapenenga ga kwamanyisya ngondo. Pelepo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu tachinkumbuchila ni kunkulupusya kutyochela kwa ŵammagongo ŵenu. <verse eid="NUM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10" />Iyoyopeyo mmoŵa genu gankusengwa mpela ila, mu chindimba cha kwoneka kwa mwesi ni indimba ine, tinchigomba mapenenga ga katema katinchityosya mbopesi syenu sya kutinisya ni mbopesi syenu sya chitendewele. Pelepo une Akunnungu ŵenu tinankumbuchile. Une ndili Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu.”<verse eid="NUM 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵaisilaeli akusamisya chigono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11" />Pa lyuŵa lya ishilini lya mwesi waaŵili, chaka chaaŵili kutandilila Ŵaisilaeli paŵatyosile ku Misili, liunde lilyaliji pachanya Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu lyanyakulikwe, <verse eid="NUM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12" />nombe Ŵaisilaeli ŵautandite ulendo kutyoka ku chipululu cha Sinai, ni ŵajesile mpaka liunde palyatusile ku chipululu cha Palani.<verse eid="NUM 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13" />Ni ŵautandite ulendo kaandanda kwa lilajisyo lya Ambuje Akunnungu mpela iŵansalile che Musa. <verse eid="NUM 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14" />Aŵala uŵaliji paasi pa bendela ja mpingo wa lukosyo lwa Yuda, ŵalongolele ni mipingo jao. Chilongola jwao ŵaliji che Nashoni mwana jwa che Aminadabu. <verse eid="NUM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15" />Nesaneli mwana jwa che Shuali jwaliji chilongola jwa mpingo wa lukosyo lwa Isakali. <verse eid="NUM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16" />Nombe che Eliabu mwana jwa che Heloni jwaliji chilongola jwa mpingo wa lukosyo lwa Sebuloni.<verse eid="NUM 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17" />Nipele, ŵaaligumwile Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, ni ŵandu ŵa ntundu wa Gelishoni ni wa Melali ŵaŵajigele lisakasa lyo ŵatandite kutyoka.<verse eid="NUM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18" />Nipele ŵakuiye ŵaŵaliji paasi pa bendela ja mipingo ja lukosyo lwa Lobeni. Chilongola jwao jwaliji che Elisuli mwana jwa che Shedeuli. <verse eid="NUM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19" />Shelumieli mwana jwa che Suli Shadai ŵalongwesye lukosyo lwa Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20" />Nombe che Eliasafu mwana jwa che Deueli ŵalongwesye lukosyo lwa Gadi.<verse eid="NUM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21" />Nipele ŵakuiye Ŵakohati ali ajigele yoombo yeswela. Paŵaiche Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu lyaliji chile lyejimiche.<verse eid="NUM 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22" />Pakumala ŵanyawo, ŵakuiye ŵandu ŵaŵaliji paasi pa bendela cha lukosyo lwa Efulaimu, ni mipingo jose. Chilongola jwao ŵaliji che Elishama mwana jwa che Amihudi. <verse eid="NUM 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23" />Che Gamalieli mwana jwa che Pedasuli ŵalongwesye mipingo ja lukosyo lwa Manase, <verse eid="NUM 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24" />nombe che Abidani mwana jwa che Gideoni ŵalongwesye lukosyo lwa Benjamini.<verse eid="NUM 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25" />Pambesi aŵala ŵaŵaliji paasi pa bendela ja mpingo uwalongoswaga ni lukosyo lwa Dani, ŵaliji mpela ŵakulindilila cha panyuma pa mipingo jose, ŵajesile mpingo ni mpingo. Che Ahieseli mwana jwa che Amishadai ŵaliji chilongola jwao. <verse eid="NUM 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26" />Che Pagieli mwana jwa che Okilani ŵalongwesye lukosyo lwa Asheli. <verse eid="NUM 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27" />Nombe che Ahila mwana jwa che Enani ŵalongwesye lukosyo lwa Nafutali. <verse eid="NUM 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28" />Wele ni ukotopasyo wa kutyoka uŵaukuiye Ŵaisilaeli malinga ni mipingo jao, kila paŵasyamisyaga chigono kwendelechela ni ulendo.<verse eid="NUM 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29" />Che Musa ŵansalile che Hobabu juŵaliji alambagwe mwana jwa che Leueli. Che Leueli ju ŵaliji akwegwawo che musa mundu jwa ku Midiani, “Uweji tuli mu ulendo kwaula kwati Ambuje Akunnungu atite, ‘Tinampe ŵanyamwe peuto po.’ Ayaga twende pamo nowe tutuntendele yambone, pakuwa Ambuje Akunnungu alanjile kutupa uweji Ŵaisilaeli indu yambone.” <verse eid="NUM 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30" />Nambo che Hobabu ŵajanjile, “Une nganongana ni ŵanyamwe, nguuja ku chilambo changu ni kwa achalongo achinjangu.” <verse eid="NUM 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31" />Che Musa ŵaasalile, “Choonde nkatuleka, pakuŵa mmwe nkuchimanyilila chipululu chi, nkukombola kutulosya peuto patukukombola kuŵika chigono. <verse eid="NUM 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32" />Sooni mwalonganaga ni uwe chilichose chambone chichatutendele Ambuje Akunnungu ni mmwe chituntendele iyoyo.”<verse eid="NUM 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulendo ukutanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33" />Nipele ŵatandite kutyoka ku Sinai chitumbi cha Ambuje Akunnungu, ni kwa moŵa gatatu ŵajesile akuno Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu lichilongolelaga mmbujo mwao kwa moŵa gatatu go kwasosela liuto lya kuŵika chigono. <verse eid="NUM 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34" />Kila lyuŵa paŵajesile, liunde lya Ambuje Akunnungu lyaliji pachanya pao muusi.<verse eid="NUM 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35" />Katema kose lisanduku palyatokaga, che Musa ŵatite, “Njimuche Ambuje Akunnungu, mwapwilinganye achamagongo ŵenu, ni aŵala ŵakunchima autuche paujo penu.” <verse eid="NUM 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36" />Katema kose Lisanduku lya Lilangano palyajimi che Musa ŵatite, “Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu mwaujile Ŵaisilaeli ŵaali ŵajinji nnope.”<verse eid="NUM 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11" />
  <para style="s">Mooto kutyochela kwa Ambuje Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1" />Ŵandu ŵatandite kwadandaulila Ambuje Akunnungu ligongo lya masausyo gawo. Ambuje Akunnungu paŵapikene yaachimile kwannope ŵaatuluchisye mooto. Mooto wo wakolele pasikati jao, wachomile upande umo wa chigono. <verse eid="NUM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2" />Ŵandu ŵalilile che Musa, nombejo ŵampopelele Ambuje Akunnungu ni mooto ula wasimiche. <verse eid="NUM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3" />Kwayele peuto pala paŵilanjikwe Tabela, pakuŵa pelepo mooto wa Ambuje Akunnungu wakolele pasikati ja ŵandu.<verse eid="NUM 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Musa akwasagula ilongola sabini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4" />Pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli kwaliji ni wandu ŵangaŵa Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵaliji ni lung'wanu lwa kulya nyama. Ŵaisilaeli nombe ŵatandite kulila achitiji, “Mbaya tukapatile nyama tulye! <verse eid="NUM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5" />Tukukumbuchila somba sitwalyaga ku Misili pangalipila, mataanga, matikiti ni mboga, ni itunguu ni itunguu saumu! <verse eid="NUM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6" />Nambo sambano machili gatumalile ni nganitukola lungwanu lwa kulya ine ni pelepa ngapagwa chakulya chine ikaŵe mana peji!”<verse eid="NUM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7" />Mana jaliji mpela songolo sya mapemba, langi jakwe jaliji nti manjano gepauche. <verse eid="NUM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8" />Mana jo jagwaga chilo pa chigono pamo ni mangame. <verse eid="NUM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9" />Kundaŵi ŵandu ŵajaulaga ni kujikumbikanya, nipele ŵajisyajile kwa maganga ga kusyajila pane ŵatwele mmatuli, nipele ŵateleche nnyiŵiga pane kukolosya maandasi. Unonye wakwe waliji mpela maandasi gagakolochekwe kwa mauta ga seituni.<verse eid="NUM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10" />Che Musa ŵaapikene ŵandu ŵa kila ulongo ali nkudandaula ali ajimi mu minango jamasakasa gawo. Nipele uchimwa wa Ambuje Akunungu wakolele, ni che Musa nombe ŵaatumbilile. <verse eid="NUM 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11" />Pelepo che Musa ŵaausisye Ambuje Akunnungu, “Kwachichi kundendela yangalumbana une jwakutumichila jwenu? Nantendele chichichi cha kunchima mpaka kuumba mesengo gakulema ga kwalongosya ŵandu wose ŵa? <verse eid="NUM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12" />Uli uneji ni unaŵeleche kwampaka muusalile naajigale ni kwalela mpela jwakulela yakuti kunjigala mwanache jwannandi, ni kwajausya mpaka ku chilambo chimwalanjile kwapa achinangolo ŵao? <verse eid="NUM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13" />Timbate kwapi nyama jampaka jakwanile ŵele ŵandu wose ŵa? Ligongo akwendelechela kundilila une achitiji naape nyama alye. <verse eid="NUM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14" />Uneji jikape ngangukombola kwalela ŵandu wose ŵa, gele gali masengo gakutopa kukwangu. <verse eid="NUM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15" />Iŵaga timundendele yeleyi, mbaya muumulaje sambano jino! Iŵaga nkuungolela chanasa, nkaaneka nagawone masausyo gangu.”<verse eid="NUM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16" />Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa kuti, “Mwasonganganye achachekulu sabini ŵa Ŵaisilaeli ŵankwamanyilila mmwe kuti akuchimbichikwa ni kukundikwa ni ŵandu nti ilongola, mwaichisye ku Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, ajimeje kuŵandikana ni mmwe. <verse eid="NUM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17" />Tinduluche kweleko kukunguluka nomwe, tinyigale sehemu ja machili ga mbumu jangu, ni une tiimiche sehemu ja machili go kwa ŵele ŵandu wo, kwapele chakombole kukamulangana nomwe pakwalela ŵandu ŵa, nkagatenda masengo go jika. <verse eid="NUM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18" />Sambano mwasalile ŵandu yeleyi: ‘Nliswejesye kwaligongo lya malaŵi pachinlye nyama. Ambuje Akunnungu apilikene nchililaga ni kusala kuti ngapagwa jwakumpanga nyama, ni kuti mwaliji chenene pamwaliji ku Misili. Sambano Ambuje Akunnungu tachimpanga nyama, ni ŵanyamwe nkusachilwa nlyeje. <verse eid="NUM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19" />Nyama jo tinchilya, ngaŵa pa lyuŵa limo pe pane moŵa gaŵili pane nsano pane likumi pane moŵa ishilini, <verse eid="NUM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20" />nambo kwa mwesi wosepe wene, tinchilya mpaka tijimpesye ni kuntindikwa mpaka tiinchime. Yele yose yo ligongo munkanile Ambuje Akunnungu ŵali apano pasikati penu, ni kulila paujo pakwe nchitiji kuti mbaya ngankatyoche ku Misili.’”<verse eid="NUM 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21" />Nambo che Musa ŵaasalile Ambje Akunnungu kuti, “Ŵandu ugwalongosya apano ali laki sita ŵakwenda wamakongolo, nomwe nkuti timwape nyama kwa mwesi wantundu! <verse eid="NUM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22" />Ana ikomboleka kusinga ngondolo ni ng'ombe syakwanila? Uli somba syosye sya mubahali siloposekwe kwaligongo lyao kuti syakwane?” <verse eid="NUM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanjanjile che Musa kuti, “Uli ana ukombole wangu upungwiche? Sambano tinnyiwone iŵaga liloŵe lyangu tiliŵe lisyene pane ngaŵa.”<verse eid="NUM 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24" />Nipele che Musa ŵajawile kwamanyisya ŵandu aila yaŵechete Ambuje Akunnungu. Nipele, ŵaasonganyisye achachekulu sabini kutyochela pasikati ja achachekulu ilongola ni ŵajimiche kusyungula lisakasa. <verse eid="NUM 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25" />Pelepo, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatulwiche mwiunde ni kukunguluka ni che Musa. Nipele ŵajigele sehemu ja machili ga mbumu jiŵampele che Musa ni kwapa aŵala achachekulu sabini ŵala. Mbumu paŵatulwiche pachanya pao, ŵatandite kulondola, nambo nganaujila sooni kutenda yeleyo.<verse eid="NUM 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26" />Nambo achachekulu ŵaŵili pasikati ja aŵala sabini ŵaŵasagulikwe ŵala, meena gao che Elidadi ni che Medadi, ŵasigalile pachigono achinjawo paŵaliji ali apite ku Lisakasa. Nambo mbumu ŵaatuluchile mmomo mu chigono mo, ni ŵatandite kulondola pamalo paŵaliji. <verse eid="NUM 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27" />Jwanchanda jumo ŵautwiche ni kwasalila che Musa kuti, “Che Elidadi ni che Medadi akulondolanga ku chigono ko.” <verse eid="NUM 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28" />Pelepo che Yoshua mwana jwa che Nuni, juŵaliji nkamusi jwa che Musa kutandilila uchanda wakwe, ŵansalile che Musa kuti, “Ambuje ŵangu, mwakanye!” <verse eid="NUM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29" />Nambo che Musa ŵanjanjile kuti, “Uli, nkuungolela wiu? Ngulajila ŵandu wose ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu akaŵele ŵakulondola ni kuti Ambuje akaŵisile Mbumu jakwe pachanya pao!” <verse eid="NUM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30" />Nipele che Musa ni aŵala achachekulu ŵa Ŵaisilaeli ŵausile ku chigono.<verse eid="NUM 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ambuje Akunnungu akwajauchisya ngwale pachigono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31" />Kanyuma Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaichisye mbungo chisisimuchile, ŵaichisye ngwale kutyochela ku bahali ni kwatesya atule mungulugulu chigono, utaliche wa kilometa syejinji kosekose kusyungula chigono, ŵaliunjiche chiŵandika mita jimo kutyochela paasi. <verse eid="NUM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32" />Nipele, palyuŵa lilyolyo, muusi ni chilo, ni pa lyuŵa lyaaŵili lyakwe ŵandu ŵaliji ni masengo gakukumbikanya ngwale; nganapagwa mundu juŵasongangenye kupungula kilo elufu moja. Ŵaajanichile palipose mungulugulu chigono kuti ajumusye. <verse eid="NUM 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33" />Nyama jili chiŵela jejinji, ni ŵandu akanaamale kulya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatumbilile ŵandu, ŵaaputile kwa iputiko yekulungwa kwannope. <verse eid="NUM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34" />Kwapele pamalo po paŵilanjikwe Kibiloti Hataava; ligongo kweleko ni kuŵaasichile ŵandu ŵaŵaliji ŵalukowo.<verse eid="NUM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35" />Kutyochela pele Kibiloti Hataava po ŵandu ŵajesile mpaka ku Haseloti, ŵaŵisile chigono chao ni kutama kweleko.<verse eid="NUM 11:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12" />
  <para style="s">Che Miliamu akwamuchikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1" />Nipele che Miliamu ni che Haluni ŵatandite kummechetela yangalumbana che Musa, ligongo ŵanlombile jwankongwe jwa ku Kushi. <verse eid="NUM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2" />Ŵatite, “Uli isyene kuti Ambuje Akunnungu aŵechete kwa litala li che Musa jika pe? Uli nganaŵecheta kwa litala lya uweji nombe?” Ambuje Akunnungu ŵagapikene maloŵe go. <verse eid="NUM 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3" />Che Musa ŵaliji mundu jwakutulala kwapunda ŵandu wose ŵaŵaliji pa chilambo. <verse eid="NUM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4" />Papopo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, che Haluni ni che Miliamu, “Njisangane mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, ŵanawose ŵatatu.” Nipele, wose ŵatatu ŵapite ku Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana. <verse eid="NUM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5" />Pelepo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatulwiche mu chiimila cha liwunde, ŵajimi pa nnango wa Lisakasa, ŵawilasile che Haluni ni che Miliamu. Wose ŵaŵili ŵasejelele mbujo. <verse eid="NUM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile, “Mpilikane maloŵe gangu. Apagwaga jwakulondola pasikati jenu, une Ambuje Akunnungu ngulimanyukusya kukwakwe mu yakwiwona ni kukunguluka nawo mu sagamisi. <verse eid="NUM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7" />Nambo ngaŵa kwa jwakutumichila jwangu che Musa, ŵele ali ŵakukulupilichika mu kwalongosya ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8" />Une nguŵecheta nao tulinkulolegana, pangasisika ni ngaŵa kwa itagu. Ŵelewo akumona uwele wangu une Ambuje Akunnungu. Kwa chichi nganinjogopa kuŵechete yangalumbana nkati jwakutumichila jwangu che Musa?”<verse eid="NUM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9" />Pelepo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatumbilile kwannope, ni ŵatyosile. <verse eid="NUM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10" />Liunde lyatosile pachanya pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana, papopo che Miliamu ŵaoneche ali ni matana, geswela mbee. Che Haluni paŵagalawiche ni kunnola che Miliamu ŵasimosile kwawona akwete matana. <verse eid="NUM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11" />Pelepo che Haluni ŵaasalile che Musa, “Alakwe ambuje ŵangu, nkatulechelela tulaje kwanti yeleyi pakuŵa tutesile indu yakuloŵela ni kutenda sambi. <verse eid="NUM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12" />Nkanneka che Miliamu aŵe mpela mwanache jwamwana jwapagwile ali jwammwe, jwati nusu ja chiilu chakwe chihalibiche.” <verse eid="NUM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13" />Che Musa ŵaalilile Ambuje Akunnungu achitiji, “Ngunchondelela alakwe Akunnungu, munnamye.” <verse eid="NUM 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14" />Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, “Naga atati gwe akansunile mata kumeso, uli ngaakakole soni kwa moŵa saba? Nipele muntyosye paasa chigono atame kweleko moŵa saba, syamalaga timwauchisye sooni pachigono.” <verse eid="NUM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15" />Kwayele ŵankopwesye che Miliamu paasa chigono kwa moŵa saba. Ŵandu nganajendelechela ni ulendo mpaka paŵammuchisye che Miliamu pachigono. <verse eid="NUM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16" />Pakumala yeleyo ŵandu ŵatandite ulendo kutyochela ku Haseloti, ŵaŵisile chigono ku chipululu cha Palani.<verse eid="NUM 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13" />
  <para style="s">Ŵandu akutumikwa kuchiuchilichisya chilambo cha ku Kanaani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:19-33">Chikumbuchisyo cha Malajisyo 1:19-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasaalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2" />“Mwasagule ŵandu ajaule akachiuchilichisye chilambo cha Kaanani chingwapa Ŵaislaeli. Timunjausye mundu jumojumo kutyochela mu kila lukosyo, ni mundu jo aŵeje chilongola jwa lukosyo lwakwe.”<verse eid="NUM 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3" />Nipele che Musa ŵaapeleche ŵandu kutyochela ku chipululu cha Palani malinga ni malajisyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu. Ŵandu wose ŵaŵatumikwe ŵaliji ilongola ŵa ngosyo sya Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4" />Meena gao ni aga: Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Lobeni, che Shammu mwana ju che Sakuli.<verse eid="NUM 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Simeoni, ŵampeleche che Shafati mwanache ju che Holi.<verse eid="NUM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Yuda, ŵampeleche che Kalebu mwana ju che Yefune.<verse eid="NUM 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Isakali, ŵampeleche che Igali mwana ju che Yusufu.<verse eid="NUM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa che Efulaimu, ŵampeleche che Hoshea mwana jwa che Nuni.<verse eid="NUM 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Benjamini, ŵampeleche che Paliti mwana jwa che Lafu.<verse eid="NUM 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Sabuloni, ŵampeleche che Gadieli mwana jwa che Sodi.<verse eid="NUM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Yusufu (Yaani lukosyo lwa che Manase), ŵampeleche che Gadi mwana jwa che Susi.<verse eid="NUM 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Dani, ŵampeleche che Amieli mwana jwa che Gemali.<verse eid="NUM 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Asheri, ŵampeleche che Setuli mwana jwa che Mikaeli.<verse eid="NUM 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Nafutali, ŵampeleche che Nabi mwana jwa che Wofisi.<verse eid="NUM 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Gadi, ŵampeleche che Geueli mwana jwa che Maki.<verse eid="NUM 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16" />Gelega ni meena ga ŵandu ŵati che Musa ŵatumile kuti ajaule akachiulichisye chilambo cha Kanaani. Che Musa ŵampele che Hosea mwana jwa che Nuni liina lyampya, wammilasile che Yoshua.<verse eid="NUM 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17" />Paŵatumile kwaula kukuuchilichisya chilambo cha Kanaani, che Musa ŵaasalile, “Kutyochela pelepa njaulangane chakumpoto ni kwinjila ku Negebu yaani chakulujenda kwa chilambo cha Kanaani, pakumala pelepo njendelechele mpaka ku chilambo cha itumbi, <verse eid="NUM 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18" />nkachiuchilichisye chilambo cho chili chanti uli. Nkauchilichisye naga ŵandu ŵakutama mwelemo ali ni machili pane nganakola machili, atupile pane nganatupa. <verse eid="NUM 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19" />Nkachiuchilichisye chilambo cho chili chambone pane ngaŵa chambone, ni iŵaga akutama mu igono pane mmajumba gesyunguchisye makome. <verse eid="NUM 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20" />Mmuchilichisye nombe naga chilambo chisyene chana chajila pane ngwamba, naga china itela pane nganichikola itela. Nkajigale munkukombolela isogosi impepe ya kweleko.” Katema ko kaliji katema ka kutanda kwiula sabibu. <verse eid="NUM 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21" />Nipele, ŵandu wo ŵapite ni kuchiuchilichisya chilambo kutyochela ku chipululu cha Sini mpaka ku Lehobu, chiŵandi ni malo jakwinjilila ku Hamati. <verse eid="NUM 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22" />Ŵapite mpaka ku Negebu, ŵapitile mpaka ku musi wa Hebuloni. Kwele ŵaasimene Ŵaahimani, Ŵasheshai ni Ŵatalimai, uŵelesi wa Ŵaanaki. Musi wa Hebuloni wataŵikwe yaka saba ukanaŵe kutaŵikwa musi wa Soani wauli ku chilambo cha Misili. <verse eid="NUM 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23" />Paŵaiche ku lichemba lya Eshikoli, ŵandu wo ŵakatile chisagwa cha sabibu chichaliji ni isogosi yejinji ni chaliji chakutopa kwannope. Chisagwa cho chajigalikwe kwa chisanyasanya ni ŵandu ŵaŵili. Ŵagajigele ni makomamanga pamo ni tini. <verse eid="NUM 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24" />Peuto po paŵilanjikwe Lichemba lya Eshikoli ligongo lya achila chisagwa chati Ŵaisilaeli ŵachikatile kutyochela peuto po.<verse eid="NUM 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25" />Paŵamasile kuchiuchilichisya chilambo kwa moŵa alobaini ŵandu ŵala ŵausile. <verse eid="NUM 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26" />Ŵaajaulile che Musa ni che Haluni ni nsongangano wose ku Kadeshi, ku chipululu cha Palani, ŵapeleche ngani ja indu yose iŵaiweni ni kwalosya isogosi iŵaijigele. <verse eid="NUM 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27" />Ŵaasalile che Musa, “Twaiche ku chilambo chimwatutumile kuchiuchilichisya, chilambo chambone chachikufai kwa kulima ni kulanga, chisagwa chi chili isogosi ya kweleko. <verse eid="NUM 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28" />Nambo, achinsyene chilambo wo akwete machili nnope ni misi jao jikusile nnope ni jisyunguchikwe ni makome. Kupunda yele, kweleko twaweni ŵandu ŵa uŵelesi u che Anaki. <verse eid="NUM 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29" />Ŵaamaleki akutama ku Negebu. Ŵahiti ni Ŵayebusi pamo ni Ŵaamoli akutama ku chilambo cha itumbi ni Ŵakanaani akutama chiŵandi ni bahali ja Meditelania ni mungulugulu mwa lusulo lwa Yolodani.”<verse eid="NUM 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30" />Nambo che Kalebu ŵamyalesye ŵandu paujo pa che Musa achitiji, “Tujaule chitema tukachijigale chilambo cho chiŵe chetu. Pakuŵa tukwete ukombole wa kwapunda.” <verse eid="NUM 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31" />Nambo ŵandu ŵaŵalongene nao kukuuchulichisya chilambo ŵatite, “Ngatukombola kuputana ni ŵandu wo, ŵanyawo akwete machili kutupunda uweji.” <verse eid="NUM 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32" />Kwayele ŵajenesye ngani ja unami pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli nkati chilambo chiŵachiuchilichisye achitiji, “Ŵandu ŵa chilambo cho akuulaga ŵandu ŵakwe. Nombe ŵandu wose twaŵaweni kweleko alewipe nnope. <verse eid="NUM 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33" />Twaweni Ŵanefili, yaani mikammandu ŵa uŵelesi wa che Anaki kweleko. Uweji twaliweni nti itete paujo pao, ni ŵanyawo ni iŵatuwonaga uweji.”<verse eid="NUM 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14" />
  <para style="s">Ŵandu akulalata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1" />Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵagumisile kwannope ni kulila chilo chose. <verse eid="NUM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2" />Ŵalalatile che Musa ni che Haluni ŵachitiji, “Mbaya tukawilile ku Misili pane kuwilila papapa pa chipululu pa! <verse eid="NUM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3" />Kwachichi Ambuje Akunnungu akutujausya ku chilambo cho? Chituulajikwe ku ngondo, achiŵankwentu ni ŵanache ŵetu tajigalikwe mateka! Ngati mbaya tukausile ku Misili?” <verse eid="NUM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4" />Nipele ŵatandite kusalilana, “Ayaga, tunsagule chilongola, tuuje ku Misili.”<verse eid="NUM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5" />Pelepo, che Musa ni che Haluni ŵatindiŵele ni kukotama paujo pa Ŵaisilaeli wose. <verse eid="NUM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6" />Che Yoshua mwana ju che Nuni ni che Kalebu mwana ju che Yefune ŵaŵaliji mu mpingo wa aŵala ŵandu ŵaŵajawile kukuchiuchilisya chilambo chila, ŵapapwile yakuwala yao, <verse eid="NUM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7" />ni kwasalila Ŵaisilaeli wose, “Chilambo chitwapite kukuchiuchilichisya chili chambone nnope. <verse eid="NUM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8" />Naga Ambuje Akunnungu anonyelwe nowe chatujausye kweleko ni kutupa achila chilambo chambone chachikufai kulanga ni kulima. <verse eid="NUM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9" />Nambo nkankana Ambuje Akunnungu namose nkaajogopa achinsyene chilambo cho. Pakuŵa tutwapunde. Minungu jawo jiŵaalindililaga jaalesile, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ali pamo ni uwe, ngasimwajogopa!” <verse eid="NUM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10" />Nambo ŵandu wose ŵalamwile kwaponya maganga. Chisisimuchile lilanguka lya lumbili lwa Ambuje Akunnungu lwatyochele pachanya pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana, paujo pa Ŵaisilaeli wose.<verse eid="NUM 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Musa akwapopelela ŵandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, “Ŵandu ŵa tachiinyelusya une mpaka chakachi? Tajendelechele kukana kuungulupilila mpaka chakachi namuno ndesile imanyisyo yakusimonjeka pasikati jao? <verse eid="NUM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12" />Tinaapute kwa ilwele yakogoya ni kwajonanga tikitiki, nambo mmwe tinantende mme atati jwa chilambo cha ŵandu ŵajinji ni ŵaali ni machili kwapunda ŵanyawo.”<verse eid="NUM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13" />Nambo che Musa ŵaasalile Ambuje Akunnungu, “Mwatyosisye ŵandu ŵa ku chilambo cha Misili kwa machili genu. Ŵamisili pataipikene kuti mwatendele yeleyo ŵandu ŵenu, <verse eid="NUM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14" />tachasalila ngani ji ŵandu ŵa chilambo chi. Pakuŵa ŵandu ŵa amasile kupikana ngani jenu mmwe alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, ni kuti ndi pamo ni uwe ni nkwoneka pangasisika liunde lyenu palikwima pachanya petu, ni yakuti mmwe nkutulongosya muusi kwa lusichi lwa liunde ni chilo kwa lusichi lwa mooto. <verse eid="NUM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15" />Sambano, mwaulagaga ŵandu ŵenu wose kwanakamo, ŵandu ŵa ilambo yaimasile kupikana kulapikwa kwenu tajile, <verse eid="NUM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16" />‘Ambuje Akunnungu ŵauleje ŵandu ŵakwe mu chipululu ligongo ŵalepele kwajausya ku chilambo chiŵaalanjile kwapa.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17" />Nipele, sambano ngunchondelela alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, ntulosye ukombole wenu kwa kutenda mpela imwatulanjile pamwatite, <verse eid="NUM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18" />‘Une Ambuje Akunnungu ngangutumbila chitema, ndili jwa unonyelo wejinji ni jwakulechelela sambi ni ilewo. Nambo kwailiyose ila nganeka kwajamuka ŵanache ni isukulu mpaka chipago chaatatu ni chancheche, ligongo lya sambi sya achaŵelesi ŵao.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19" />Ngunchondelela mwalechelele ŵandu ŵa sambi syao, malinga ni unonyelo wenu wejinji, mpela ila imwalechelele kutandilila paŵatyosile ku Misili mpaka sambano.”<verse eid="NUM 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajanjile, “Nalechelele mpela intite kupopela. <verse eid="NUM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21" />Nambo kusyene mpela inguti kwendelechela kutama ni mpela ila chilambo ichikuti kugumbaswa ni ukulu wangu, <verse eid="NUM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22" />ngapagwa namose jumo jwa ŵandu ŵa jutasigalile ni kwinjila ku chilambo cho. Ŵandu ŵa aweni lilanguka lya lumbili lwangu ni yakusimosya inaitesile akula ku Misili ni ku chipululu, nambo ajendelechele kuuninga ni kukana kuunyitichisya, <verse eid="NUM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23" />ngaajinjila mu chilambo chinalumbile kwapa achambuje ŵao, iyoyopeyo ni aŵala ŵaakunyelusya nombe ngaajinjila. <verse eid="NUM 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24" />Nambo jwakutumichila jwangu che Kalebu anyitichisye mwakukulupichika, tinaajinjisye mu chilambo chajinjile ni iwelesi yakwe tachitende chao chilambo cho. <verse eid="NUM 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25" />Pakuŵa Ŵaamaleki ni Ŵakanaani akutama ku lichemba lya chilambo cho, malaŵi ngalauchanje panyuma njaule ku chipululu kwa litala lya bahali ja Shamu.”<verse eid="NUM 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ambuje Akunnungu akwajamuka ŵandu kwaligongo lya kulalata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵausisye che Musa ni che Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27" />“Mpingo ŵa ŵandu ŵangalumbana wu tiujendelechele kulalatila une mpaka chakachi? Mbesile kupilikanila malalatilo ga Ŵaisilaeli! <verse eid="NUM 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28" />Sambano mwasalile, ‘Ngulumbilila mpela inguti kutama une Ambuje Akunnungu, tinaatendele indu ilaila inaipikene ali nkuŵecheta. <verse eid="NUM 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29" />Timmwe ni ilu yenu tiijasikwe munomuno mu chipulupu, ligongo nlalete nkati une. Ngapagwa namose jumo jwenu jwali ni lisusa lya kutandilila yaka ishilini ni kupunda, <verse eid="NUM 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30" />jutajinjile mu chilambo chinalumbile kumpa chiŵe chenu, ikaŵe che Kalebu mwana jwa che Yefune ni che Yoshua mwana jwa che Nuni ni ŵatajinjile mu chilambo mo. <verse eid="NUM 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31" />Ŵanyamwe mwatite kuti achiŵana ŵenu tajigalikwe mateka, nambo une tinajinjisye ŵanache ŵenu ku chilambo chimwachikanile, kuti chiŵe chilambo chao. <verse eid="NUM 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32" />Ŵanyamwe chimmwilile mu chipululu pemu. <verse eid="NUM 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33" />Ŵanache ŵenu tasyungulesyungule ni kulaga mu chipululu mu kwa yaka alobaini, ligongo lya ungakulupilila wenu, mpaka mundu jwambesi patachiwilila mu chipululu. <verse eid="NUM 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34" />Malinga ni ileŵo yenu tinlaje kwa yaka alobaini, yalumo ni agala moŵa alobaini gamwachiuchilichisye chilambo chila. Chaka chimo kwa kila lyuŵa limo, tinchimanyilila kuti muunjimisye. <verse eid="NUM 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35" />Une Ambuje Akunnungu ndite, Isyene tinantende yele ŵanyamwe wose unsongangene apano kunganila. Wose tamalile munomuno mu chipululu ni munomuno tachiwilila.’”<verse eid="NUM 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36" />Aŵala ŵandu ŵati che Musa ŵatumile kwaula kukuchiuchilichisya chilambo chila uŵausile ni kutendekasya ŵandu ŵalalatile Ambuje Akunnungu, kwa kwaichisya ngani jangalumbana nkati chilambo cho, <verse eid="NUM 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37" />ŵandu ŵaŵatyosisye ngani jangalumbana nkati chilambo cho, ŵawile kwa ulwele wakogoya uwaichisye Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38" />Nambo che Yoshua mwana jwa Nuni ni che Kalebu mwana jwa Yefune, ŵasigalile ŵajumi pasikati ja aŵala ŵandu ŵaŵapite kukuuchilisya chilambo cho.<verse eid="NUM 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilinjilo lyaandanda lya kuchigunguluchila chilambo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:41-46">Chikumbuchisyo cha Malajisyo 1:41-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39" />Che Musa paŵasasile kwasalila Ŵaisilaeli aila yasalilwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu, Ŵaisilaeli ŵalisile kwa ligogo lyekulungwa. <verse eid="NUM 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40" />Malaŵi jakwe, ŵajimwiche kundaŵipe ŵapite ku matumbi, ni ŵatite, “Sambano tuli chile kwaula pamalo patulanjile Ambuje Akunnungu. Tukuitichisya kuti tutesile sambi.”<verse eid="NUM 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41" />Nambo che Musa ŵatite, “Sambano kwachichi nkukasa lilajisyo lya Ambuje Akunnungu? Chele chindu chi nganchikombola! <verse eid="NUM 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42" />Nkajaula. Ambuje Akunnungu nganaŵa pamo ni ŵanyamwe, ni ŵammagongo ŵenu champute. <verse eid="NUM 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43" />Mwaputanaga ni Ŵaamaleki ni Ŵakanaani, timmwilile pangondo, pakuŵa nnesile kwakuya Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵelewo ngaŵa pamo ni ŵanyamwe.”<verse eid="NUM 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44" />Nambo ŵanyawo ŵakanganichile kwaula ku matumbi namose che Musa nganatyoka pachigono ni Lisanduku lya Lilangano nombe nganalijigala. <verse eid="NUM 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45" />Pelepo Ŵaamaleki ni Ŵakanaani ŵaŵatamaga mu chilambo cha matumbi cho, ŵatulwiche ŵaagungumuchile ni kwapunda. Ŵaatopwele mpaka ku musi wa Holima.<verse eid="NUM 14:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15" />
  <para style="s">Malajisyo gankati mbopesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa kuti, <verse eid="NUM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2" />akunguluche ni Ŵaisilaeli, ŵasalile kuti patajinjile ku chilambo chingwapa kuti atame mwelemo, <verse eid="NUM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3" />akaambelechele une Ambuje Akunnungu mbopesi jakutinisya kutyochela mu mipingo ja ng'ombe syenu pane ngondolo, kuŵa ununjile wambone waukuunonyelesya une Ambuje Akunnungu, iŵaga jili mbopesi jakutinisya pane mbopesi, kwaligongo lya nasili pane sadaka sinkupeleka kwakusaka kwenu, pane sadaka sya indimba yenu. <verse eid="NUM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4" />Nipele ajula jwakupeleka sadaka jakwe, tambelechele une Ambuje Akunnungu mbopesi ja yakulya, kilo moja ja utandi wesyajiche yambone, weunye ni mauta ga miseituni lita jimo. <verse eid="NUM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5" />Pamo ni divai ja mbopesi ja yakung'wa lita jimo, indu yo chiityosekwe pamo ni kila chinyama cha mbopesi ja kutinisya, iŵeje ngondolo pane mbusi. <verse eid="NUM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6" />Katema ka kutyosya mbopesi ja ngondolo tonde chintyose pamo ni utandi kilo siŵili syeunye pamo ni lita moja na nusu ja mauta, yeleyo chiityosekwe iŵe mbopesi ja utandi, <verse eid="NUM 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7" />pamo ni mbopesi ja yakung'wa lita jimo ni nusu ja divai ni kujitenda jiŵe ununjile wambone ja mbopesi jajikuunonyelesya une Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8" />Katema katimwatyochesye Ambuje Akunnungu ng'ombe nkambaku kuŵa mbopesi ja kutinisya pane mbopesi kuti ngopole nasili pane kwaligongo lya mbopesi sya chitendewele, <verse eid="NUM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9" />tintyosye ng'ombe nkambaku jo jiŵe mbopesi pamo ni mbopesi ja utandi wambone kilo sitatu ni lita siŵili sya mauta ga miseituni, <verse eid="NUM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10" />pamo ni lita siŵili sya divai jiŵe mbopesi ja yakung'wa. Jele mbopesi jakutinis jo tijinunjile yambone kwakuunonyelesya une Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="NUM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11" />Yele ni indu itachiityosya pamo ni kila ng'ombe nkambaku pane ngondolo tonde pane mbusi tonde pane ngondolo jangakomala pane mbusi jangakomala talinganye kwanti nyi. <verse eid="NUM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12" />Kila chinyama chachikutyosekwa kuŵa mbopesi chityosekwe ni yele indu yaikulajichikwa yo. <verse eid="NUM 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13" />Kila Mwisilaeli takuye malajisyo go katema pakujityosya mbopesi ja kutinisya kuŵa ununjile wambone waukuunonyelesya une Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14" />Naga kwana jwannendo jwakutama pamo ni ŵanyamwe kwa katema kakaleu pane moŵa gose, asakaga kutyosya mbopesi jakwe kwa kutinisya jiwe ni ununjile wambone waukuunonyelesya une Ambuje Akunnungu, mundu jo tatende malinga ni munkutendela ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="NUM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15" />Mu iŵelesi yose yaikwika, malajisyo gatingakuye ŵanyamwe ni jwannendo jwalijose jwakutama pamo ni ŵanyamwe, paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu chinchiŵa yalumo. <verse eid="NUM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16" />Ŵanyamwe ni jwannendo tinlongoswe ni malajisyo gagogo.<verse eid="NUM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18" />akunguluche ni Ŵaisilaeli ŵasalile kuti, katema katajinjile ku chilambo chingunjausya, <verse eid="NUM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19" />kila patichilya magowolo ga chilambo cho, tinsapule magowolo gampepe kuŵa mbopesi kwa une Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20" />Pankuteleka mikate, nkate wandanda wa milimbu ja utandi wenu tiityochekwe kuŵa mbopesi kutyochela peuto pakuputila magowolo. <verse eid="NUM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21" />Timundyochesye une Ambuje Akunnugu aji mbopesi ja milimbu ji mu iŵelesi yenu yose yaikwika.<verse eid="NUM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22" />Nambo iŵaga mundu talepele kukuya malajisyo gose gati une Ambuje Akunnungu ngumpa kwa litala li che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23" />iŵaga mmoŵa gagakwika ŵandu talepele kukuya malajisyo gose gati une Ambuje Akunnungu naalajisye che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24" />iŵaga aleŵile pangaŵa kwa mele, ni pangamanyilila ŵandu, nipele ŵandu wose tatyosye ng'ombe nkambaku umo wangakomala jiŵe mbopesi ja kutinisya, kuŵa ununjile wambone waukuunonyelesya une Ambuje Akunnungu, pamo ni mbopesi jakwe ja utandi ni yakung'wa malinga na malajisyo gangu. Iyoyo peyo ŵandu tachityosya mbusi tonde jimo jiŵe mbopesi jakutyosya sambi. <verse eid="NUM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25" />Jwambopesi tatende ujilanyo kwa ligongo lya Ŵaisilaeli wose, ni ŵanyawo talechelelwe, ligongo nganaleŵa kwamele, sooni aiche ni mbopesi ja kutinisya kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ni mbopesi jakutyosya sambi kwa ligongo lya chileŵo chao. <verse eid="NUM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26" />Ŵaisilaeli pamo ni achalendo ŵakutama nao, talechelelwe ligongo wose aŵalanjikwe pa chileŵo cho.<verse eid="NUM 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27" />Mundu jumo atendaga sambi pangaŵa kwa mele, tatyosye mbusi jankolo ja chaka chimo jiŵe mbopesi jakutyosya sambi. <verse eid="NUM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28" />Jwambopesi tatende ujilanyo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu kwa ligongo lya mundu jwaleŵile pangaŵa kwamele, katema ujilanyo patiutendekwe kwaligongo lyakwe, mundu jo talechelelwe. <verse eid="NUM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29" />Lilamulo lyo tiliŵe kwa kila mundu jutaleŵe pagaŵa kwa mele, aŵeje Mwisilaeli pane jwannendo jwakutama pamo nawo.<verse eid="NUM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30" />Nambo mundu jwalijose jutaleŵe kwa mele, aŵeje Mwisilaeli pane jwannendo, taŵe akuntukana Ambuje Akunnungu, mundu jo aulajikwe. <verse eid="NUM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31" />Pakuŵa akanile aila yasasile Ambuje Akunnungu, nikutema lilamulo limo mu malamulo gakwe, mundu jo aulajikwe; chileŵo chakwe chichiŵe pa nsyene jo.<verse eid="NUM 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu jwangajitichisya lyuŵa lya Kupumulila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32" />Lyuŵa limo katema Ŵaisilaeli paŵaliji mwipululu, ŵamweni mundu jumo ali nkulokota sasu pa lyuŵa lya Kupumulila. <verse eid="NUM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33" />Nipele, ŵanjawisye mundu jo paujo pa che Musa ni che Haluni ni pa ŵandu wose. <verse eid="NUM 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34" />Ŵammisile mu chitaŵiko pakuŵa nganiimanyika yambone itajile kuntendela mundu jwanti yele. <verse eid="NUM 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35" />Pelepo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, “Mundu ju aulajikwe, kwa kuputikwa ni maganga paasa pa chigono.” <verse eid="NUM 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36" />Nipele, ŵandu ŵantyosisye paasa chigono ŵamputile ni maganga mpaka kuŵa, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite kwalajisya che Musa.<verse eid="NUM 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iundo mu yakuwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38" />ŵasalile Ŵaisilaeli kuti, “Nlipanganyichisye iundo mumbali mwa yakuwala yenu, ni iundo yo iŵe ni usi wa chibuluu. Ntendeje yele mu iŵelesi yenu yose yaikwika. <verse eid="NUM 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39" />Iundo yo tiiŵe chikumbuchisyo kukwenu. Kila patinchiiwona tinkumbuchile malajisyo gangu gose ni kugakuya, kuti nkaika kukuya inkuisaka mwachinsyene ni aila inkuiwona kwa meeso genu mwachinsyene. <verse eid="NUM 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40" />Iundo yo tiinkumbusye malamulo gangu gose ni tingakuye gose kwa utindimisyo, ni ŵanyamwe tinchiŵa ŵandu ŵangu kusyene. <verse eid="NUM 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41" />Une ndili Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu unantyosisye ku chilambo cha ku Misili kuti me Akunnungu ŵenu. Une ndili Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu.”<verse eid="NUM 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16" />
  <para style="s">Che Kola, che Datani ni che Abilamu akukana kwitichisya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1" />Kanyuma che Kola mwana jwa che Ishali, juŵaliji mwanache jwa che Kohati, jwa lukosyo lwa Lawi, ŵaajigele ŵandu ŵampepe pamo ni ŵandu ŵatatu ŵa lukosyo lwa Lobeni, yaani che Datani ni che Abilamu ŵana ŵa che Eliabu ni che Oni mwana jwa che Peleti, <verse eid="NUM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2" />ilongola ŵaakumanyika mia mbili hansini ŵaŵasagulikwe ni ŵandu wose ŵakamulangene ni ŵandu wo, ni kukana kwajitichisya che Musa. <verse eid="NUM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3" />Ŵasongangene mpingo wose kwakanila che Musa ni che Haluni, ŵaasalile, “Ŵanyamwe nkulikwesya nnope! Ŵandu wose ali ŵandu ŵa Akunnungu ni Ambuje Akunnungu ali pamo ni uwe wose. Ana kwa chichi nkulikwesyakwesya mwachimisyene pasikati ja ŵandu wose ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu?”<verse eid="NUM 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4" />Che Musa paŵapikene yeleyo ŵatindiŵele ni kukotama mpaka paasi ni kupopela. <verse eid="NUM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5" />Pelepo ŵaasalile che Kola ni ŵakunkuya che Kola, “Malaŵi kundaŵi, Ambuje Akunnungu chatulosye mundu jutansagule aŵe jwambopesi ni jwele mundu jo ni jutachintumichila. <verse eid="NUM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6" />Nipele, ntende nyi, kundaŵi, mmwe pamo ni ŵaakunkuya njigale iteso, <verse eid="NUM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7" />mmiche makala ga mooto ni kutaga ubani pachanya pakwe, nipele tinyijausye paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. Mundu jwati asagulikwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu, jwele ni jutaŵe jwambopesi jwakwe. Ŵanyamwe Ŵalawi nlikwesisye kwannope!”<verse eid="NUM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8" />Che Musa ŵajendelechele kwasalila che Kola, “Mpilikane ŵanyamwe Ŵalawi! <verse eid="NUM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9" />Ana nkuchiwona chindu chamwana kukwenu kuti Akunnungu jwa Ŵaisilaeli ansagwile ŵanyamwe pasikati ja ŵandu wose ŵa Ŵaisilaeli, kuti nkombole kwaŵandichila ni kupanganya masengo mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu, ni kwatumichila ŵandu wose? <verse eid="NUM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10" />Ampele luchimbichimbi mmwe ni achalongo achinjenu Ŵalawi lwa kwatumichila, nambo sambano nkusakanga mme ŵambopesi nombe? <verse eid="NUM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11" />Mmwe ni achinjenu wose nsongangene kwakana Ambuje Akunnungu. Ŵanyamwe nkunlalatila che Haluni, nambo usyene ni kuti nkwalalatila Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12" />Che Musa ŵatumile utenga wa kwaŵilanga che Datani ni che Abilamu ŵanache ŵa che Eliabu. Nambo ŵanyawo ŵatite, “Uweji ngatukwika. <verse eid="NUM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13" />Ana chili chindu chamwana mmwe kututyosya ku Misili, chilambo chambone kwa kulima ni kulanga, kuti ntuulaje mwipilulu? Sooni, nkulitenda jwankulu jwetu! <verse eid="NUM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14" />Kupunda yele, nganintuichisya ku chilambo chambone kwa kulima ni kulanga, namose kutugaŵila lisi ni migunda ja misabibu jiŵe jetu. Nkuganisya timwatende ŵandu ŵa ŵangalola? Ngwamba, uweji ngatukwika!”<verse eid="NUM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15" />Che Musa ŵatumbile kwannope, ŵaasalile Ambuje Akunnungu, “Nkasikunda mbopesi sya ŵandu wa. Uneji nganinyigala mbunda ja mundu jwalijose namose kunleŵela jwalijose pasikati jao!”<verse eid="NUM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16" />Che Musa ŵaasalile che Kola, “Malaŵi mmwe ni achinjenu wose njisangane paujo pa chilisa. Ni che Haluni tachiŵa pelepo. <verse eid="NUM 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17" />Kila mundu tajigale chiteso chakwe ni kutaga ubani, nipele tachijausye paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. Chiiŵe iteso mia mbili hansini. Mmwe ni che Haluni tinchiika ni iteso yenu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18" />Nipele, kila mundu ŵajigele chiteso chakwe ni kutaga mooto ni ubani, ŵapite kwima pannango wa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, pamo ni che Musa ni che Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19" />Nombe che Kola ŵaasonganyisye ŵandu ŵakwe wose pamo, ŵajimi paujo pa che Musa ni che Haluni ŵaŵaliji pa nnango wa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana. Pelepo kung'alima kwa Ambuje Akunnungu kwaakopochele ŵandu wose! <verse eid="NUM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20" />Pelepo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa ni che Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21" />“Nlisapule kutyochela mu nsongangano wo kuti naajonanje ŵanyawo pangakaŵa.”<verse eid="NUM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22" />Nambo che Musa ni che Haluni ŵatindiŵele ni kukotama mpaka paasi achitiji, “Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵandi ndande ja umi wa ŵandu wose. Uli naga mundu jumo anneŵele chimwatumbilile ŵandu wose?” <verse eid="NUM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24" />“Mwaasalile ŵandu wose atyokangane pelepo chiŵandi ni masakasa ga che Kola ni che Datani ni che Abilamu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25" />Nipele, che Musa ŵapite ku che Datani ni che Abilamu akuno ali alongene ni ilongola ŵa Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26" />Paŵaiche ŵaasalile ŵandu, “Choonde ntyokangane pa masakasa ga ŵandu ŵachigongomalo ŵa, nkakwaya chindu chili chose cha ŵanyawo nkaika konasikwa pamo nao kwa ligongo lya sambi syao syose.” <verse eid="NUM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27" />Ŵandu ŵatyosile chiŵandi ni masakasa ga che Kola ni che Datani ni che Abilamu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:27">Che Datani ni che Abilamu ŵatyosile mmasakasa gawo ni kwima pannango ali alongene ni achiŵankwawo ni ŵanache ŵao wose achakulungwa ni aŵala ŵakonga. <verse eid="NUM 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28" />Pele che Musa ŵaasalile ŵandu, “Yele ni ichimmanyilile kuti Ambuje Akunnungu andumile kuitendekanya yanayose ni ngaŵa kwa usache wangu nansyene. <verse eid="NUM 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29" />Naga ŵandu ŵa tawe mpela ŵandu ŵane yakuti kuwa pane kusimanikwa ni yangalumbana yaisyoŵelechekwe mpela yaikwasimana ŵandu ŵane, pelepo mmanyilile kuti Ambuje Akunnungu ngananduma une. <verse eid="NUM 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30" />Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu atendaga chindu changanichitendekwe, lisi lyaunukaga ni kwamila ŵandu ŵa pamo ni indu yao yose, atitimilaga ali ŵajumi ni kwaula kwiuto kwa ŵandu ŵawile, pelepo ni patimmanyilile kuti ŵandu ŵa ŵakanile Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31" />Namalisya pe kuŵecheta maloŵe gose go, lisi lyajaseme mpela kang'wa paŵajimi che Datani ni che Abilamu; <verse eid="NUM 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32" />lyamisile ŵandu wo ni ulongo wao pamo ni ŵandu wose ŵa che Kola ni ipanje yao yose. <verse eid="NUM 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33" />Nipele, ŵatuluchile ku chilambo cha ŵandu ŵawe ali ŵajumi pamo ni indu yao yose, lisi lyaabudiche, ni ŵawile wose. <verse eid="NUM 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34" />Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵane ŵaŵaliji chiŵandi paŵapikene ililo yao ŵautwiche achinyanyisyaga, “Twende tuutuche, ngakaŵa lisi kutumila nowe wakwe.”<verse eid="NUM 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35" />Papopo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵapeleche mooto wajonasile aŵala ŵandu mia mbili na hansini ŵaŵapite kututumisya ubani.<verse eid="NUM 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkati iteso ya ŵandu ŵaŵaakanile Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36" />Pakumala yeleyo, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37" />“Mwasalile che Eleasali mwana jwa jwambopesi che Haluni aityosye iteso yo pa masigale ga mooto, akaumwasyanye mooto wauli mu iteso pakuŵa iteso yo ili yeswela. <verse eid="NUM 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38" />Iteso ya ŵandu ŵatesile sambi sisyatesile aulajikwe, nkaisyane iŵe yakunyilila kuti mmatichile pa chilisa, pakuŵa ŵaiichisye paujo pa chilisa ni iŵele yeswela. Nombeyo iŵe chimanyisyo kwa Ŵaisilaeli.” <verse eid="NUM 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39" />Nipele, jwambopesi che Eleasali ŵajigele iteso ya shaba yo yati ŵandu ŵaŵajonasikwe ŵaiche nayo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, yasyanikwe kumatichila pa chilisa, <verse eid="NUM 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40" />mpela Ambuje Akunnungu muŵasalile kwa litala li che Musa. Lyele lyaliji lijamuko kwa Ŵaisilaeli yakuti mundu jwalijose jwangaŵa jwambopesi, yaani jwanganaŵa jwa ntundu wa che Haluni akajaula ku chilisa kututumisya ubani paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, ngakaŵa tajonasikwe nti che Kola ni ŵandu wakwe.<verse eid="NUM 16:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Haluni akwakulupusya ŵandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41" />Kundaŵi kwakwe, Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵandandaulile che Musa ni che Haluni ŵatite, “Mwauleje ŵandu ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu.” <verse eid="NUM 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42" />Paŵasongangene paujo pa che Musa ni che Haluni kuti ŵaakanile, ŵagalauchile kulilola Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana ni ŵaliweni liunde liunichile pa Lisakasa ni kungalima kwa Ambuje Akunnungu watyochele pelepo. <verse eid="NUM 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43" />Che Musa ni che Haluni ŵapite kwima mbujo mwa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 16:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44" />Ni Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45" />“Nlisapule ntyoche pa ŵandu ŵasongangene kuti naajonanje papopo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:45">Nambo ŵanyawo ŵatindiŵele ni kukotama mpaka paasi. <verse eid="NUM 16:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46" />Che Musa ŵansalile che Haluni, “Njigale chiteso chenu, ntaje makala ga mooto kutyochela pa chilisa, ntaje ubani ni kwaula nacho kwa chitema kwa ŵandu kuti ntende ujilanyo kwa ligongo lyao. Ntende chitema! Uchimwa wa Ambuje Akunnungu waichilile ni ulwele wakogoya utandite.” <verse eid="NUM 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47" />Nipele che Haluni ŵatesile mpela muŵasalilwe ni che Musa. Ŵajigele chiteso chakwe ni kuutuchila mpaka pasikati ja ŵandu ŵaŵasongangene. Paŵauweni ulwele wakogoya utandite ŵatasile ubani mu chiteso ni kwatendela ŵandu ujilanyo. <verse eid="NUM 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48" />Paŵatesile yeleyo, ulwele wakogoya ula walesile, nombe che Haluni ŵasigalile pasikati ja aŵala ŵaŵawile ni ŵaŵaliji ŵajumi. <verse eid="NUM 16:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49" />Ŵandu ŵaŵawile kwa ulwele wakogoya ula ŵaliji elufu kumi na nne na mia saba pangaŵalanjila aŵala ŵaŵawile pamo ni che Kola ni achijakwe. <verse eid="NUM 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50" />Ulwele wakogoya pawalesile che Haluni ŵausile ku che Musa pannango wa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu.<verse eid="NUM 16:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17" />
  <para style="s">Lubokola lwa che Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2" />“Mwasalile Ŵaisilaeli aiche nasyo mbokola kumi na mbili, lubokola lumo kwa kila chilongola jwa lukosyo. Nnembe lina lya kila mundu pa lubokola lwakwe. <verse eid="NUM 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3" />Pa lubokola lwa lukosyo lwa Lawi nnembe lina lya che Haluni, kwayele tiluŵe lubokola lumo kwa kila chilongola jwa lukosyo. <verse eid="NUM 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4" />Njigale mbokola syo ni kusijausya pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu paujo pa Lisanduku lya Lilangano, pelepo ni pachinjisimanaga ni mmwe. <verse eid="NUM 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5" />Lubokola lwa mundu jutinansagule chilusipuche. Kwalitala lyo kudandaula kwa Ŵaisilaeli nkati ŵanyamwe tikumale.”<verse eid="NUM 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6" />Che Musa ŵakungulwiche ni Ŵaisilaeli. Ilongola wao wose ŵapele kila mundu lubokola lwakwe malinga ni lukosyo lwakwe, kwayele syaliji mbokola kumi na mbili. Lubokola lwa che Haluni lwaŵichikwe pamo ni mbokola syo. <verse eid="NUM 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7" />Che Musa ŵasiŵisile mbokola syose syo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana.<verse eid="NUM 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8" />Malaŵi jakwe kundaŵi, che Musa ŵajinjile mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana. Mwelemo ŵalusimene lubokola lwa che Haluni jwa lukosyo lwa Lawi lusipwiche ni kutyosya isipusi yaikutyosya maluwa ni kusogola isogosi yejiu ya mlosi. <verse eid="NUM 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9" />Nipele che Musa, ŵasityosisye mbokola syose ni kwalosya Ŵaisilaeli wose, ŵaiweni iyatyochele ni kila chilongola ŵalujigele lubokola lwakwe. <verse eid="NUM 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, “Nluusye lubokola lwa che Haluni paujo pa Lisanduku lya Lilangano, nlugose kweleko nti chilosyo kwa ŵandu ŵakuungana une. Chindu chi chichilekasye kudandaula kwao nkati une kuti akawa.” <verse eid="NUM 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11" />Che Musa ŵatesile mpela iŵatite kulajiswa ni Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="NUM 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵaasalile che Musa, “Nnole sambano! Tukwonasika! Tumasile! Wose tumasile. <verse eid="NUM 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13" />Mundu jwalijose jutaŵandichile Lisakasa lya Ambuje Akunnungu tawe. Uli ŵanawose chituwe?”<verse eid="NUM 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18" />
  <para style="s">Masengo ga Ŵambopesi ni Ŵalawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1" />Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Haluni, “Mmwejo achiŵanagweni ni Ŵalawi wose chinjigale ileŵo ya pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, iyoyo peyo mmwe ni achiŵanaŵenu jikape ni uchinjigale ileŵo pa utumichile wa chimbopesi. <verse eid="NUM 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2" />Mwaichisye achiŵana ŵenu ni uŵelesi wenu wose atumichile kuŵa ŵambopesi; achalongo ŵenu ŵane wa lukosyo lwa Ŵalawi tatende masengo pamo ni mmwe paujo pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3" />Tatende masengo gachimwape ni masengo gose ga pa Lisakasa. Nambo ng'oo ngasaikwaya yoombo yeswela ya mu Lisakasa namose kuchiŵandichila chilisa ngakaŵa tawe ni ŵanyamwe nombe timmwe. <verse eid="NUM 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4" />Talumbikane ni mmwe mmasengo ni kugatenda masengo ga kugosa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana, yaani masengo gose ga mu Lisakasa ni ngasapagwa mundu jwine jutakombole kuŵandichila pele patimpanganye masengo. <verse eid="NUM 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5" />Mmwe ni achiŵana ŵenu pe tintende masengo ga peuto papaswela ni pachilisa, kuti uchimwa wangu ukaatyochela sooni Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6" />Uneji ni junaasagwile achalongo ŵenu Ŵalawi pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli nti ntuuka kukwenu. Ŵanyawo aŵichikwe pajika kwa ligongo lyangu une Ambuje Akunnungu, kuti apanganye masengo mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7" />Nambo mmwe jikape ni achiŵana wenu tintende masengo gose ga umbopesi kwa ligongo lya chilisa ni indu yose yaili peuto papaswela nnope. Ngumpa utumichile wa chimbopesi nti ntuuka. Mundu jwalijose jutaŵandichile peuto papaswela aulajikwe.”<verse eid="NUM 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaikusachilwa kwapa ŵambopesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Haluni, “Ngumpa indu yose yatyosisye Ŵaisilaeli mbopesi kukwangu; indu yose yambele Ŵaisilaeli iŵe yangu ngumpa mmwe ni uŵelesi wenu iŵe yenu mu ndamo syenu moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="NUM 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9" />Pasikati ja indu yaityosekwe kukwangu yangaikutiniswa pa mooto, yele tiiŵe yenu. Mbopesi sya utandi ni mbopesi syakutyosya sambi ni mbopesi sya kugopola nasili ni ilumbilo. Kila chindu tichambelechele ŵandu nti mbopesi jeswela tichiŵe chenu ni achiŵana ŵenu. <verse eid="NUM 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10" />Tinchilya indu yo nti indu yeswela yaani ityochekwe kukwangu, achalume pe ni utachilya, indu yo pakuŵa ili yeswela nnyichimbichisye nti indu yaityosekwe kukwangu.”<verse eid="NUM 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11" />“Nombe indu ine yose itambelechele Ŵaisilaeli nti mbopesi ja kunyakula, tiiŵe yenu. Ngumpa mmwe, achiŵana ŵenu ni achiŵali ŵenu iŵe yenu moŵa gose. Mundu jwalijose mu ulongo wenu jwakukundikwa kwa kupopelela akukombola kulya indu yo.”<verse eid="NUM 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12" />“Milimbu jose jaakumbelechela Ŵaisilaeli gumpa mmwe; iŵeje mauta ga seituni gambone ni divai jasambano jambone ni utandi. <verse eid="NUM 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13" />Milimbu jose ja mu chilambo tijiŵe jenu. Kila mundu jwakukundikwa kwa kupopelela jwali mu ulongo wenu akukombola kulya.”<verse eid="NUM 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14" />“Kupunda ni yeleyo kila chindu chachityosekwe kukwangu pa chilambo cha ku Isilaeli chichiŵe chenu.”<verse eid="NUM 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15" />“Kila jwakwitiwo jutambelechele Ŵaisilaeli, aŵaga mwanache jwaandanda kupagwa kwa mundu pane chinyama taŵe ŵenu. Nambo Ŵaisilaeli akusachilwa kwawombola ŵakwitiwo wose ni kila chipago chandanda cha inyama yangaikukundikwa kwa kupopelela. <verse eid="NUM 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16" />Ŵanache ŵao ŵakwitiwo tinchawombola aŵaga ni lisusa lya mwesi umo kwa kwalipila ipande nsano ya madini ga feza, malinga ni ipimo yaiŵichikwe mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana. <verse eid="NUM 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17" />Nambo ipago yandanda ya ng'ombe, ngondolo pane mbusi nkaawombola, ŵele atyosekwe kukwangu une ni ali kwaligongo lya mbopesi. Miasi jao tinjitile pa chilisa ni mauta gao tingatinisye gaŵe mbopesi ja kutinisya jajikununjila yambone jajikuunonyelesya une Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18" />Nyama jao nkukombola kulya, mpela inkuti kulya chidali ni chiiga cha kunyuma cha kundyo yaikutyosekwa kwaligongo lya mbopesi jakunyakula.”<verse eid="NUM 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19" />“Ngumpa mmwe, ni achiŵana ŵenu ni achiŵali ŵenu, indu yose yaakundyochesya une Ŵaisilaeli, yele chiiŵe yenu moŵa gose. Lyele lili lilangano lya moŵa gose pangali mbesi linguliŵika kwa ligongo lyenu ni iŵelesi yenu.”<verse eid="NUM 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Haluni, “Mmwe ngampegwa malo jajilijose jichijiŵe jenu mu chilambo cha Ŵaisilaeli, tinjimpa chachilichose chinkuchisaka mu ndamo syenu, une ndili Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="NUM 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaikusachilwa kwapa Ŵalawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajendelechele kusala kuti, “Ŵalawi napele maunjili ga kakumi gose gaakundyochesya Ŵaisilaeli gaŵe gawo. Gele tigaŵe malipilo gawo kwa masengo gaakugatenda kwa kuligosa Lisakasa lyangu lya Kusimanilana. <verse eid="NUM 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22" />Ni kutandilila sambano Ŵaisilaeli akaŵandichila Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu akaika kutenda sambi ni kuliichisya chiwa. <verse eid="NUM 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23" />Nambo Ŵalawi jika pe ni utapanganye masengo ku Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, ni yangalumbana yaili yose ichiityochele chajamuchikwe achinsyene. Lyele lili lilajisyo lya moŵa gose mu iŵelesi yenu yose. Ŵalawi ngaakola ipanje yachiiŵe yao achinsyene mu chilambo cha Isilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24" />Pakuŵa maunjili ga kakumi gose gachambelechele Ŵaisilaeli naapele gaŵe gao. Lyele ni ligongo lyakuti ŵanyawo ngaakola malo jitijiŵe jawo achinyene pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liunjili lya kakumi lya Ŵalawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25" />Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26" />Sooni timwasalile Ŵalawi malajisyo ga, “Katema katachipochela maunjili ga kakumi gampele Ambuje Akunnungu kutyochela kwa Ŵaisilaeli gaŵe genu, tachindyochesya une Ambuje Akunnungu liunjili limo mwa gele maunjili kumi go. <verse eid="NUM 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27" />Mbopesi ji tijiŵalanjikwe kuŵa yalumo ni milimbu ja utandi pane mpela divai jasambano jaakundyochesya jwakulima. <verse eid="NUM 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28" />Nipele yele ni itimundyochesye une Ambuje Akunnungu mbopesi sya maunjili ga kakumi gatimpochele kutyochela kwa Ŵaisilaeli. Liunjili lya kakumi lyatimundyochesye une Ambuje Akunnungu timwape jwambopesi che Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29" />Malinga ni yose itimpochele, timumbelechele une Ambuje Akunnungu liunjili lya kakumi lyalili lyambone kupunda gose ni lyeswela. <verse eid="NUM 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30" />Kwayele timwaasalile: Patintyosye liunjili lyambone kupunda gose, liunjili lyatilisigalile tiliŵe lyenu, mpela yaili kwa jwakulima akujigala chachisigalile pakumala kutyosya mbopesi syakwe sya milimbu ja utandi ni divai. <verse eid="NUM 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31" />Ni ŵanyamwe ni achalongo ŵenu tinlye chachisigalile papali pose, pakuŵa uli ntulilo wenu, kwa ligongo lya masengo genu ga ku Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32" />Ngankola chilewo chilichose mwalyaga indu yo, naga muntyochesye Ambuje Akunnungu liunjili lyalili lyambone kupunda gose, nkaitenda ikanikwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu indu yeswela ya Ŵaisilaeli, ni ŵanyamwe ngammwa.”<verse eid="NUM 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19" />
  <para style="s">Liu lya ng'ombe jankolo jechejeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa ni che Haluni kuti, <verse eid="NUM 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2" />“Gelega ni malajisyo gangumpanga une Ambuje Akunnungu. Mwasalile Ŵaisilaeli annyichisisye ngombe jankolo jechejeu janganakola chilema chilichose namose liŵasi ni janganatumiche pa masengo gagali gose. <verse eid="NUM 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3" />Mwape jwambopesi che Eleasali ng'ombe jo. Chatyosyekwe paasa pa chigono ni kujisikita paujo pa jwambopesi jo. <verse eid="NUM 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4" />Nipele, jwambopesi che Eleasali tajigale miasi kanandi ja ng'ombe jo ni kunyuluchisya kwa chala mala saba, chambujo mwa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5" />Ng'ombe jo jinajose chijijochekwe pa mooto paujo pa jwambopesi. Kila chindu chichitiniswe; lipende ni nyama ni miasi ni matuumbo gakwe. <verse eid="NUM 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6" />Pelepo jwambopesi chajigale chitela cha mwelesi, ni husopo ni usi wechejeu wa manyunya ga ngondolo ni kwasila pa mooto wo. <verse eid="NUM 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7" />Pakumala pelepo, jwambopesi chachape nguo syakwe ni koga kwa meesi, nipele chakombole kwinjila pa chigono, nambo ngaakundikwa ku kupopela mpaka ligulo. <verse eid="NUM 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8" />Mundu jutachijitinisya ng'ombe jo nombe tachichapa nguo syakwe ni koga kwa meesi, nambo nombejo ngaakundikwa ku kupopela mpaka ligulo. <verse eid="NUM 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9" />Ajula mundu jwakukundikwa ku kupopelela takumbe liu lya ng'ombe jo ni kulijausya peuto papasalele paasa pa chigono. Tiligosekwe ni tilitumiche ni mpingo wose wa Ŵaisilaeli pakolochesya meesi ga kutyosya ungakundikwa ni Akunnungu, kwaligongo lya sambi. <verse eid="NUM 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10" />Mundu jutakumbe liu lya ng'ombe jo akusachilwa achape nguo syakwe, nombejo taŵe jwangakundikwa ku mapopelo mpaka ligulo. Lilajisyo li tiliŵe lya moŵa gose, kwa Ŵaisilaeli ni ŵandu ŵane ŵakutama pasikati jawo.<verse eid="NUM 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkati kugakwaya malilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11" />“Mundu akwayaga malilo ga mundu jwalijose, ngakundikwa ku mapopelo kwa moŵa saba. <verse eid="NUM 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12" />Pa lyuŵa lyaatatu ni lya saba mundu jo talijosye ni agala mesi gakuliswejesya, nombejo taŵe jwasalele. Nambo alekaga kuliswejesya pa lyuŵa lyaatatu ni lya saba, mundu jo tasigalile kuŵa jwangakundikwa ku kupopela. <verse eid="NUM 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13" />Jutagakwaye malilo, yaani chiilu cha mundu jwawile, naga ngakuliswejesya, akuntesya Ambuje Akunnungu alikane Lisakasa lyo, nombejo taŵichikwe pajika ni Ŵaisilaeli. Mundu jo tasigalile jwangakundikwa ku kupopela ligongo ngananyuluchiswa meesi ga kuswejesya gala.<verse eid="NUM 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14" />“Gelega gali malajisyo gakugakuya iŵaga mundu awilile mu lisakasa: Kila mundu juchajinjile mu lisakasa mo, pane jwali mu lisakasa mo, ngaakundikwa ku kupopela kwa moŵa saba. <verse eid="NUM 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15" />Choombo chilichose changaunichila ni changali chiunichilo pachanya pakwe ngachikundikwa kwa kupopela. <verse eid="NUM 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16" />Mundu jwalijose akwayaga chiilu cha mundu jwaulajikwe ni lipanga pane jwawile chiwa chakawaida kumigunda, pane akwayaga liupa lya mundu pane lilembe, ngaakundikwa ku kupopela kwa moŵa saba.<verse eid="NUM 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17" />“Kwa ligongo lya kutyosya ungakundikwa ku kupopela, mundu jwakukundikwa ku kupopelela tajigale liu lya mbopesi ja kutyosya sambi jajitiniswe, liu lyo taŵiche mu choombo ni kuwanganya ni meesi ga nlusulo. <verse eid="NUM 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18" />Mundu jwalijose jwakukundikwa kwa mapopelelo tajigale hisopo, tanyoye mmesi ni kunyuluchisya lisakasa ni yoombo yose pamo ni ŵandu ŵali mwelemo. Nombe tannyuluchisye mundu jwakwaiye liupa lya mundu pane mundu jwaulajikwe pane jwawile chiwa chakawaida pane lilembe. <verse eid="NUM 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19" />Mundu jwakukundikwa ku kupopela tannyuluchisye mundu jwangaakukundikwa meesi go. Kwayele pa lyuŵa lya saba, tanswejesye mundu jwangakukundikwa jo, nombejo tachape nguo syakwe ni koga meesi, ni ligulo lyo taŵe jwakukundikwa kwa kupopelela.<verse eid="NUM 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20" />“Nambo iŵaga mundu jwangaakukundikwa takane kuliswejesya, takanikwe mu nsongangano pakuŵa akulitenda Lisakasa lya Ambuje Akunnungu likakundikwa kwa kupopela. Pakuŵapo ngananyuluchiswa meesi ga kuswejesya, ni ngaakukundikwa. <verse eid="NUM 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21" />Ŵandu tagakamule malajisyo ga moŵa gose. Mundu jutanyuluchisye meesi ga kuswejesya chachape nguo syakwe; nombe juchagakwaye meesi gagatumiche kwa kuchapila go taŵe jwangakundikwa kwa mapopelo mpaka ligulo. <verse eid="NUM 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22" />Chindu chilichose chaakuchikwaya mundu jwangakukundikwa chichiŵe changakundikwa ni julijose jutakwaye chindu cho ngaakundikwa ku kukupopela mpaka ligulo.”<verse eid="NUM 19:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20" />
  <para style="s">Meesi kukopoka pa lwala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Kutyoka 17:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1" />Pa mwesi waandanda mpingo wose wa Ŵaisilaeli waiche ku chipululu cha Sini, ni ŵatemi ku Kadeshi. Che Miliamu ŵawilile kweleko ni ŵansichile kukoko.<verse eid="NUM 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2" />Pamalo paŵaŵisile chigono po paliji pangali meesi kwaligongo lya ŵandu ŵala. Kwayele mpingo wose wa ŵandu, ŵasongangene kukana kwapikanila che Musa ni che Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3" />Ŵandu ŵakangene ni che Musa achitiji, “Ikaliji yambone tukawile paujo pa lisakasa lya Ambuje Akunnungu pamo ni Ŵaisilaeli achinjetu! <verse eid="NUM 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4" />Kwachichi mwatuichisye uweji mpingo wa Ambuje Akunnungu akuno ku chipululu kuno? Ana mwatuichisye kuti tuwe pamo ni ilango yetu? <verse eid="NUM 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5" />Kwachichi ntutyosisye ku Misili ni kutuichisya pamalo papakogoya pa? Pamalo pa pangali ni yakulya namose tini, ni sabibu namose makomamanga. Namuno meesi gakung'wa nganigapagwa!” <verse eid="NUM 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6" />Pelepo che Musa ni che Haluni ŵatyosile pa mpingo wa ŵandu, ŵapite kwima pannango wa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, ŵatindiŵele ni ŵajineme mpaka paasi. Nipele ungalime wa Ambuje Akunnungu waakopochele. <verse eid="NUM 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8" />“Njigale lubokola lwenu, nipele mmwe pamo ni che Haluni nkulugwenu, nsonganganye mpingo wose wa ŵandu. Nipele, paujo pao muusalile lwala lwaluli paujo pao lukoposye meesi gakwe. Elo, tinlutende lwala lukoposye meesi, kuti mpingo wose wa ŵandu ni ilango yao akombole kung'wa.” <verse eid="NUM 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9" />Kwayele che Musa ŵajawile ni kulujigala alula lubokola kutyochela apala palwaliji paujo pa Lisanduku lya Lilangano mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite kunlajisya.<verse eid="NUM 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10" />Che Musa ni che Haluni ŵaasonganyisye mpingo wose paujo pa lwala lo, nombe che Musa ŵaasalile, “Mpikanile mwanya ŵakutindiganya. Ana nkusaka tunkopochesye meesi kutyochela pa lwala lu?” <verse eid="NUM 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11" />Pelepo che Musa ŵanyakwile nkono ŵakwe ni kuluputa lwala kaŵili ni lubokola lwakwe. Meesi gauliche ni mpingo wose ni ilango yao ŵang'wele. <verse eid="NUM 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12" />Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa ni che Haluni kuti, “Pakuŵa ŵanyamwe nganimungulupilila une, namose kuunjimbichisya nti jwanswela paujo pa Ŵaisilaeli, ngamuujinjisya mpingo wu ku chilambo chingwapa.” <verse eid="NUM 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13" />Gelega galiji meesi ga ku Meliba, pamalo pati Ŵaisilaeli ŵaalalatile Ambuje Akunnungu, nombewo ŵalilosisye asyene kuti ali ŵaswela pasikati jawo.<verse eid="NUM 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwenye jwa ku Edomu akwakanila Ŵaisilaeli kupita mu chilambo chakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14" />Che Musa ŵaatumile ŵantenga kutyochela ku Kadeshi kwaula kwa mwenye jwa ku Edomu achitiji, “Mpwenu Isilaeli akuti nyi: Mmwe nkugamanyilila malagasyo gose gatupatile. <verse eid="NUM 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15" />Achatati ŵetu ŵatuluchile ku Misili, ni uweji tutemiji kweleko yaka yejinji. Ŵamisili ŵatulagasisye uweji ni achatati ŵetu nombe, <verse eid="NUM 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16" />nambo patwalilile Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵakupikanile kulila kwetu ni ŵantumile katumetume jwakwe jwa kwinani ni ŵatukopwesye ku Misili. Sambano tuli akuno ku Kadeshi kuno, musi wauli mumpika mwa chilambo chenu. <verse eid="NUM 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17" />Choonde ntukunde tupite mu chilambo mwenu. Ngatupitila mu ngunda wauli wose, namose migunda ja misabibu; namose ngatung'wa meesi ga isima yenu. Tutupite mu litala lyekulu pe pangali kusepuchila kunchiji atamuno kunlyo, mpaka tuli tukopweche mu chilambo chenu.”<verse eid="NUM 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18" />Nambo mwenye jwa ku Edomu ŵajanjile, “Ngwamba! Ngampita apano; mwalingaga kupita, tutukopoche ni kungunguluchila ni mapanga.” <verse eid="NUM 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵajanjile, “Uweji chitugambe kupita mu litala pe, ni sooni iŵaga uweji pane ilango yetu tutung'we meesi genu, tuchilipila, tukwamba kusosa kupita pe.”<verse eid="NUM 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20" />Ŵandu ŵa ku Edomu ŵajanjile sooni kuti, “Ngatukusaka mpite pelepa.” Papopo Ŵaedomu ŵajawile ni ŵangondo wao ŵajinji ni ŵamachili kukwagungumuchila Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21" />Nipele, pakuŵa Ŵaedomu ŵakanile kwaluhusu Ŵaisilaeli kupita mmipika jawo. Ŵaisilaeli ŵagalawiche ni kulikuya litala liine.<verse eid="NUM 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi che Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22" />Ŵaisilaeli wose watyosile ku Kadeshi, waiche ku chitumbi cha Holi. <verse eid="NUM 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23" />Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa ni che Haluni kwele ku chitumbi cha Holi ko, mumpika mwa chilambo cha ku Edomu kuti, <verse eid="NUM 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24" />“Che Haluni tachiwa; ngaajinjila mu chilambo chati naapele Ŵaisilaeli, ligongo ŵanyamwe ŵanaŵaŵili nganinjitichisya lilajisyo lyangu akula ku Meliba kula. <verse eid="NUM 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25" />Mwajigale che Haluni ni che Eleasali mwanagwe, mwakwesye ku chitumbi cha Holi. <verse eid="NUM 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26" />Mwaule che Haluni yakuwala yakwe, mwawasye che Eleasali mwanagwe, che Haluni takawilile kukoko ku chitumbi ko.” <verse eid="NUM 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27" />Che Musa watesile mpela iŵalajichikwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu. Ŵanawose ŵatatu ŵakwesile ku chitumbi akuno Ŵaisilaeli wose achalolechesyaga. <verse eid="NUM 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28" />Che Musa ŵammusile che Haluni yakuwala ya chimbopesi, ni kummwasya che Eleasali. Nombe che Haluni ŵawilile papopo petumbi po. Nipele che Musa ni che Eleasali ŵatulwiche paasi. <verse eid="NUM 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29" />Ŵaisilaeli wose paŵaimanyilile kuti che Haluni awile, Ŵaisilaeli wosepe ŵalisile malilo gakwe kwa moŵa selasini.<verse eid="NUM 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21" />
  <para style="s">Ŵaisilaeli akwapunda Ŵakanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1" />Mwenye jwa Chikanaani jwa ku Aladi juŵatamaga kwele ku Negebu ko paŵapilikene kuti Ŵaisilaeli ŵaliji nkwika kupitila litala lya ku Atalimu, ŵajile kukwagunguluchila Ŵaisilaeli ni ŵaakamwile ŵampepe ŵawo. <verse eid="NUM 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2" />Pelepo Ŵaisilaeli ŵataŵile nasili ji kwa Ambuje Akunnungu: “Iŵaga chintutesye twapunde ŵandu ŵa, nipele tutujijonanje tikitiki misi jawo.” <verse eid="NUM 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵagapilikanile mapopelo ga Ŵaisilaeli, nombewo ŵaatesile ŵaapunde Ŵakanaani. Ni ŵaajonasile tikitiki ni misi jawo; kwayele peuto po paŵilanjikwe Holima.<verse eid="NUM 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lijoka lya shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵajesile ulendo kutyochela ku chitumbi cha Holi ŵapite litala lyalikwaula ku bahali ja Shamu kuti achisyungule chilambo cha ku Edomu. Nambo mwitala ŵandu ŵajasile ntima. <verse eid="NUM 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5" />Nipele, ŵatandite kwalalatila Akunnungu ni che Musa achitiji, “Ligongo chichi ntutyosisye ku Misili kuti tuwe ku chipululu kuno? Nganichipagwa chakulya! Nganigapagwa meesi? Ni uweji achi chakulya changanong'a chi chitutindikwe!”<verse eid="NUM 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6" />Pelepo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵapeleche majoka gagali ni sumu pasikati jawo; gaalumile ŵandu, Ŵaisilaeli ŵajinji ŵawile. <verse eid="NUM 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7" />Ŵandu ŵanjaulile che Musa ni kuti, “Tutesile sambi kwa kwalalatila Ambuje Akunnungu ni ŵalakwe nombe. Mwapopelele Ambuje Akunnungu kuti agatyosye majoka ga.” Kwayele che Musa ŵaapopelele ŵele ŵandu wo. <verse eid="NUM 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa, “Nkolosye lijoka lya shaba ni nlikoleche pa sichi; mundu jwalijose jutachaluma lijoka, alolechesyaga lijoka lya shaba lyo chalame.” <verse eid="NUM 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9" />Nipele, che Musa ŵakolosisye lijoka lya shaba, ni ŵalikoleche pa sichi. Nipele mundu jwalijose lyalumaga lijoka, nombejo alolechesyaga alila lijoka lya shaba lila, akulama.<verse eid="NUM 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulendo wakwaula kwa Ŵamoabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵajendelechele ni ulendo wao ni ŵaŵisile chigono ku Oboti. <verse eid="NUM 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11" />Nipele ŵatyosile ku Oboti ni kuŵika chigono ku Iye Abalimu, ku chipululu chakungopochelo lyuŵa kwa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12" />Kutyochela pelepo ŵajendelechele chambujo ŵaŵisile chigono ku chiŵata cha ku Seledi. <verse eid="NUM 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13" />Kutyochela kweleko ŵajendelechele ni ulendo, ni ŵaŵisile chigono chakumpoto kwa lusulo lwa Alinoni, lusulo lwalukuilimisya meesi kutyochela ku chilambo cha Ŵaamoli. Lusulo lwa Alinoni lwaliji mpika pasikati ja Ŵamoabu ni Ŵaamoli. <verse eid="NUM 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14" />Lyeleli ni ligongo lyakwe chitabu cha ngondo sya Ambuje Akunnungu chikusala kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:14">“Musi wa Ŵahebu ku chilambo cha ku Sufa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:14">ni iŵata ya ku Alinoni,<verse eid="NUM 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15" />ni nduluko sya iŵata</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:15">syasikwaula mpaka ku musi wa ku Ali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:15">ni kwaula mumpika wa ku Moabu!”<verse eid="NUM 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16" />Kutyochela pelepo ŵajendelechele ni ulendo mpaka ku Beeli; yaani isima yati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa kuti, “Mwasonganye ŵandu pamo, ni une tinjapa meesi.” <verse eid="NUM 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17" />Nipele Ŵaisilaeli ŵajimbile lujimbo lu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">“Isima koposyani meesi genu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">njimbeje nkati chisima chi,<verse eid="NUM 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18" />chisima chiŵasosile achakulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">ni ilongola ŵa ŵandu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">chiŵasosile ali akamulile lubokola lwawo lwa chimwenye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">ni mikongojo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 21:18">Ŵajesile kutyochela pelepo kwaula ku Matana, <verse eid="NUM 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19" />kutyochela ku Matana ŵaiche ku Nahalieli, ni kutyochela ku Nahalieli mpaka ku Bamoti, <verse eid="NUM 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20" />ni kutyochela ku Bamoti ŵaiche ku chiŵata chachikuinjila mu chilambo cha ku Moabu, kuŵandichila litumbi lya Pisiga, lyati lusonga lwakwe lukulolegana ni chipululu.<verse eid="NUM 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵaisilaeli akwapunda mamwenye che Sihoni ni che Ogu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 2:26-3:1">Chikumbuchisyo cha Malajisyo 2:26-3:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵatumile ŵantenga kwa mwenye che Sihoni jwa Ŵaamoli, ajaule akaasalile: <verse eid="NUM 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22" />“Ntulechelele tupite mu chilambo chenu, ngatusepuchila pambali ni ngatujinjila mmigunda pane mmigunda ja misabibu, atamuno ngatung'wa meesi ga mu isima yenu; chitupite mu litala lyekulu pe mpaka tutyoche mu chilambo chenu.” <verse eid="NUM 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23" />Nambo che Sihoni nganiŵaalechelela Ŵaisilaeli apite mu chilambo chakwe. Ŵaasonganyisye ŵangondo ŵakwe, ŵapite ku Yahasa ku chipululu kukuputana ngondo ni Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24" />Namose yeleyo, Ŵaisilaeli ŵammuleje, ŵachijigele chilambo chakwe kutandilila ku lusulo lwa Alinoni mpaka ku lusulo lwa Yaboki, nambo mpaka ku chilambo cha Ŵaamoni pe, pakuŵa mipika jakwe jaliji jesyunguchisye lipupa. <verse eid="NUM 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵajigele kwa machili misi jose ja Ŵaamoli ni kujijigala, pamo ni musi wa ku Heshiboni mwamulimose mumusyungulile ni kutama mwelemo. <verse eid="NUM 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26" />Musi wa ku Heshiboni waliji musi wa che Sihoni mwenye jwa Ŵaamoli, jwati kuundanda ko ŵamenyene ni mwenye jwa ku Moabu ni kujigala kwa machili chilambo chakwe chose mpaka lusulo lwa Alinoni. <verse eid="NUM 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27" />Lyelelyo ni ligongo Ŵaamoli ŵajimbile lujimbo lu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">“Njise ku Heshiboni ni kuutaŵa sooni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">Musi wa ku Sihoni utaŵikwe sooni ni kuulimbisya.<verse eid="NUM 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28" />Mooto wakolele kutyochela ku Heshiboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">malamba ga mooto gatyochele ku musi wa che Sihoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">gautinisye nsinda wa Ali ku Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">gaatinisye ŵandu ŵaŵatamaga ku matumbi ga lusulo lwa Alinoni.<verse eid="NUM 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29" />Chinlaje ŵanyamwe, ŵandu ŵa ku Moabu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Mmulajikwe, mwanya ŵandu ŵa nnungu Kemoshi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Mwatesisye achiŵana ŵenu ŵachilume aŵe ŵakuutukautuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">achiŵali ŵenu mwalesile ajigalikwe kwa machili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">ni mwenye che Sihoni, mwenye jwa Ŵaamoli.<verse eid="NUM 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30" />Nambo twapundile;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">Musi wa ku Heshiboni ugumulikwe mpaka musi wa ku Diboni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">Tuugumwile ni musi wa ku Nofa, waujenele mpaka ku Medeba.”<verse eid="NUM 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31" />Kwayele, Ŵaisilaeli ŵatemi ku chilambo cha Ŵaamoli. <verse eid="NUM 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32" />Pakulama yeleyo, che Musa ŵatumile ŵakuuchilichisya ku musi wa ku Yeseli, nipele Ŵaisilaeli ŵajigele kwa machili misinda ja musi wo ni kwatopola Ŵaamoli uŵatamaga kweleko.<verse eid="NUM 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵagalawiche ŵalikuiye litala lyalikwaula ku Bashani. Mwenye che Ogu jwa ku Bashani ŵakopweche ni ŵangondo ŵakwe kukwagunguluchila ku Edilei ko. <verse eid="NUM 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34" />Nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa kuti, “Nkajogopa, pakuŵapo nantesile mumpunde pamo ni ŵangondo ŵakwe wose ni chilambo chakwe chose. Timwatende mpela imwantesile che Sihoni, mwenye jwa Ŵaamoli, juŵatamaga ku Heshiboni.” <verse eid="NUM 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35" />Kwayele ŵammuleje che Ogu, achiŵanagwe ni ŵandu ŵakwe wose, panganneka namose mundu jumo, nipele ŵachijigele chilambo chakwe.<verse eid="NUM 21:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22" />
  <para style="s">Mwenye jwa ku Moabu akummilanga che Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵatandite ulendo sooni, ŵajawile kuŵika chigono chao mu iŵata ya ku Moabu, chakungopochelo lyuŵa kwa lusulo lwa Yolodani, kulolegana ni musi wa ku Yeliko. <verse eid="NUM 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2" />Mwenye jwa ku Moabu, che Balaki mwanache jwa che Sipoli, paŵapilikene indu yose iŵaitesile Ŵaisilaeli kwa Ŵaamoli, <verse eid="NUM 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3" />jwalakwe jo pamo ni ŵandu ŵakwe wose ŵajogwepe kwannope kwaligongo lya Ŵaisilaeli. Ŵajogwepe kwannope kwaligongo lya winji wao. <verse eid="NUM 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4" />Nipele Ŵamoabu ŵaasalile ilongola ŵa ku Midiani, “Au mpingo wu pangakaŵa tiujonanje kila chindu chachikutusyungula nti ng'ombe nkambaku yajikuti kulya manyasi mmigunda.” Kwayele mwenye che Balaki mwanache jwa che Sipola juŵaliji mwenye jwa ku Moabu pa kele katema ko, <verse eid="NUM 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5" />ŵaatumile ŵantenga kwa che Balaamu, mwanache jwa che Beoli, juŵaliji kwele ku Petoli, chiŵandika ni lusulo lwa Efulate, chilambo cha ku Amawi. Ŵaasalile kuti, “Apali ŵandu ŵajinji atyosile ku Misili, ajenele palipose mu chilambo, nombewo akusaka kuchijigala chilambo changu. <verse eid="NUM 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6" />Njise sambano mwalwesye ŵandu ŵa kwaligongo lyangu, pakuŵa akwete machili ga kuumbunda une. Panepa tingombole kwapunda ni kwatopola akajinjila mu chilambo changu, ligongo nguimanyilila kuti mmweji mwampaga upile mundu akukola upile, mwanlwesyaga mundu akulweseka.”<verse eid="NUM 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7" />Nipele, achakulu ŵa ku Moabu ni ku Midiani ŵajawile kwa che Balaamu ali ajigele malipilo ga masengo ga kulwesya go, ni ŵansalile utenga wa che Balaki ula. <verse eid="NUM 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8" />Che Balaamu ŵaasalile kuti, “Ngonanje kunokuno chilo chino, ni une tinammanyisye itaasalile Ambuje Akunnungu.” Nipele achakulu ŵa ku Moabu ŵala ŵagonile ku che Balaamu chilo cho.<verse eid="NUM 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵammusisye che Balaamu, “Ana aŵa ŵandu ŵali pamo ni mmwe ŵa ali achiŵani?” <verse eid="NUM 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10" />Che Balaamu ŵajanjile Akunnungu kuti, “Che Balaki mwanache jwa che Sipoli, mwenye jwa ku Moabu, ambelechele utenga waukuti, <verse eid="NUM 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11" />kwana ŵandu atyosile ku Misili, nombe ajenele palipose mu chilambo. Amendile nyaule ngaalwesye ŵandu wo kuti panepa chakombole kuputana nawo ni kwatopola.”<verse eid="NUM 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12" />Nambo Akunnungu ŵasalile che Balaamu kuti, “Nkajaula pampepe nawo aŵa ŵandu ŵa, namose ngasimwalwesya ŵele Waisilaeli, ligongo une napele upile.”<verse eid="NUM 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13" />Nipele, kundawi kwakwe che Balaamu ŵaasalile achakulu wa che Balaki kuti, “Mmujangane mu chilambo chenu, ligongo Ambuje Akunnungu ngakusaka kuunechelela nyaule pamo ni ŵanyamwe.” <verse eid="NUM 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14" />Kwayele achakulu ŵa ku Moabu ŵatyosile, ŵausile kwa che Balaki, ŵansalile kuti, “Che Balaamu akanile kwika akuno pamo ni uwe.”<verse eid="NUM 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15" />Nipele, che Balaki ŵaatumile achakulu ŵane, achajinji kwannope ni ŵakwete yeo yekulungwa kwapunda ŵaandanda ŵala. <verse eid="NUM 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16" />Ŵaiche kwa che Balaamu, ŵansalile kuti, “Che Balaki mwanache jwa che Sipoli akuti yelei: ‘Choonde pakapagwa chindu chine chilichose chakwalekasya kuti akaika kwa une; <verse eid="NUM 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17" />pakuŵa une tinjimpa mmwejo chipanje chekulungwa ni kwatendelela chilichose chitachisala. Choonde njise kuti mwalwesye aŵa ŵandu ŵa kwaligongo lyangu.’”<verse eid="NUM 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18" />Nambo che Balaamu ŵaajanjile achakulu wa che Balaki kuti, “Atamose che Balaki akambele nyuumba jakwe jili jigumbele feza ni sahabu, uneji ngangombola kuleka kupikanila makanyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵangu, pa chindu chilichose, chiŵeje chamwana pane chekulungwa. <verse eid="NUM 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19" />Nambo choonde ngonanje apano chilo chino mpela achinjenu ŵala, ni une tinole iŵaga pana chindu chilichose chakuti aasalile Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="NUM 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20" />Chilo chila Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanjaulile che Balaamu, ŵansalile kuti, “Iŵaga ŵandu ŵa aiche kummilanga, nnongane nawo, nambo nkatende achila pe chitingansalile une.” <verse eid="NUM 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21" />Che Balaamu ŵajimwiche kundaŵi, ŵatandiche chindu chakutamila pa mbunda jakwe ni kulongana nawo achakulu ŵa ku Moabu ŵala.<verse eid="NUM 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Balaamu akusiŵilwa litala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22" />Nambo Akunnungu ŵatumbile kwannope ligongo che Balaamu ŵaliji nkwaula ku che Balaki, kwayele katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajimi pa litala kwasiŵilila litala. Pa kele katema ko che Balaamu ŵaliji akwesile pa mbunda jakwe, ali nkulongana ni ŵamasengo ŵakwe ŵaŵili. <verse eid="NUM 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23" />Nipele, mbunda jila jammweni katumetume jwa Ambuje Akunnungu jo ajimi mwitala, akamulile lipanga lyalili chile kukata. Kwayele ŵalilesile litala, ni kupitila mumbali. Che Balaamu ŵajiputile mbunda jila kuti ajisye mwitala. <verse eid="NUM 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24" />Nipele katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu jo ŵajimi pamalo papali ni litala lyakunyilila, pasikati ja migunda jiŵili ja misabibu jajili ni lipupa lya maganga kila upaande. <verse eid="NUM 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25" />Mbunda jila pajammweni katumetume jwa Ambuje Akunnungu, jajesile jakulwime mwipupa ni kulutwinyichisya lukongolo lwa che Balaamu kwipupa ko. Pelepo che Balaamu ŵajiputile sooni mbunda jila. <verse eid="NUM 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26" />Nipele katumetume jwa kwinani ŵalongolele chambujo, ŵajimi pamalo pakunyilila papali pangali sooni lipesa lyakuti agalauche. <verse eid="NUM 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27" />Mbunda jila pajammweni katumetume jwa Ambuje Akunnungu jo jagonile paasi. Che Balaamu ŵatumbile kwannope, ŵajiputile mbunda jila ni lubokola lwakwe. <verse eid="NUM 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28" />Pelepo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajiunukwile kang'wa ja mbunda, mbunda jila jansalile che Balaamu kuti, “Nantesile ichichi kwampaka nkuumbuta katatu ka?” <verse eid="NUM 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29" />Che Balaamu ŵajijanjile mbunda jila kuti, “Mmweji mundesile nkala! Ikaliji ngwete lipanga ngammuleje sampano!” <verse eid="NUM 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30" />Mbunda jila jansalile che Balaamu kuti, “Uli, uneji nganima mbunda jenu jilajila jinkwesile moŵa gose mpaka lelo jino? Uli, chipali chaka chinaatendele yanti nyi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:30">Che Balaamu ŵajanjile kuti, “Ngwamba.”<verse eid="NUM 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31" />Pelepo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵagaugwile meeso ga che Balaamu, nombejo ŵammweni katumetume jwa kwinani ali ajimi mwitala, akamulile lipanga lyalili chile kukata. Che Balaamu ŵaligwisisye paasi manguku. <verse eid="NUM 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32" />Katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnunggu ŵansalile che Balaamu kuti, “Kwachichi njiputile mbunda jenu katatu kose? Uneji iche kunsiŵila petala, ligongo nganimŵajilwa kuutenda au ulendo wu. <verse eid="NUM 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33" />Mbunda jenu jamweni une ni jambelembaga katatu kose. Jikaŵe kuti nganijipelembaga, kusyene ngammuleje mmwe ni kujileka mbunda jo jejumi.”<verse eid="NUM 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34" />Che Balaamu ŵansalile katumetume jwakwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu kuti, “Ndesile sambi ligongo nganimanyililaga kuti njimi mwitala kuusiŵilila. Sambano, iŵaga ngaikunnonyela kuti une mbitilisye ulendo wu, timuje kumusi.” <verse eid="NUM 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35" />Nambo katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Balaamu, “Njaule ni ŵandu ŵa, nambo tinkasale chingunsalila une.” Nipele che Balaamu ŵajendelechele ni ulendo pamo ni achakulu ŵa che Balaki.<verse eid="NUM 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Balaki akunchingamila che Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36" />Che Balaki paŵasalilwe kuti che Balaamu akwika, ŵatyosile kwaula kukwachingamila mmusi wa ku Ali, musi uwaliji mungulugulu mwa lusulo lwa Alinoni mumpika wa ku Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37" />Che Balaki ŵansalile che Balaamu kuti, “Ligongo chichi nganinnyika pa ulendo waandanda unammilasile ula? Uli mwaganisisye kuti ngangakombole kunlipa malipilo gakwanila?” <verse eid="NUM 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38" />Che Balaamu ŵanjanjile che Balaki kuti, “Sambano iche! Nambo ana une ngwete ulamusi wa kuŵecheta chindu chilichose? Chindu chitasale Akunnungu, chelecho ni chingusachilwa kusala.” <verse eid="NUM 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39" />Nipele, che Balaamu ŵajawile pamo ni che Balaki, ni ŵaiche ku musi wa ku Kiliati Husoti. <verse eid="NUM 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40" />Kweleko che Balaki ŵasikite ng'ombe ni ngondolo siŵe mbopesi, nyama jine ŵaagawile achakulu ŵaŵaliji pamo nawo ni che Balaamu.<verse eid="NUM 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulondola kwandanda ku Che Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41" />Malaŵi jakwe che Balaki ŵanjigele che Balaamu, ŵakwesisye ni kwaula mpaka ku Bamoti Baali; kutyochela kweleko, che Balaamu ŵakombwele kwawona Ŵaisilaeli ŵampepe.<verse eid="NUM 22:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1" />Che Balaamu ŵansalile che Balaki, “Muundaŵile ilisa saba pelepa, nipele munyichisye ng'ombe mikambaku saba ni ngondolo mikambaku saba.” <verse eid="NUM 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2" />Che Balaki ŵatesile mpela che Balaamu iŵasalile. Nipele, ŵakopwesye pachanya pa kila chilisa mbopesi ja ng'ombe nkambaku umo ni ngondolo nkambaku jumo. <verse eid="NUM 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3" />Pelepo che Balaamu ŵasalile che Balaki kuti, “Njimeje pelepa chiŵandi ni mbopesi syenu sya kutinisya, ni une ngwaula pambali. Panepa Ambuje Akunnungu chaiche kukusimana ni une. Chilichose chichasalile chiiche kukunsalila.” Nipele, che Balaamu ŵajawile jikape peuto pakulanguka pa chikwesya. <verse eid="NUM 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4" />Akunnungu ŵasimene ni che Balaamu. Che Balaamu ŵasalile kuti, “Ndaŵile ilisa saba ni kutyosya mbopesi, ng'ombe nkambaku umo ni ngondolo nkambaku jumo pa kila chilisa.”<verse eid="NUM 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵampele che Balaamu maloŵe gatagasale ni kwasalila auje kwa che Balaki. <verse eid="NUM 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6" />Che Balaamu ŵausile, ŵasimene che Balaki ali ajimi palapala chiŵandi ni mbopesi jakutinisya, pamo ni achakulungwa wose ŵa ku Moabu.<verse eid="NUM 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7" />Che Balaamu ŵasasile aga maloŵe ga kulondola ga kuti;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">“Che Balaki amilasile apano kutyochela ku Alamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">Elo, mwenye jwa ku Moabu amilasile kutyochela ku matumbi ga ku ngopochelo lyuŵa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">Njise mwalwesye ŵandu ŵa che Yakubu kwaligongo lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">njise mwalalatile Ŵaisilaeli!<verse eid="NUM 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8" />Ana ngukombola kunlwesya mundu jwati Akunnungu ngananlwesya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:8">Ana ngukombola kwalalatila ŵandu ŵati Akunnungu nganiŵalalatila?<verse eid="NUM 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9" />Ngukombola kwawona kutyochela penani pa lwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Ngukombola kwalola kutyochela penani pa matumbi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Ŵele ali mpingo wa ŵandu ŵakutama jikape,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">akuimanyilila kuti apegwilwe upile kupunda ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine.<verse eid="NUM 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10" />Ŵani ŵakukombola kwaŵalanga winji wa ŵandu ŵa che Yakubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">pane kuganisisya ŵinji wa Ŵaisilaeli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Mweje mpela mwakuwilila ŵandu ŵakupanganya yaikwanonyelesya Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">mbesi jangu jiŵeje mpela ŵanyawo.”<verse eid="NUM 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11" />Pelepo, che Balaki ŵansalile che Balaamu kuti, “Ana muundendele yanti uli? Nannyichisye apano kuti mwalwesye ŵammagongo ŵangu, nambo pamalo pakwe nkwamba kwapa upile!” <verse eid="NUM 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12" />Che Balaamu ŵaasalile che Balaki kuti, “Une chimechete yaakusalila Ambuje Akunnungu pe.”<verse eid="NUM 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulondola kwaaŵili kwa che Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13" />Pelepo che Balaki ŵaasalile che Balaamu kuti, “Twende tujaule pamalo pane pati timpakombole kwawona; namose yeleyo timwawone ŵampepe ŵao, ngamwawona ŵanawose. Nipele mwalwesye kwaligongo lyangu nli njimi pelepo.” <verse eid="NUM 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14" />Nipele, che Balaki ŵampeleche che Balaamu ku ngunda waukuŵilanjikwa Sofimu penani pa litumbi lya Pisiga. Pelepo ŵataŵile sooni ilisa saba ni kutyochesya mbopesi pachanya pa chilisa chilichose, ng'ombe nkambaku umo ni ngondolo nkambaku jimo.<verse eid="NUM 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15" />Che Balaamu ŵasalile che Balaki kuti, “Njimeje panopano chiŵandi ni mbopesi jenu jakutinisya, ni une ngwaula ngasimane ni Ambuje Akunnungu akula.” <verse eid="NUM 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasimene ni che Balaamu, ŵampele maloŵe gatagaŵechete, ni kwasalila aujile kwa che Balaki. <verse eid="NUM 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17" />Nipele, che Balaamu ŵausile, ŵansimene che Balaki ali ajimi palapala chiŵandi ni mbopesi sya kutinisya pamo ni achakulu wose ŵa ku Moabu. Che Balaki ŵammusisye kuti, “Ambuje Akunnungu ansalile ichichi?” <verse eid="NUM 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18" />Pelepo, che Balaamu ŵasasile utenga wakwe:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">“Che Balaki njime ni kupilikanila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">muumbilikanile une ugwe mwanache jwa che Sipoli.<verse eid="NUM 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19" />Akunnungu nganaŵa mundu, kuti asale ya unami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">nganaŵa mundu, kuti agalausye nningwa wakwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Ana chalanje chindu pangachitenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">pane asale chindu pangachitindimisya?<verse eid="NUM 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20" />Nnole, une anajisye kuti naape upile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:20">nombewo ŵaapele upile ni une ngangukombola kugalausya.<verse eid="NUM 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21" />Ambuje Akunnungu nganauwona ugongomalo kwa ŵanache ŵa che Yakubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">namose makani pa Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵao ali pamo nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Ŵanyawo akulalichila kuti ali mwenye jwawo,<verse eid="NUM 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22" />Akunnungu jwaŵajigele kutyochela ku Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:22">akwamenyanila kwa machili mpela njati.<verse eid="NUM 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23" />Kusyene ngapagwa kwaloga ŵandu ŵa che Yakubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">namose usaŵi utiŵasiŵilile Ŵaisilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">Sambano kwagamba Ŵaisilaeli, ŵandu tajile kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">‘Nnole yakusimonjeka yatesile Akunnungu!’<verse eid="NUM 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24" />Nnole! Ŵaisilaeli ajimwiche nti lisimba lyankolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">ajiminji nti lisimba lyankambaku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">Ali nti lisimba lyangagona mpaka lili liuleje chinyama ni kuchitauna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">ni kung'wa miasi ja chinyama chachiuleje.”<verse eid="NUM 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25" />Pelepo che Balaki ŵasalile che Balaamu kuti, “Nkaalwesya atamuno nkaapa upile kusyene!” <verse eid="NUM 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26" />Nambo che Balaamu ŵajanjile che Balaki kuti, “Uli, nganinansalila kuti chakusala Ambuje Akunnungu chelecho ni chingusachilwa kutenda?”<verse eid="NUM 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulondola kwaatatu kwa che Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27" />Che Balaki ŵasalile che Balaamu kuti, “Njise, tinampeleche pamalo pane. Panepa Akunnungu chakunde kuti mwalwesye ŵandu wo kwaligongo lyangu kutyochela kweleko.” <verse eid="NUM 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28" />Nipele, che Balaki ŵanjigele che Balaamu mpaka penani pa chitumbi cha Peoli, pati mundu ajimaga akulola mu chipululu. <verse eid="NUM 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29" />Che Balaamu ŵasalile che Balaki kuti, “Muundaŵile ilisa saba pelepa, nipele muumichile chile ng'ombe mikambaku saba ni ngondolo mikambaku saba.” <verse eid="NUM 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30" />Che Balaki ŵatesile mpela iŵasalilwe ni che Balaamu, nipele ŵatyosisye pachanya pa chilisa chilichose mbopesi ja ngombe ja nkambaku jimo ni ngondolo jankambaku jimo.<verse eid="NUM 23:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1" />Nipele, che Balaamu paŵaiweni kuti Ambuje Akunnungu yaanonyele kwapa upile Ŵaisilaeli, nganajaula kukutenda chisango sooni nti kuundanda, nambo ŵaliji nkulolechesya ku chipululu. <verse eid="NUM 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2" />Ŵalolechesye mwinani ŵaaweni Ŵaisilaeli ali aŵisile chigono, lukosyo lulilose pamalo pakwe. Nipele Mbumu jwa Akunnungu ŵannyichilile, <verse eid="NUM 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3" />nombejo ŵaŵechetaga aga maloŵe gakulondola ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">Maloŵe gangu une che Balaamu mwanache jwa che Peoli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">maloŵe ga mundu jwaunukulikwe meso,<verse eid="NUM 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4" />maloŵe ga mundu jwapilikene maloŵe ga Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">mundu jwaiweni yakuiwona ya Akunnungu jwali ni machili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">mundu jwatindiŵele ni kukotema mpaka paasi ni kwiwona indu pangasisika.<verse eid="NUM 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5" />Masakasa genu gakusalala kwannope ŵanyamwe ŵandu ŵa che Yakubu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:5">elo, igono yenu ŵanyamwe ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli!<verse eid="NUM 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6" />Ili mpela machemba gagajenele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">mpela ngunda wa mwana mumbali mwa lusulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">mpela itela ya mishubili jepande ni Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">mpela itela ya mielesi mumbali mwa meesi.<verse eid="NUM 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7" />Tachikola ula jakwanila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">ni kupanda mbeju syao mmigunda jajili ni meesi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">Mwenye jwakwe tachiŵa jwankulu kupunda che Agagi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">umwenye wakwe tiuŵe wekulungwa kwannope.<verse eid="NUM 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8" />Akunnungu ŵaatyosisye ku Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">nombewo akwamenyanila kwa machili gawo mpela njati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">tachaulaga ŵammagongo ŵao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">tachatemangulanya maupa gawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">tachasoma ni mipamba jawo.<verse eid="NUM 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9" />Tachijuŵilila ni kugona paasi mpela lisimba lyankambaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">mpela lisimba lyankolo, nduni jwampaka apakombole kulijimusya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Apegwe upile jwelejo jutachapa upile Ŵaisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">alweseche jwelejo jutachalwesya.<verse eid="NUM 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10" />Che Balaki ŵaatumbilile che Balaamu, ŵagakwatile makono ni kwasalila, “Nammilasile mwalwesye ŵammagongo ŵangu, nambo katatu kose ka mwapele upile! <verse eid="NUM 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11" />Sambano ntyoche kwachitema njaule kumangwenu! Uneji nansalile kuti tinampe ntuuka wambone nnope, nambo Ambuje Akunnungu anjimile ntuuka wo!”<verse eid="NUM 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12" />Che Balaamu ŵanjanjile che Balaki kuti, “Uli, nganinaasalila aŵala ŵantenga umwaatumile kukwangu <verse eid="NUM 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13" />kuti namuno nkaambele nyuumba jenu jegumbale madini ga feza ni sahabu, uneji ngangombola kugakanila malajisyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu, pakutenda chindu chilichose, chiŵeje chambone pane changalumbana kwakusaka kwangu nansyene? Natite, chichaŵechete Ambuje Akunnungu chelecho chisale.”<verse eid="NUM 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulondola kwaambesi kwa che Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14" />“Sambano nguujila kwa ŵandu ŵangu, nambo nguunawe kutyoka, nninde nansalile indu ichaipanganye ŵandu ŵa, kwa ŵandu ŵenu pa moŵa gagakuika.” <verse eid="NUM 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15" />Nipele che Balaamu ŵatite:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">“Une che Balaamu mwanache jwa che Beoli, ni maloŵe gangu gali isyene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">kwapele mpilikanile utenga ŵangu!<verse eid="NUM 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16" />Lunda lwangu lukukopochela kwa Akumanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">Ambuje Akunnungu ŵali ni machili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">Ŵelewo ngwatindiŵalila ni kwakotamila mpaka paasi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">ni kwiwona yakwiwona nkati Ŵaisilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17" />Ngwalola ŵachaiche, nambo kanyuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">ngwawona, nambo ali kwakutalichila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Ndondwa tijikopochele pa uŵelesi wa che Yakubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">tachikopochela mwenye pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Kwa lubokola lwakwe tachaputa ilongola ŵa Ŵamoabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">tachiijonanga uŵelesi wa che Seti.<verse eid="NUM 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18" />Isilaeli tachapunda Ŵaedomu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">sooni tachapunda ni Ŵaseili ŵaali achammagongo ŵao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">Isilaeli tajendelechele kupunda kwakukulungwa.<verse eid="NUM 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19" />Jumo mwa uŵelesi u che Yakubu tachitawala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:19">nombejo tachajonanga wosepe ŵatasigalile mu musi wa ku Ali.”<verse eid="NUM 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20" />Nipele che Balaamu ŵaalolechesye Ŵaamaleki, ni ŵatite kuti:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">“Ŵaamaleki ali chilambo chachili ni machili kuipunda ilambo yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">nambo kumbesi tichijonanjikwe tikitiki.”<verse eid="NUM 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21" />Nipele che Balaamu ŵaalolechesye Ŵakeni, ni ŵatite kuti:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">“Pamalo pankutama pali ntendele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">mpela chisusi chetaŵe penani pa maganga.<verse eid="NUM 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22" />Nambo tinjonanjikwe mwanya Ŵakeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:22">Katema Ŵaashulu patachinjigala kwa machili?”<verse eid="NUM 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23" />Sooni che Balaamu ŵatite:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:23">“Ammati! Ana ŵani tachisigalila, Akunnungu pataachitendekanya yeleyo?<verse eid="NUM 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24" />Ngalaŵa tisiiche kutyochela ku Kitimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">tachijigunguluchila Ashulu ni Ebeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">nambo ŵanyawo nombe tachijonasikwa.”<verse eid="NUM 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25" />Nipele, che Balaamu ŵatyosile, ŵausile kumangwakwe; che Balaki nombe najo ŵatyosile ni kwaula.<verse eid="NUM 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25" />
  <para style="s">Ŵaisilaeli ku Peoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1" />Ŵaisilaeli paŵaliji ku Shitimu ko, achalume ŵatandite kutenda chikululu ni achakongwe ŵa ku Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2" />Achakongwe ŵa ŵaalalikaga Ŵaisilaeli alumbikane nawo paŵatyosyaga mbopesi kwa minungu jiŵajipopelelaga. <verse eid="NUM 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3" />Yeleyo ni iŵatite Ŵaisilaeli kulilumbikanya ni nnungu Baali jwa ku Peoli, nombe lutumbilo lwa Ambuje Akunnungu lwaichele Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4" />Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa kuti, “Mwajigale ilongola wosepe ŵa Ŵaisilaeli mwaulaje paujo pangu muusi mbee, kuti lutumbilo lwangu pa ŵanyamwe lumale.” <verse eid="NUM 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5" />Che Musa ŵaasalile Ilongola ŵa Ŵaisilaeli kuti, “Jwalijose mwa ŵanyamwe aulajeje mundu jwalijose pasikati jenu jwati alilumbikenye ni nnungu Baali jwa ku Peoli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6" />Katema kakoko jwannume jumo jwa Chiisilaeli ŵaiche ni jwankongwe jumo Mmidiani mu lisakasa lyakwe, akuno che Musa ni Ŵaisilaeli wose ali nkulila kwa malumbo, pannango wa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7" />Nipele, che Finehasi mwanache jwa che Eleasali mwanache jwa che Haluni jwambopesi paŵaiweni yeleyo, ŵajimwiche ni kuuleka mpingo wo ni kwaula kujigala mpamba <verse eid="NUM 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8" />ni ŵankuilisye ajula Mwisilaeli mpaka mu lisakasa, ŵaasomile mpamba wose ŵanaŵaŵili, ni wapelengenye pa lutumbo lwa ajula Mwisilaeli ni ajula jwankongwe. Ulwele wakogoya uwatesile Ŵaisilaeli awe walesile. <verse eid="NUM 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9" />Nambo ŵandu ŵaŵawile kwa ulwele wo ŵaliji ŵandu elufu ishilini na nne.<verse eid="NUM 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Musa kuti, <verse eid="NUM 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11" />“Che Finehasi mwanache jwa che Eleasali, mwanache jwa che Haluni jwambopesi, asiŵilile lutumbilo lwangu kwa Ŵaisilaeli; pasikati jenu ni jwelejo jikape ni jwakwete wiu nti ungwete une. Lyelelyo ni ligongo nganinaajonanga Ŵaisilaeli wosepe ni lutumbilo lwangu. <verse eid="NUM 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12" />Kwayele mwasalile kuti ngutenda lilangano najo lya chitendewele. <verse eid="NUM 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13" />Lilangano lyo lili lyakwatenda jwelejo ni uŵelesi wakwe tachiŵa ŵambopesi moŵa gose pangali mbesi ligongo ŵakwete wiu kwaligongo lyangu, une Akunnungu ŵakwe, ni kwatendela ujilanyo Ŵaisilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14" />Mwisilaeli juŵaulajikwe jo pamo ni jwankongwe jwa ku Midiani, ŵaŵilanjikwe che Simli mwanache jwa che Salu, chilongola jwa ntundu umo pa lukosyo lwa Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15" />Ni jwele jwankongwe jwa ku Midiani juŵaulajikwe jo ŵaŵilanjikwe che Kosibi mwali ju che Suli, juŵaliji chilongola jwa ntundu umo wa Ŵamidiani.<verse eid="NUM 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16" />Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa kuti, <verse eid="NUM 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17" />“Mwagungumuchile Ŵamidiani ni kwajonanga, <verse eid="NUM 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18" />kwaligongo lya yangalumbana iŵantesile paŵannambwisye nkati Peoli, ni kwa ligongo lya che Kosibi, mwali jwawo, juŵaulajikwe katema ka ulwele wakogoya uwalipwiche ku Peoli kula.”<verse eid="NUM 25:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26" />
  <para style="s">Ŵaisilaeli akuŵalanjikwa kaaŵili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1" />Ulwele ula pawamasile, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa ni che Eleasali mwanache jwa che Haluni jwambopesi kuti, <verse eid="NUM 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2" />“Mwaŵalanje mpingo wose wa Ŵaisilaeli, jwalijose malinga ni ŵapaulongo wao. Mwaŵalanje ŵandu wose kutandilila ŵandu ŵakwete yaka ishilini ni kwendelechela, ŵakuŵajilwa kwaula ku ngondo.” <verse eid="NUM 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3" />Kwayele che Musa ni che Eleasali jwambopesi ŵakungulwiche ni ŵandu ku chilambo chachili ku iŵata ya ku Moabu peesi lusulo lwa Yolodani, chiŵandika ni ku Yeliko, ŵaasalile, <verse eid="NUM 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4" />“Mwaŵalanje achalume ŵakwete yaka ishilini ni kwendelechela, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite kunnajisya che Musa.” Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵatyosile ku Misili ali aŵa: <verse eid="NUM 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5" />Lwaandanda luli lukosyo lwa Lobeni, jwakwitiwo jwa che Yakubu. Ŵandu ŵa akutyochela mmitundu ja Henoki ni Palu, <verse eid="NUM 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6" />ni Hesiloni ni Kalimi. <verse eid="NUM 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7" />Ŵandu ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Lobeni ŵaliji ŵandu elufu alobaini na tatu na mia saba na selasini. <verse eid="NUM 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8" />Uŵelesi wa che Palu ŵaliji che Eliabu, <verse eid="NUM 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9" />ni ŵanache ŵakwe che Nemueli, ni che Dasani ni che Abilamu. Ŵeleŵa ŵaŵili: Che Dasani ni che Abilamu, ni ŵaŵaliji asagulikwe kuŵa ilongola pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli wose, nambo ŵankanile che Musa ni che Haluni, ni ŵaliunjile ni ŵandu ŵaŵankuyaga che Kola katema paŵankanile Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10" />Katema ko lisi lyajaseme mpela kang'wa ni kwamila, ŵawile pamo ni che Kola ni ŵaŵankuyaga, mooto pawauleje ŵandu mia mbili na hamsini; ni yaliji majamuko kwa ŵandu wose. <verse eid="NUM 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11" />Pamo ni yeleyo ŵelewo ŵanache ŵa che Kola nganawa.<verse eid="NUM 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12" />Lukosyo lwa Simeoni kwaliji ni ntundu wa Nemueli, ni ntundu wa Yamini, ni ntundu wa Yakini, <verse eid="NUM 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13" />ni ntundu wa Sela ni ntundu wa Shauli. <verse eid="NUM 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14" />Jelejo jaliji mitundu ja lukosyo lwa Simeoni, ŵaliji ŵandu elufu ishilini na mbili na mia mbili.<verse eid="NUM 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15" />Lukosyo lwa Gadi mitundu jakwe jaliji Sefoni ni Hagi ni Shuni <verse eid="NUM 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16" />Osini ni Eli, <verse eid="NUM 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17" />ni Alodi ni Aleli. <verse eid="NUM 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18" />Ŵandu ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Gadi uŵaliji ni ukombole wa kwaula ku ngondo, ŵaliji achalume elufu alobaini na mia tano.<verse eid="NUM 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19" />Lukosyo lwa Yuda lwakwete ŵanache ŵa che Yuda, che Eli ni che Onani. Ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵa ŵawilile ku chilambo cha ku Kanaani. <verse eid="NUM 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20" />Lukosyo lwa Yuda lwaliji ni mitundu ja Pelesi, ni Sela. <verse eid="NUM 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21" />Kutyochela kwa che Pelesi kwapali mitundu jine jiŵili yaani Hesiloni ni Hamuli. <verse eid="NUM 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22" />Jeleji jaliji mitundu ja lukosyo lwa Yuda, ŵandu ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe uŵaliji ni ukombole wa kwaula ku ngondo ŵaliji achalume elufu sabini na sita na mia tano.<verse eid="NUM 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23" />Lukosyo lwa Isakali mitundu jakwe jaliji Tola, ni Pua, <verse eid="NUM 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24" />ni Yashubu ni Shimiloni. <verse eid="NUM 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25" />Jeleji jaliji mitundu ja lukosyo lwa Isakali, ŵandu ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe uŵaliji ni ukombole wa kwaula ku ngondo ŵaliji achalume elufu sitini na nne na mia tatu.<verse eid="NUM 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26" />Lukosyo lwa Sabuloni mitundu jakwe jaliji, Seledi, ni Eloni ni Yaleeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27" />Ŵandu ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Sabuloni, uŵaliji ni ukombole wakwaula ku ngondo ŵaliji achalume elufu sitini na mia tano.<verse eid="NUM 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28" />Che Yusufu ŵakwete ŵanache ŵaŵili, che Manase ni che Efulaimu. Ni kutyochela kukwawo ngosyo siŵili syakopochele, yaani lukosyo lwa Manase ni lukosyo lwa Efulaimu.<verse eid="NUM 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29" />Lukosyo lwa Manase lwaliji ni mitundu ja Makili juŵaliji atati ŵa che Gileadi. <verse eid="NUM 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30" />Ni Yeseli ni Heleki, <verse eid="NUM 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31" />ni Asilieli ni Shekemu, <verse eid="NUM 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32" />ni Shemeida ni Hefeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33" />Che Selofehadi mwanache jwa che Hefeli nganapata ŵanache ŵachilume nambo ŵachikongwe pe, nombewo ali che Mala ni che Noa ni che Holiga, ni che Milika ni che Tilisa. <verse eid="NUM 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34" />Jelejo ni mitundu ja lukosyo lwa Manase, ŵandu ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe uŵaliji ni ukombole wakwaula ku ngondo ŵaliji achalume elufu hansini na mbili na mia saba.<verse eid="NUM 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35" />Lukosyo lwa Efulaimu lwaliji ni mitundu ja Shutela ni Bekeli ni Tahani. <verse eid="NUM 26:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36" />Iyoyopeyo kutyochela ni ntundu wa Shutela kwakopochele ntundu wa Elani. <verse eid="NUM 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37" />Jelejo jose jaliji mitundu ja Efulaimu, ŵandu ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe uŵaliji ni ukombole wakwaula ku ngondo ŵaliji achalume elufu selasini na mbili na mia tano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:37">Mitundu josejo jo jakopochele ni ngosyo sya Manase ni Efulaimu ŵaŵaliji ŵanache ŵa che Yusufu.<verse eid="NUM 26:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38" />Lukosyo lwa Benjamini lwaliji ni mintundu ja Bela ni Ashibeli ni Ahilamu, <verse eid="NUM 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39" />ni Shufamu ni Hufamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40" />Iyoyo kwaliji ni mitundu ja Alidi ni Naamani jijakopochele ni ntundu wa Bela. <verse eid="NUM 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41" />Jelejo ni mitundu ja lukosyo lwa Benjamini, ŵandu ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe uŵaliji ni ukombole wakwaula ku ngondo ŵaliji achalume elufu alobaini na tano na mia sita.<verse eid="NUM 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42" />Lukosyo lwa Dani lwaliji ni ntundu wa Shuhamu; <verse eid="NUM 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43" />ŵandu ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe kutyochela mu lukosyo lu, uŵaliji ni ukombole wakwaula ku ngondo ŵaliji achalume elufu sitini na nne na mia nne.<verse eid="NUM 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44" />Lukosyo lwa Asheli lwaliji ni mitundu ja Imina, ni Ishivi ni Belia. <verse eid="NUM 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45" />Iyoyo peyo kutyochela ku ntundu wa Belia kwaliji ni mitundu ja Hebeli ni Malikieli. <verse eid="NUM 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46" />Asheli ŵakwete mwali jwaŵilanjikwe che Sela. <verse eid="NUM 26:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47" />Jeleji jose jaliji mitundu ja lukosyo lwa Asheli, ŵandu ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe uŵaliji ni ukombole wakwaula ku ngondo ŵaliji achalume elufu hansini na tatu na mia nne.<verse eid="NUM 26:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48" />Lukosyo la Nafutali lwaliji ni mitundu ja Yaseeli, ni Guni <verse eid="NUM 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49" />ni Yeseli ni Shilemu. <verse eid="NUM 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50" />Jeleji jose ni mitundu ja lukosyo lwa Nafutali, achalume ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe uŵaliji ni ukombole wakwaula ku ngondo ŵaliji elufu alobaini na tano na mia nne.<verse eid="NUM 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51" />Achalume wose ŵa Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe uŵaliji ni ukombole wa kwaula kungondo ŵaliji laki sita na elufu moja na mia saba ni selasini.<verse eid="NUM 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa kuti, <verse eid="NUM 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53" />“Mwagaŵile chilambo chiŵe chao ŵandu ŵa ngosyo si, malinga ni mwaŵelele winji wao. <verse eid="NUM 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54" />Lukosyo lwaluli ni ŵandu ŵajinji tilupegwe malo jekulungwa ni lukosyo lwaluli ni ŵandu kanondi tilupegwe malo jenandi. Lukosyo lulilose tilupegwe malo jiŵe jao malinga ni winji wa ŵandu ŵakwe. <verse eid="NUM 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55" />Namose yeleyo tinchigaŵanye chilambo kwa gudugudu. Lukosyo lulilose tilupegwe malo jawo malinga ni meena ga achachekulu ŵawo. <verse eid="NUM 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56" />Malo jao kila lukosyo tilugaŵikwe kwa gudugudu, kila lukosyo tilupate malinga ni winji wa ŵandu pane unandi wa ŵandu wakwe.”<verse eid="NUM 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57" />Mu lukosyo lwa Ŵalawi kwaliji ni mitundu ji jajilembekwe: Gelishoni, ni Kohati ni Melali, <verse eid="NUM 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58" />Iyoyo peyo kwaliji ni mitundu jajakopochele ni iŵelesi yao, jele mitundu jo ni lukosyo lwa Libini ni Hebuloni ni Mahaili, ni Mushi ni Kola. Ni che Kohati ŵaliji atatigwe che Amulamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59" />Ŵankwakwe che Amulamu ŵaŵilajikwe che Yokebedi mwali ju che Lawi juŵaŵelekwe ku Misili. Jweleju ŵammelechele che Amulamu ŵanache ŵaŵili achalume, che Haluni ni che Musa, ni mwali jumo, che Miliamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60" />Che Haluni ŵakwete ŵanache achalume ncheche: Che Nadabu ni che Abihu, ni che Eleasali ni che Itamali. <verse eid="NUM 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61" />Nambo che Nadabu ni che Abihu ŵawile paŵantyochesye mbopesi kwa mooto wangaukukundikwa ni Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62" />Ŵalawi ŵachilume uŵaliji ni mwesi umo ni kwendelechela ŵaliji elufu ishilini na tatu. Ŵeleŵa nganaŵalanjikwa pamo ni Ŵaisilaeli ŵane ligongo welewo nganapegwa malo jilijose jakuti jiŵe jao mu Isilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 26:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63" />Ŵelewo ni achalume Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe ni che Musa ni jwambopesi che Eleasali mu chilambo cha mwiŵata ya ku Moabu, peesi lusulo lwa Yolodani chiŵandika ni ku Yeliko. <verse eid="NUM 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64" />Pasikati jawo nganapagwa namose mundu juŵasigalile jwanjumi mwa aŵala ŵaŵaŵalanjikwe ni che Musa ni che Haluni pakuŵalanga kwaandanda kuŵakutesile mu chipululu cha Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasasile kuti ŵanawose tachiwilila mu chipululu, ni kusyene nganapagwa namose jumo jwawo juŵasigalile jwanjumi, ikaŵe che Kalebu mwanache ju che Yefune ni che Yoshua mwanache ju che Nuni ni ŵaŵasigalile.<verse eid="NUM 26:65" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27" />
  <para style="s">Achiŵali ŵa che Selofehadi akupegwa malo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1" />Pa lyuŵa limo achiŵali nsano ŵa che Selofehadi, yaani che Mala ni che Noa ni che Holiga ni che Milika ni che Tilisa ŵanjaulile che Musa. Che Selofeadi ŵaliji mwana jwa che Hefeli mwana cha che Gileadi mwana jwa che Makili mwana jwa che Manase, jwa ntundu wa Manase mwana jwa che Yusufu. <verse eid="NUM 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2" />Achiŵali wo ŵaiche ni kwima pannango wa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana paujo pa che Musa ni jwambopesi che Eleasali ni ilongola wosepe ŵa Ŵaisilaeli, ni Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵaliji pelepo. Ŵatite, <verse eid="NUM 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3" />“Atati ŵetu ŵaŵilile ku chipululu ni nganaleka mwanache jwalijose jwannume. Nganaŵa mu mpingo wa ŵandu ŵaŵankuyaga che Kola ŵaŵakamulangene ni kwakanila Ambuje Akunnungu, nambo ŵawile kwaligongo lya sambi jakwe nsyene. <verse eid="NUM 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4" />Ana liina lya atati ŵetu liwe ligongo nganakola mwanache jwannume? Ntupeje malo jetu pasikati ja achalongo achinjakwe atati ŵetu.”<verse eid="NUM 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5" />Che Musa ŵagapeleche magambo ga paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7" />“Ŵanache ŵa che Selofehadi wo chakuŵecheta cho chili chisyene; mwape malo pasikati pa alongo achinjakwe atati ŵawo. Mwape jwalijose malo jakwe jijikaliji ja atati ŵao. <verse eid="NUM 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8" />Nipele mwasalile Ŵaisilaeli kuti mundu jwalijose awaga pangaleka mwanache jwannume, mwali jwakwe tapegwe malo jijaliji ja atatigwe. <verse eid="NUM 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9" />Iŵaga nganakola mwanache jwankongwe, achapwakwe achalume apegwe malo jo kuti jiŵe jao. <verse eid="NUM 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10" />Ni iŵaga nganakola achapwakwe achalume, nipele achapwakwe ŵa atatigwe apegwe malo jo kuti jiŵe jao. <verse eid="NUM 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11" />Ni iŵaga atatigwe wo nganakola achapwakwe, nipele nlongo njakwe ŵa liŵasa limo apegwe malo jo jiŵe jakwe chisyenesyene. Lyeleli lili lilajisyo limo mu malajisyo gose kwa Ŵaisilaeli. Ŵaisilaeli agakamulichisye malajisyo ga ni makanyo ga mpela une Ambuje Akunnungu munanlamulile mmwejo.”<verse eid="NUM 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yoshua akupegwa ulongosi pamalo pa che Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 31:1-8">Chikumbuchisyo cha Malajisyo 31:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa kuti, “Nkwele penani pa achi chitumbi cha Abalimu nipele nkachilole chilambo chinaapele Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13" />Mwamalaga kuchilola, mmwe nombe tinchiwa mpela muŵatendele akulu ŵenu che Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14" />ligongo ŵanyamwe nganinjitichisya malajisyo gangu akula ku chipululu cha Sini kula. Katema mpingo wosepe wa ŵandu paŵalalatile nkati une akula ku Meliba, nganinleka ukulu wangu uloleche paujo pao paŵasachile kuti apegwe meesi.” Meliba jili nduluko ja meesi jili ku Kadeshi mchipululu cha Sini.<verse eid="NUM 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15" />Nombe che Musa ŵapopelele Ambuje Akunnungu kuti, <verse eid="NUM 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16" />“Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu unkwapa ŵandu umi, ngummenda munsagule mundu jutachajimilila ŵandu ŵa, <verse eid="NUM 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17" />jutachalongolela ni kwalongosya mmasengo gawo gose, kuti akaika kuŵa mpela ngondolo syangali ni jwakuchinga.”<verse eid="NUM 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa kuti, “Munjigale che Yoshua mwanache jwa che Nuni, mundu jwakwete mbumu jwangu munkati mwakwe, nipele munsajichile makono, <verse eid="NUM 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19" />ni kunjimika paujo pa jwambopesi che Eleasali ni Ŵaisilaeli wose, nipele mwape masengo go wosepe ali nkulola. <verse eid="NUM 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20" />Mwape ulamusi wenu kanandi kuti Ŵaisilaeli wose ampikanileje. <verse eid="NUM 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21" />Jwelejo tachinkulupilila che Eleasali jwambopesi, jutachimmanyisya indu inguisaka kwa litala lya liganga lya Ulimu ni Tumimu. Kwa litala li, che Eleasali tachalongosya che Yoshua ni Ŵaisilaeli wose mu ipanganyo yao yose.” <verse eid="NUM 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22" />Che Musa ŵatesile mpela muŵalamulikwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu. Ŵanjigele che Yoshua ni kunjimika paujo pa jwambopesi che Eleasali ni paujo pa Ŵaisilaeli wose. <verse eid="NUM 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23" />Nipele ŵansajichile makono pantwe ni kwapa ulamusi wakwalongosya Ŵaisilaeli mpela iŵalajichikwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="NUM 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28" />
  <para style="s">Mbopesi syasikutyochekwa kila lyuŵa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 29:38-46">Kutyoka 29:38-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa kuti, <verse eid="NUM 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2" />wape Ŵaisilaeli lilajisyo li ni kwasalila kuti akusachilwa ambelechele une pa katema kakwe kakaŵichikwe chakulya kwaligongo lya mbopesi syakutinisya ni mooto, jiŵe ununjile wambone waukuunonyelesya.<verse eid="NUM 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3" />Mwasalile kuti mbopesi syasisimbelechele une pakutinisya pa mooto, tisiŵe syelesi: Ngondolo siŵili sya chaaka chimo syangalemala kose, kwaligongo lya mbopesi jakutinisya ja kila lyuŵa. <verse eid="NUM 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4" />Ngondolo jimo tijityosekwe kundaŵi ni jaaŵili tijityosekwe ligulo; <verse eid="NUM 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5" />jajilijose tijityosekwe pamo ni mbopesi ja utandi kilo jimo wewanganye pamo ni lita jimo ja mauta gambone ga miseituni. <verse eid="NUM 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6" />Jeleji jili mbopesi jajikutyosekwa kila lyuŵa jajikutiniswa pa mooto, jijatyosekwe kaandanda pa chitumbi cha Sinai nti mbopesi ja yakulya, ununjile wambone waukwanonyelesya Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7" />Mbopesi ja yakung'wa tijityosekwe pamo ni kila ngondolo jangakomala jili lita jimo ja chakung'wa chaakalipa. Njitilileje mbopesi ja yakung'wa mu Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana. <verse eid="NUM 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8" />Ligulo lyakwe tinjityose ngondolo jaaŵili jila kuŵa mbopesi jakutinisya pamooto mpela ilaila intesile kwa mbopesi ja kundaŵi, pamo ni mbopesi jakwe ja yakung'wa, Jelejo nombe jili mbopesi ja yakulya, ununjile wambone waukwanonyelesya Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="NUM 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbopesi sya Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9" />Pa lyuŵa lya kupumulila, tintyosye mbopesi ja ngondolo siŵili syankambaku sya chaka chimo syangalemala, ni mbopesi ja utandi wesyajiche yambone kilo siŵili, ni mbopesi jakwe ja yakung'wa. <verse eid="NUM 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10" />Aji mbopesi ja kutinisya ji tijityosekwe kila Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila pamo ni mbopesi ja kutinisya ja kila lyuŵa ni mbopesi ja yakung'wa.<verse eid="NUM 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbopesi sya kuundanda kwa kila mwesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11" />Kuundanda kwa kila mwesi, timumpelechele Ambuje Akunnungu mbopesi jakutinisya: Ng'ombe mikambaku jiŵili jangakomala, ngondolo jankambaku jimo ni ngondolo saba syankambaku sya chaka chimo, syangalemala. <verse eid="NUM 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12" />Tintyosye mbopesi ja utandi wesyajiche yambone kilo sitatu, wewanganye ni mauta pa kila ngombe jimo; tintyose kilo siŵili sya utandi pa kila ngondolo jankambaku, <verse eid="NUM 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13" />ni kilo jimo ja utandi pa kila ngondolo saba sila. Asi mbopesi sya kutinisya si, sili mbopesi sya yakulya syasikununjila yambone kwakwanonyelesya Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14" />Chipimo cha mbopesi sya yakung'wa chachikusachilwa chili lita siŵili sya divai pa kila ng'ombe nkambaku; lita jimo ni nusu pa kila ngondolo jankambaku, ni lita jimo pa kila ngondolo syangakomala sila. Jeleji jili mbopesi jakutinisya ja kila mwesi pa chaka chansima. <verse eid="NUM 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15" />Pamo ni ajila mbopesi jakutinisya ja kila lyuŵa ni mbopesi jakwe ja yakung'wa, timumpelechele Ambuje Akunnungu mbopesi ja kutyosya sambi, mbusi tonde jimo.<verse eid="NUM 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbopesi ja Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:5-14">Ŵalawi 23:5-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16" />Pa lyuŵa lya kumi na nne lya mwesi waandanda jili Pasaka ja Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17" />Pa lyuŵa lya kumi na tano lya mwesi uwowo lili lyuŵa lyekulungwa. Tinlye mikate jangata amila kwa moŵa saba. <verse eid="NUM 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18" />Pa lyuŵa lyaandanda chinsongangane kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu. Pa lyuŵa lyo ngampanganya masengo. <verse eid="NUM 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19" />Chimpeleche mbopesi jakutinisya nti mbopesi ja yakulya kwa Ambuje Akunnungu: Ng'ombe mikambaku jangakomala jiŵili, ngondolo jankambaku jimo, ngondolo syankambaku saba sya chaka chimo, ŵanawose aŵeje ŵangalemala. <verse eid="NUM 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20" />Pa kila ng'ombe nkambaku nlinganye mbopesi ja kilo tatu ja utandi wesyajiche yambone wewanganye ni mauta ga miseituni ni kilo mbili pa ngondolo jankambaku jimo, <verse eid="NUM 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21" />ni kilo jimo pa kila ngondolo jimo mwa asila ngondolo saba sila. <verse eid="NUM 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22" />Chintyosye mbusi tonde jimo jiŵe mbopesi jakutyosya sambi kuti kwatendela ujilanyo. <verse eid="NUM 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23" />Tintyosye ayi indu yi pangajiliŵalila ajila mbopesi jakutinisya ja kawaida jajikutyosyekwa pa kila lyuŵa kundaŵi. <verse eid="NUM 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24" />Iyoyo peyo, kwa moŵa saba, tintyosye mbopesi jakutinisya ja kila lyuŵa ja yakulya kwa kujitinisya pa mooto, jati ununjile wakwe wambone tiwanonyelesye Ambuje Akunnungu. Tinjityosye mbopesi jo pangajiliŵalila ajila mbopesi jakutinisya ja kila lyuŵa ni mbopesi jakwe ja yakung'wa. <verse eid="NUM 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25" />Pa lyuŵa lya saba tinsongangane kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu; nkatenda masengo.<verse eid="NUM 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbopesi sya ijuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:15-22">Ŵalawi 23:15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26" />Pa lyuŵa lyaandanda lya chindimba cha ijuma katema pankwapelechela Ambuje Akunnungu milimbu ja yakulya yenu, tinsongangane kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu; nkatenda masengo. <verse eid="NUM 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27" />Timpeleche mbopesi jakutinisya, ununjile wakwe wambone tiwanonyelesye Ambuje Akunnungu: Ngombe mikambaku jiŵili jangakomala, ngondolo nkambaku umo, ni ngondolo syankambaku saba sya chaka chimo, wosepe aŵeje ŵangalemala. <verse eid="NUM 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28" />Mbopesi ja utandi jachijityosekwe pamo najo tijiŵe kilo tatu sya utandi wambone wewanganye ni mauta ga miseituni pa kila ng'ombe, ni kilo siŵili pa kila ngondolo jankambaku jimo, <verse eid="NUM 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29" />ni kilo jimo pa kila ngondolo saba sila. <verse eid="NUM 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30" />Tintyosye mbusi tonde jimo jiŵe mbopesi jakutyosya sambi kuti kumpanganyichisya ujilanyo. <verse eid="NUM 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31" />Timpeleche ayi indu yi pangajiliŵalila ajila mbopesi jakutinisya ja kila lyuŵa pamo ni mbopesi ja yakung'wa. Inyama yi iŵeje yangalemala kose.<verse eid="NUM 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29" />
  <para style="s">Chindimba cha lyuŵa lyekulungwa lya kuchitanda chaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:23-25">Ŵalawi 23:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1" />Pa lyuŵa lyaandanda lya mwesi wa saba, tinsongangane kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu. Nkatenda masengo. Lyelelyo lili lyuŵa lyakugomba mapenga. <verse eid="NUM 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2" />Timpeleche mbopesi jakutinisya, ununjile wakwe tiwanonyelesye Ambuje Akunnungu: Ng'ombe syangakomala siŵili, ni ngondolo syankambaku siŵili ni ngondolo syankambaku saba sya chaka chimo, wosepe aŵeje ŵangalemala kose. <verse eid="NUM 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3" />Sooni timpeleche mbopesi jakwe ja utandi wambone wewanganye ni mauta ga miseituni: Kilo sitatu pa kila ngombe ni kilo siŵili pa kila ngondolo, <verse eid="NUM 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4" />ni kilo jimo pa kila ngondolo jimo pa ngondolo saba sila. <verse eid="NUM 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5" />Sooni timpeleche mbusi tonde jimo jiŵe mbopesi jakutyosya sambi kuti ampanganyichisye ujilanyo. <verse eid="NUM 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6" />Timpeleche ayi indu yi pangaliŵalila ni ajila mbopesi jakutinisya ja kila mwesi ni mbopesi jakwe ja yakulya, ni mbopesi jakutinisya ja kila lyuŵa pamo ni mbopesi jakwe ya yakulya ni mbopesi syakwe sya yakungwa mpela yaikuti kusachilwa jiŵe ununjile wambone wakunonyelesya, ni mbopesi kwa Ambuje Akunnungu jajitinichikwe pa mooto.<verse eid="NUM 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakupeleka ya pa lyuŵa ujilanyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:26-32">Ŵalawi 23:26-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7" />Pa lyuŵa lya kumi lya mwesi wa saba tinsongangane kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu. Pa lyuŵa lyo ntaŵeje ni sooni nkapanganya masengo galigose. <verse eid="NUM 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8" />Timwapeleche Ambuje Akunnungu mbopesi jakutinisya pa mooto, ununjile wakwe tiwanonyelesye Ambuje Akunnungu: Ng'ombe nkambaku jimo jangakomala, ni ngondolo jankambaku jimo ni ngondolo syankambaku saba sya chaka chimo. Ŵanawose aŵeje ŵangalemala kose. <verse eid="NUM 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9" />Pamo ni yele indu yo, timwapelechele mbopesi ja utandi wambone kilo sitatu wewanganye ni mauta ga miseituni pamo ni ng'ombe nkambaku jila, kilo siŵili pamo ni ajila ngondolo jankambaku jimo jila, <verse eid="NUM 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10" />ni kilo jimo pa kila ngondolo kwa ngondolo saba sila. <verse eid="NUM 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11" />Sooni timpeleche mbusi tonde jimo kwaligongo lya mbopesi jakutyosya sambi pamo ni ajila mbopesi jakutendelwa ujilanyo, pamo ni mbopesi ja kila lyuŵa ja kutinisya ni mbopesi jakwe ja utandi ni mbopesi syakwe sya yakung'wa.<verse eid="NUM 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbopesi ja pa chindimba cha masakasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-44">Ŵalawi 23:33-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12" />Pa lyuŵa lya kumi na tano lya mwesi wa saba, tinsongangano kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu. Nkatenda masengo pa lyuŵa lyo. Ntendeje chindimba chakwachimbichisya Ambuje Akunnungu kwa moŵa saba. <verse eid="NUM 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13" />Timwapelechele mbopesi jakutinisya pa mooto, ununjile wambone waukwanonyelesya Ambuje Akunnungu: Ng'ombe mikambaku syangakomala kumi na tatu, ni ngondolo syankambaku siŵili ni ngondolo syankambaku kumi na nne sya chaka chimo. Syosepe siŵeje syangalema kose. <verse eid="NUM 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14" />Pamo ni asila ng'ombe syankambaku kumi na tatu sila, pa kila ng'ombe jityosyekwe ni mbopesi ja utandi wambone wewanganye ni mauta: Kilo sitatu pa kila ngombe nkambaku umo, ni kilo siŵili pa kila ngondolo jimo, <verse eid="NUM 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15" />ni kilo jimo pa kila ngondolo kwa asila ngondolo kumi na nne sila. <verse eid="NUM 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16" />Sooni timwapelechele mbusi tonde jimo jiŵe mbopesi jakutyosya sambi, pangajiliŵalila ajila mbopesi ja kila lyuŵa jakutinisya jila, pamo ni mbopesi jakwe ja utandi ni mbopesi jakwe ja yakung'wa.<verse eid="NUM 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17" />Pa lyuŵa lyaŵili lyakwe timpeleche Ng'ombe mikambaku syangakomala kumi na mbili, ni ngondolo syankambaku siŵili, ni ngondolo syankambaku kumi na nne sya chaka chimo, syosepe syo syangalemala. <verse eid="NUM 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18" />Sooni timpeleche mbopesi ja utandi ni mbopesi sya yakung'wa pamo ni asila ng'ombe, ni ngondolo syankambaku siŵili sila ni ngondolo syankambaku kumi na nne sya chaka chimo sila, <verse eid="NUM 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19" />tintyosye mbusi tonde jimo kwaligongo mbopesi jakutyosya sambi pagaliŵalila ajila mbopesi jakutinisya ja kila lyuŵa pamo ni mbopesi jakwe ja utandi ni mbopesi jakwe ja yakung'wa.<verse eid="NUM 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20" />Pa lyuŵa lyaatatu timpeleche: Ng'ombe mikambaku kumi na moja ni ngondolo syankambaku siŵili ni ngondolo syankambaku kumi na nne sya chaka chimo, syosepe syangalemala. <verse eid="NUM 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21" />Timpeleche pamo ni mbopesi ja utandi ni mbopesi sya yakung'wa malinga ni uŵalanjikwe wao mpela yaikuti kulajiswa. <verse eid="NUM 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22" />Iyoyo peyo timpeleche mbusi tonde jimo kwaligongo lya mbopesi jakutyosya sambi, pangaliŵalila mbopesi ja kila lyuŵa ja kutinisya pamo ni mbopesi jakwe ja utandi ni mbopesi jakwe ja yakung'wa.<verse eid="NUM 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23" />Pa lyuŵa lya ncheche timpeleche: Ng'ombe mikambaku kumi ni ngondolo syankambaku siŵili ni ngondolo syankambaku kumi na nne sya chaka chimo, syosepe syangalemala. <verse eid="NUM 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24" />Sooni timpeleche mbopesi ja utandi ni mbopesi ja yakung'wa pamo ni syele ng'ombe ni ngondolo siŵili ni ngondolo syankambaku kumi na nne, mpela yaikuti kulajiswa. <verse eid="NUM 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25" />Sooni timpeleche mbusi tonde jimo kwaligongo lya mbopesi ja jakutyosya sambi pangaliŵalila mbopesi ja kila lyuŵa jakutinisya ni mbopesi jakwe ja utandi ni mbopesi jakwe ja yakung'wa.<verse eid="NUM 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26" />Pa lyuŵa lyansano timpeleche ng'ombe mikambaku tisa, ngondolo syankambaku siŵili ni ngondolo syankambaku kumi na nne sya chaka chimo, syosepe siŵeje syangalemala. <verse eid="NUM 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27" />Sooni timpele mbopesi ja utandi ni mbopesi ja yakung'wa pamo ni syele ngombe ni ngondolo siŵili ni ngondolo kumi na nne malinga ni uŵalanjikwe wao mpela yaikuti kulajiswa. <verse eid="NUM 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28" />Iyoyo peyo timpeleche mbusi tonde jimo kwaligongo lya mbopesi jakutyosya sambi, pangaliŵalila ni ajila mbopesi jakutinisya ja kila lyuŵa ni mbopesi jakwe ja utandi ni mbopesi jakwe ja yakung'wa.<verse eid="NUM 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29" />Pa lyuŵa lya sita timpeleche ng'ombe mikambaku nane, ni ngondolo syankambaku siŵili ni ngondolo syankambaku kumi na nne sya chaka chimo, syosepe siŵeje syangalema. <verse eid="NUM 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30" />Iyoyo peyo timpeleche mbopesi ja utandi ni mbopesi ja yakung'wa pamo ni syele ng'ombe ni ngondolo siŵili ni ngondolo kumi na nne sya chaka chimo sila, malinga ni uŵalanjikwe wao mpela yaikuti kulajiswa. <verse eid="NUM 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31" />Sooni timpeleche mbusi tonde jimo kuŵa mbopesi jakutyosya sambi, pangaliŵalila ni mbopesi jakwe ja utandi ni mbopesi jakwe ja yakung'wa.<verse eid="NUM 29:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32" />Pa lyuŵa lya saba timpeleche ng'ombe mikambaku saba ni ngondolo syankambaku siŵili, ni ngondolo syankambaku kumi na nne sya chaka chimo, syosepe siŵeje syangalemala. <verse eid="NUM 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33" />Sooni timpeleche mbopesi ja utandi ni mbopesi ja yakung'wa pamo ni syele ng'ombe syo ni ngondolo syankambaku siŵili ni ngondolo syankambaku kumi na nne sya chaka chimo malinga ni uŵalanjikwe wao mpela yaikuti kulajiswa. <verse eid="NUM 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34" />Sooni timpeleche mbusi tonde jimo jiŵe mbopesi ja sambi, pamo ni ajila mbopesi ja kila lyuŵa jakutinisya, pangaliŵalila mbopesi jakwe ja utandi ni mbopesi jakwe ja yankung'wa.<verse eid="NUM 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35" />Pa lyuŵa lya nane tintende nsongangano wekulungwa wa kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu. Nkatenda masengo pa lyuŵa lyo. <verse eid="NUM 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36" />Timpeleche mbopesi jakutinisya ununjile wambone waukwanonyelesya Ambuje Akunnungu: Ng'ombe jankambaku jimo, ni ngondolo jankambaku jimo, ni ngondolo syankambaku saba sya chaka chimo, syosepe siŵeje syangalemala. <verse eid="NUM 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37" />Sooni timpeleche mbopesi ja utandi ni mbopesi ja yakung'wa pamo ni ngombe ni ngondolo jimo jo ni asila ngondolo syankambaku saba, malinga ni uŵalanjikwe wao mpela yaikuti kulajiswa. <verse eid="NUM 29:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38" />Sooni timpeleche mbusi tonde jimo jiŵe mbopesi jakutyosya sambi, pamo ni ajila mbopesi ja kutinisya ja kila lyuŵa pangaliŵalila mbopesi jakwe ja utandi ni mbopesi jakwe ja yakung'wa.<verse eid="NUM 29:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39" />Gelega ni malajisyo gankati mbopesi syakutinisya, mbopesi sya utandi ni mbopesi sya chitendewele tisimwapelechele Ambuje Akunnungu pa katema ka indimba yenu yepanje. Pamo ni syele mbopesi syose syo, sipali mbopesi syakutinisya ni sya utandi ni sya yakung'wa, sinkwapelechela Ambuje Akunnungu kukwanilisya nasili syenu ni mbopesi syenu sinkupeleka kwakusaka kwenu. <verse eid="NUM 29:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40" />Nipele che Musa ŵaasalile ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli kila chindu mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite pakwasalila.<verse eid="NUM 29:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30" />
  <para style="s">Malajisyo gankati ilumbilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1" />Nipele che Musa ŵakungulwiche ni ilongola ŵa ngosyo sya Isilaeli, ŵasalile kuti Ambuje Akunnungu aanajisye nansalile.<verse eid="NUM 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2" />Mundu ataŵaga nasili kwa Ambuje Akunnungu pane alumbililaga kuti akusaka kwatyochesya Akunnungu chindu ni kulitaŵa nsyene kwa chilumbilo cho, akagalausya maloŵe gakwe; akusachilwa apanganye yanayose yasasile nsyene kwa kang'wa jakwe.<verse eid="NUM 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3" />Mwali jwalijose jwati akutama ku nyuumba kwa atatigwe, aŵikaga nasili kwa Ambuje Akunnungu kuti tampe chindu, <verse eid="NUM 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4" />akuno atatigwe ali apilikene chilanga cho ni nganankanila, nipele akusachilwa atindimisye nasili syakwe kwa kupeleka kila chindu chalanjile. <verse eid="NUM 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5" />Nambo iŵaga atatigwe apilikene nkati jele nasili jo, ni kunkanila mwali jwakwe, nipele nasili syakwe ni ilanga yakwe ngaintaŵa. Ambuje Akunnungu tachinnechelesya ligongo atatigwe achikanile chele chindu cho.<verse eid="NUM 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6" />Iŵaga mwali chalombekwe ali aŵisile nasili, pane ali alanjile pangaganichisya yambone, ni kulitaŵa nsyene, <verse eid="NUM 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7" />nombe ŵankwakwe apilikene chele chindu cho ni nganankanila, akusachilwa atende mpela iŵatite kusala. <verse eid="NUM 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8" />Nambo iŵaga ŵankwakwe apilikene chele chindu cho ni kunkanila, nipele jwele ŵankwakwe jo ngasachilwa kutenda aila yasasile yo, nombe Ambje Akunnungu tachinnechelela. <verse eid="NUM 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9" />Nambo nasili pane chilanga chilichose chaŵisile jwankongwe jwawililwe ni ŵankwakwe pane jwankongwe jwapegwilwe talaka chati akusachilwa atindimisye.<verse eid="NUM 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10" />Nambo jwankongwe jwalombekwe aŵikaga nasili pane alangaga kwa chilumbilo ali ku nyuumba kwa ŵankwake, <verse eid="NUM 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11" />nipele ŵankwakwe apilikanaga, ni nganankanila pane nganansalila chindu chilichose, nipele jwankongwe akusachilwa atende yanayose yasasile. <verse eid="NUM 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12" />Nambo iŵaga ŵankwakwe apilikene chele chindu cho ni kunkanila, nipele jwele ŵankwakwe jo ngasachilwa kutenda aila yasasile yo, nombe Ambje Akunnungu tachinnechelela. <verse eid="NUM 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13" />Ŵankwakwe wo akukombola kwitichisya pane kukanila nasili pane ilanga iliyose yakuitenda. <verse eid="NUM 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14" />Nambo iŵaga ŵankwakwe ngaaŵecheta chindu chilichose kutandilila pa lyuŵa lichapikane ngani sya nasili pane ilanga ya jwankongwe jwakwe, nikuti ajitichisye pa lyuŵa lilyolyo papilikene ngani syakwe ligongo nganaŵecheta chilichose kukanila. <verse eid="NUM 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15" />Nambo asikanilaga ni kusigalausya pa katema ni pakumala kupilikana ngani syakwe, nipele ŵelewo tachiŵa jwaulemwa pa chileŵo cha ŵankwakwe.<verse eid="NUM 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16" />Gelega ni malajisyo gati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanlajisye che Musa kwagamba ŵalume ni ŵakongwe; atati ni mwali jwakwe, jwele mwali jo ali nganaŵe kulombekwa ni akutama ku nyuumba ja atatigwe.<verse eid="NUM 30:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31" />
  <para style="s">Ŵaisilaeli akuputana ngondo ni Ŵamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa, kuti, <verse eid="NUM 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2" />“Mwauchisye Ŵamidiani indu iŵaatendele Ŵaisilaeli; nipele mmwejo tinchiwa.”<verse eid="NUM 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3" />Nipele che Musa ŵasalile ŵandu kuti, “Mwaŵiche chile ŵandu kwa ngondo ajaule kukwagunguluchila Ŵamidiani kwauchisya kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu aila yatutesile uwe. <verse eid="NUM 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4" />Kutyochela pa kila lukosyo lwa Ŵaisilaeli, timwapeleche ŵandu elufu moja ku ngondo.”<verse eid="NUM 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5" />Nipele, ŵandu elufu moja ŵasagulikwe pa kila lukosyo pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli achajinji, ŵaliji achalume elufu kumi nambili ŵaakwete yakumenyanilana. <verse eid="NUM 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6" />Che Musa ŵaajawisye ku ngondo ŵandu elufu moja kutyochela pa kila lukosyo, achilongoswaga ni che Finehasi mwanache jwa jwambopesi che Eleasali, ali ni yoombo ya peuto papaswela ni mapenga ga kupeleka imanyisyo. <verse eid="NUM 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7" />Ŵachigungumuchile chilambo cha ku Midiani, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵanlamulile che Musa, ŵauleje achalume wose. <verse eid="NUM 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8" />Pasikati ja ŵandu ŵaŵaulajikwe wo, kwaliji ni mamwenye nsano ŵa ku Midiani: Che Evi ni che Lekemu ni che Suli ni che Huli ni che Leba. Iyoyo peyo ŵauleje che Balaamu mwanache jwa che Beoli.<verse eid="NUM 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵaakamwile achakongwe ŵa Chimidiani ni kwajigala pamo ni ŵanache ŵao ni sooni ŵajigele kwa machili mipingo ja ng'ombe ni ngondolo ni ipanje yao yose. <verse eid="NUM 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10" />Ŵajitinisye mooto misi jao jose mwakutama, ni igono yao yose. <verse eid="NUM 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11" />Ŵajigele iŵaisumwile yose ni mateeka wose ya ŵandu ni inyama, <verse eid="NUM 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12" />ŵampelechele che Musa ni che Eleasali, ni mpingo wose wa Ŵaisilaeli uwaliji ku chigono ku chilambo cha mwiŵata ya ku Moabu, peesi lusulo lwa Yolodani chiŵandika ni ku Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵangondo akuuja kutyochela ku ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13" />Che Musa ni jwambopesi che Eleasali ni ilongola wosepe ŵa Ŵaisilaeli ŵatyosile pa chigono, ŵapite kukwachingamila ŵangondo paasa chigono. <verse eid="NUM 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14" />Che Musa ŵaatumbilile achakulungwa ŵangondo ni ilongola ŵaŵajimililaga mipingo ja ŵangondo elufu moja ni mipingo ja ŵangondo mia moja ŵaŵausile kutyochela ku ngondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15" />Che Musa ŵausisye, “Ligongo chichi mwalesile achakongwe wose ŵa ali ŵajumi? <verse eid="NUM 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16" />Nkumbuchilanje kuti achakongwe ni ŵaŵakuiye maloŵe ga che Balaamu, ŵaatesile Ŵaisilaeli ŵaaleche Ambuje Akunnungu akula ku Peoli mpaka ulwele wakogoya waichile ŵandu ŵakwe Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17" />Kwayele, mwaulaje ŵanache wosepe achalume ni jwankongwe jwalijose jwawahiye kuwonegana ni jwannume. <verse eid="NUM 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18" />Nambo achiŵali wose ŵanganawahi kuwonegana ni achalume nkaaulaga; mwaleche ŵajumi kwaligongo lyenu mwachimisyene. <verse eid="NUM 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19" />Aŵala ŵanawose ŵaali pasikati jenu ŵauleje mundu pane kugakwaya malilo akusachilwa atame paasa pa chigono kwa moŵa saba; nliswejesye pamo ni ŵanawose umwajigele, pa lyuŵa lyaatatu ni lyasaba. <verse eid="NUM 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20" />Nombe nkusachilwa nchape yakuwala, kila chindu chekolochekwe ni lipende, ni manyunya ga ngondolo pane ni chitela.”<verse eid="NUM 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21" />Jwambopesi che Eleasali ŵaasalile achalume ŵausile ku ngondo kuti, “Lyeleli ni lilajisyo lya Ambuje Akunnungu liŵapele che Musa. <verse eid="NUM 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22" />Madini ga sahabu ni feza ni shaba ni chisyano ni libati ni madini ga lisasi, <verse eid="NUM 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23" />malumbo gakwe indu yanayose yaikupililila mooto, nnyiswejesye pakuiŵika pa mooto. Namose yeleyo, ikusachilwa iswejechekwe ni meesi gauswejesyo. Indu ine yose yangakomboleka kuiŵika pa mooto nnyiswejesye pakuichapa ni meesi go. <verse eid="NUM 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24" />Pa lyuŵa lya saba ikusachilwa nchapeje yakuwala yenu; pelepo timme ŵasalele ni kukundikwa kwinjila pa chigono.”<verse eid="NUM 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugaŵana indu yose iŵasumwile kwa Ŵamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa, ŵansalile kuti, <verse eid="NUM 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26" />“Ŵalakwejo ni jwambopesi che Eleasali pamo ni ilongola ŵa ngosyo sya Ŵaisilaeli, mmalanje indu yasumwile ku ngondo, ŵandu ni inyama. <verse eid="NUM 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27" />Ngaŵanye indu yasumwile pa maunjili gaŵili, liunjili limo lya ŵangondo ni liunjili liine kwaligongo lya Ŵaisilaeli wose. <verse eid="NUM 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28" />Nipele pa alila liunjili lya ŵangondo ŵaŵajawile ku ngondo, nsapule yakwapelechela Ambuje Akunnungu: Chindu chimo pa kila indu mia tano, iŵeje ŵandu ni ng'ombe ni mbunda ni ngondolo pane mbusi, <verse eid="NUM 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29" />mpeleche kwa jwambopesi che Eleasali kuŵa mbopesi kwa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30" />Pa alila liunjili lya Ŵaisilaeli wosepe, njigale chindu chimo pa kila indu hansini, iŵeje ŵandu ni ng'ombe ni mbunda ni ngondolo pane mbusi pane inyama ine. Kwayele timwape Ŵalawi ŵakupanganya masengo pa Lisakasa lya kusimanilana.” <verse eid="NUM 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31" />Che Musa ni jwambopesi che Eleasali ŵatesile mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵansalile che Musa.<verse eid="NUM 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32" />Indu iŵasumwile ŵangondo kungondo ila yaliji: Ngondolo laki sita na elufu sabini na tano, <verse eid="NUM 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33" />ng'ombe Elufu sabini na mbili, <verse eid="NUM 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34" />mbunda Elufu sitini na moja, <verse eid="NUM 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35" />ni achiŵali ŵanganawonegane ni achalume Elufu selasini na mbili. <verse eid="NUM 31:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36" />Nusu jakwe, liunjili liŵagaŵenye kwa ŵangondo ŵaŵajawile kungondo, lyaliji ngondolo Laki tatu na elufu selasini na saba na mia tano. <verse eid="NUM 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37" />Pa ŵelewo mia sita na sabini na tano ŵapeleche kwa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38" />Ng'ombe elufu selasini na sita ni ŵelewo ng'ombe sabini na mbili ŵapeleche kwa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39" />Mbunda ŵaliji elufu selasini na mia tano, ni pa ŵelewo mbunda sitini na moja ŵapeleche kwa ligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu <verse eid="NUM 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40" />Ŵandu ŵaliji elufu kumi na sita, ni pa ŵelewo ŵandu selasini na mbili ŵapeleche kwa ligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41" />Nipele, che Musa ŵampele jwambopesi che Eleasali yakupeleka yo iyatyosekwe kwa ligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵasalile che Musa.<verse eid="NUM 31:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42" />Ajila nusu jiŵapele Ŵaisilaeli, jati che Musa ŵajiŵisile pakwe ni ajila nusu jiŵapele ŵangondo ŵaŵajawile ku ngondo, <verse eid="NUM 31:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43" />jaliji ngondolo laki tatu na selasini na saba na mia tano, <verse eid="NUM 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44" />ngombe elufu selasini na sita, <verse eid="NUM 31:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45" />mbunda elufu selasini na mia tano, <verse eid="NUM 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46" />ni ŵandu elufu kumi na sita. <verse eid="NUM 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47" />Pa aji nusu jiŵapele Ŵaisilaeli ji, che Musa ŵajigele chimo pa indu hansini ni inyama hansini, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite kwalajisya, ŵapele Ŵalawi ŵaŵapanganyaga masengo pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="NUM 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48" />Nipele achakulu ŵangondo ni ŵakwimilila mipingo ja ŵangondo elufu moja, ni ŵakwimilila mipingo ja ŵangondo mia moja, ŵanjaulile che Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49" />ŵansalile kuti, “Ŵakutumichila ŵenu twaŵalasile ŵangondo wosepe ŵaali paasi penu ni tuiweni kuti ngapagwa namose jumo jwaulajikwe. <verse eid="NUM 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50" />Nipele, tuichisye yoombo ya sahabu ni mikufu ni bangili ni pete sya muhuli ni heleni ni shanga yati kila mundu ŵapatile. Tuiichisye kuti ni uweji wakwe tutendelwe ujilanyo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu.” <verse eid="NUM 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51" />Che Musa ni jwambopesi che Eleasali ŵapochele indu yo yose iyasalalikwe kwa sahabu. <verse eid="NUM 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52" />Sahabu josepe jiŵajipeleche kwa Ambuje Akunnungu jaŵandichile kilo mia mbili. <verse eid="NUM 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53" />Jwangondo jwajulijose ŵajigele indu yakwe iŵasumwile. <verse eid="NUM 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54" />Nipele, che Musa ni jwambopesi che Eleasali ŵajipochele sahabu jo kwa achakulungwa ŵangondo, ŵajijawisye ku Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, jiŵe chikumbuchisyo cha Ŵaisilaeli paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="NUM 31:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32" />
  <para style="s">Ngosyo sya kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa lusulo lwa Yolodani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 3:12-22">Chikumbuchisyo cha Malajisyo 3:12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1" />Ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sya Lobeni ni Gadi ŵakwete ilango yejinji kwannope. Nipele, paŵaiweni kuti malo ga ku Yaseli ni ku Gadi galiji gambone kwa ilango, <verse eid="NUM 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2" />ŵaajaulile che Musa ni jwambopesi che Eleasali ni ilongola ŵampingo, ŵaasalile kuti, <verse eid="NUM 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3" />“Misi ja ku Ataloti ni ku Diboni ni ku Yaseli ni ku Nimula ni ku Heshiboni ni ku Eleale ni ku Sebamu ni ku Nebo ni ku Beoni, <verse eid="NUM 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4" />chilambo chati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵachipundile kwaligongo lya Ŵaisilaeli, chili chilambo chambone kwa kulanga, ni uweji tukwete ilango yejinji kwannope. <verse eid="NUM 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5" />Nipele, iŵaga chintukunde tukummenda ntupeje chilambo chi chiŵe chetu; nkatujombosya pesi lusulo lwa Yolodani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6" />Che Musa ŵaajanjile ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sya Gadi ni Lubeni kuti, “Uli, nkusakanga nsigalile apano, akuno achalongo achinjenu Ŵaisilaeli ali nkwaula kukuputana ngondo? <verse eid="NUM 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7" />Kwachichi nkwatengusya Ŵaisilaeli akajaula ku chilambo chati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵapele? <verse eid="NUM 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8" />Yele ni iŵaitesile achambuje ŵenu panaalajichisye kutyochela ku Kadeshi Balinea ajaule akachiuchilichisye chilambo. <verse eid="NUM 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9" />Ŵanyawo ŵajawile mpaka ku lichemba lya Eshikoli, ŵachiweni chilambo, nambo paŵausile, ŵatengwisye Ŵaisilaeli akajaula ku chilambo chiŵapele Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatumbile pa lyele lyuŵa lyo, ŵalumbilile achitiji, <verse eid="NUM 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11" />‘Kusyene ngapagwa mundu jwalijose pasikati ja ŵandu ŵaŵatyosile ku Misili jwakwete yaka ishilini ni kupunda jutachijinjila mu chilambo chinalanjile kwapa che Abulahamu ni che Isaka ni che Yakubu, ligongo nganaambilikanichisya.’ <verse eid="NUM 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12" />Ŵanawose ngaachiwona chilambo cho, ikaŵe che Kalebu mwanache jwa che Yefune jwa ntundu wa Kenisi, ni che Yoshua mwanache jwa che Nuni, pakuŵa ŵanyawo ŵaambilikanisisye. <verse eid="NUM 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatumbilile kwannope Ŵaisilaeli, ŵatesile ajendejende akuno ni akunokuno mwipululu kwa yaka olobaini, uŵelesi wose uwatesile chigongomalo paujo pakwe, ŵawile. <verse eid="NUM 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14" />Ni sambano, ŵanyamwe uŵelesi wa che Lobeni ni che Gadi nkutenda ila iŵaitesile achachekulu ŵenu, ni konjechesya lutumbilo lwekulungwa lwa Ambuje Akunnungu kwa Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15" />Ŵanyamwe mwakanaga kwakuya, ŵelewo tachinneka sooni mwipululu, ni ŵanyamwe tinchatenda ŵandu ŵa ajonanjikwe.”<verse eid="NUM 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16" />Nipele, ŵanjaulile che Musa, ŵansalile kuti, “Ntukunde kaje tutaŵe pelepa machinga ga ngondolo syetu, ni misi jajili ni makome ga maganga jakutama ŵanache ŵetu. <verse eid="NUM 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17" />Nambo uweji twachinsyene tutujigale yakumenyanila yetu kwaula ku ngondo pamo ni achalongo achinjetu Ŵaisilaeli, ni tutuŵe chambujo ku ngondo mpaka twaichisye pamalo patachitama. Pa kele katema ko ŵanache ŵetu tachitama ku misi jajili ni makome kulilinda ni achinsyene chilambo chi. <verse eid="NUM 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18" />Ngatuuja kumusi mpaka pele Ŵaisilaeli wose ali agaŵilwe malo gatigaŵe gao. <verse eid="NUM 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19" />Ngatujigala malo gagali gose pasikati jao peesi lusulo lwa Yolodani, ligongo uweji tupatile malo getu peesi pano, kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa Yolodani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20" />Che Musa ŵasalile kuti, “Iŵaga kusyene chintende mpela inkusala, nipele papapa pepa paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, njigalanje yakumenyanila yenu njaulanje ku ngondo. <verse eid="NUM 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21" />Jwakumenyana jwalijose pasikati jenu tajomboche lusulo lwa Yolodani nli nkulongoswa ni Ambuje Akunnungu, timwagungumuchile ŵammagongo ŵetu mpaka Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaapunde, <verse eid="NUM 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22" />ni kuchijigala chilambo kuchitenda chenu. Mwatendaga yeleyo, timmuje, pakuŵapo timme ntesile yakuisaka Ambuje Akunnungu ni achalongo achinjenu Ŵaisilaeli. Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu chakunde achi chilambo chakungopochelo lyuŵa kwa Yolodani chi chiŵe chenu. <verse eid="NUM 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23" />Nambo ngunjamuka kuti iŵaga ngampanganya inlanjile yi, tintende sambi kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu; mmanyilileje kusyene kuti tinjamuchikwe. <verse eid="NUM 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24" />Mwataŵile misi achiŵankwenu ni ŵanache ŵenu ni ilango yenu machinga; nambo ntendeje mpela intite pakulanga.”<verse eid="NUM 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25" />Nipele, ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Gadi ni Lobeni ŵansalile che Musa kuti, “Uweji ŵakutumichila ŵenu tututende mpela intite pakutulamulila. <verse eid="NUM 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26" />Achiŵankwetu, ŵanache ŵetu ni ngondolo ni ng'ombe, tiisigalile papapa pa misi ja ku Gileadi. <verse eid="NUM 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27" />Nambo uweji ŵakutumichila ŵenu tuli chile kwaula ku ngondo tulinkulongoswa ni Ambuje Akunnungu. Tutujomboche lusulo lwa Yolodani ni kujiputa ngondo mpela intite kutusalila.”<verse eid="NUM 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28" />Nipele, che Musa ŵaalajisye che Eleasali jwambopesi ni che Yoshua mwanache jwa che Nuni ni ilongola ŵa ngosyo syose sya Ŵaisilaeli achitiji, <verse eid="NUM 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29" />“Iŵaga ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Gadi ni Lobeni tajomboche lusulo lwa Yolodani pamo ni ŵanyamwe ali ajigele yakumenyanilana yao ali nkulongoswa ni Ambuje Akunnungu, mwapundaga ni kuchijigala chilambo cho, nipele timwape chilambo cha ku Gileadi chiŵe chawo. <verse eid="NUM 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30" />Nambo iŵaga ngaajomboka lusulo lwa Yolodani akakamulangane ni ŵanyamwe mu kumenyana ngondo, nipele takajigale malo ja ku Kanaani kuti jiŵe jawo pamo ni ŵanyamwe.”<verse eid="NUM 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Gadi ni Lobeni ŵajanjile kuti, “Ambuje, uweji tututende mpela Ambuje Akunnungu yatite kutusalila uweji ŵakutumichila ŵenu. <verse eid="NUM 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32" />Tuchilongoswaga ni Ambuje Akunnungu, tutujomboche tuli tujigele yakumenyanila yetu mpaka ku chilambo cha ku Kanaani, nambo chilambo chatupele akuno kungopoko lyuŵa kwa lusulo lwa Yolodani chichiŵe chetu.”<verse eid="NUM 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33" />Nipele, che Musa ŵapele ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sya Gadi ni Lobeni ni nusu ja lukosyo lwa Manase mwana jwa che Yusufu, chilambo chosepe cha mwenye che Sihoni jwa Ŵaamoli ni chilambo cha mwenye che Ogu jwa ku Bashani pamo ni misi ni malo gagali mungulugulu mwa misi jo. <verse eid="NUM 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34" />Lukosyo lwa Gadi lwataŵile misi ja ku Diboni ni ku Ataloti ni ku Aloeli, <verse eid="NUM 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35" />ni ku Atiloti Shofani ni ku Yaseli ni ku Yogibeha, <verse eid="NUM 32:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36" />ni ku Beti Nimila ni ku Beti Halani, misi jajili ni makome ni machinga ga ilango. <verse eid="NUM 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37" />Lukosyo lwa Lobeni lwataŵile misi ja ku Heshiboni ni ku Eleale ni ku Kiliataimu, <verse eid="NUM 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38" />ni ku Nebo ni ku Baali Meoni, ni ku Sibima. Misi jiŵataŵile ŵajipele meena gane.<verse eid="NUM 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39" />Uŵelesi wa che Makili, mwana jwa che Manase, ŵachigungumuchile chilambo cha ku Gileadi, ŵasumwile ni kwatopola Ŵaamoli ŵaŵatamaga mwelemo. <verse eid="NUM 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40" />Kwayele, che Musa ŵaapele ŵandu ŵa ntundu wa Makili mwana jwa che Manase, chilambo cha ku Gileadi, nombewo ŵatemi mwelemo. <verse eid="NUM 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41" />Che Yaili jwa lukosyo lwa Manase, ŵajigungumuchile misinda jimpepe ja ku Gileadi ni kujisumula, ŵajipele liina lya Hawoti Yaili malumbo gakwe misinda ja che Yaili. <verse eid="NUM 32:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42" />Nombe che Noba ŵaugungumuchile musi wa Kenati ni misinda jakwe ni kuusumula, ni ŵauŵilasile Noba, liina lyakwe nsyene.<verse eid="NUM 32:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33" />
  <para style="s">Ulendo wa kutyochela ku Misili kwaula ku Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1" />Gelega ni mauto gati Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵisile igono paŵaliji nkutyoka ku Misili ali mmipingo ja ngosyo syawo achilongoswaga ni che Musa ni che Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanlamulile che Musa kuti alembeje liina lya kila liuto paŵaŵisile chigono.<verse eid="NUM 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵatyosile ku musi wa ku Lamesesi pa lyuŵa lya kumi na tano lya mwesi waandanda, lyuŵa limo pakumala Pasaka. Ŵatyosile pangajogopa kose, Ŵamisili wose ali nkwalolechesya, <verse eid="NUM 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4" />katema ko ŵele Ŵamisili ŵaliji nkwasika ŵanache ŵawo ŵakwitiwo ŵachilume ŵaŵaulajikwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu ligongo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaliji ajiputile namose minungu jawo.<verse eid="NUM 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5" />Kwayele, Ŵaisilaeli ŵatyosile ku Lamesesi, ni ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Sukoti ko. <verse eid="NUM 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6" />Kutyochela ku Sukoti, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Etamu, mumbali mwa chipululu. <verse eid="NUM 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7" />Kutyochela ku Etamu, ŵagalawiche ni kuuja mpaka ku Pi Hahiloti chakungopoko lyuŵa kwa Baali Sefoni, ni ŵaŵisile chigono chao chiŵandika ni ku Migidoli. <verse eid="NUM 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8" />Ŵatyosile ku Pi Hahiloti, ŵapitile ku bahali ja Shamu mpaka kuchipululu cha Etamu, ŵajesile mu chipululu lwendo lwa moŵa gatatu, ni ŵaŵisile chigono chao ku Mala. <verse eid="NUM 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9" />Kutyochela ku Mala, ŵajesile mpaka ku Elimu; kwele ku Elimu kwaliji ni iliŵa ya mesi kumi nambili ni mitende sabini, ni ŵaŵisile chigono chao pelepo. <verse eid="NUM 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10" />Ŵajesile kutyochela ku Elimu, ŵaŵisile chigono chao chiŵandika ni bahali ja Shamu. <verse eid="NUM 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11" />Kutyochela ku bahali ja shamu ŵaŵisile chigono chao ku chipululu cha Sini. <verse eid="NUM 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12" />Kutyochela ku chipululu cha Sini, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Dofika. <verse eid="NUM 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13" />Kutyochela ku Dofika ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Alushi. <verse eid="NUM 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14" />Kutyochela ku Alushi ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Lefidimu, pati nganipapagwa ni mesi gakung'wa. <verse eid="NUM 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15" />Ŵatyosile ku Lefidimu ŵaŵisile chigono chao ku chipululu cha Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16" />Kutyochela ku chipululu cha Sinai ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Kibuloti Hataava. <verse eid="NUM 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17" />Kutyochela ku Kibuloti Hataava, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Haseloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18" />Kutyochela ku Haseloti, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Litima. <verse eid="NUM 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19" />Kutyochela ku Litima, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Limoni Pelesi. <verse eid="NUM 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20" />Kutyochela ku Limon Pelesi, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Libina. <verse eid="NUM 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21" />Kutyochela ku Libina ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Lisa. <verse eid="NUM 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22" />Ŵatyosile ku Lisa, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Kehelata. <verse eid="NUM 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23" />Kutyochela ku Kehelata, ŵaŵisile chigono chao ku chitumbi cha Shefeli. <verse eid="NUM 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24" />Kutyochela ku chitumbi cha Shefeli ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Halada. <verse eid="NUM 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25" />Kutyochela ku Halada, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Makeloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26" />Kutyochela ku Makeloti, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Tahati. <verse eid="NUM 33:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27" />Kutyochela ku Tahati, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Tela. <verse eid="NUM 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28" />Kutyochela ku Tela, ŵaŵisile chogono chao kwele ku Mitika. <verse eid="NUM 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29" />Kutyochela ku Mitika, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Hashimona. <verse eid="NUM 33:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30" />Kutyochela ku Hashimoni, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Moseloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31" />Kutyochela ku Moseloti, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Bene Yaakani. <verse eid="NUM 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32" />Kutyochela ku Bene Yaakani, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Holi Hagidigadi. <verse eid="NUM 33:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33" />Kutyochela ku Holi Hagidigadi, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Yoti Bata. <verse eid="NUM 33:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34" />Kutyochela ku Yoti Bata, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Abilona. <verse eid="NUM 33:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35" />Kutyochela ku Abilona, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Esioni Gebeli. <verse eid="NUM 33:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36" />Kutyochela ku Esioni Gebeli, ŵajesile ni kuŵika chigono chao kwele ku Kadeshi pa chipululu cha Sini. <verse eid="NUM 33:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37" />Kutyochela ku Kadeshi, ŵaŵisile chigono chao ku chitumbi cha Holi, mumpika mwa chilambo cha ku Edomu.<verse eid="NUM 33:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38" />Kwa malajisyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu, jwambopesi che Haluni ŵakwesile pachanya chitumbi cha Holi, ni kweleko ŵawile pa lyuŵa lyaandanda lya mwesi wansano, pa chaka cha alobaini chitandilile Ŵaisilaeli paŵakopweche ku Misili. <verse eid="NUM 33:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39" />Che Haluni ŵawilile pa chitumbi cha Holi ali ni yaka mia moja na ishilini na tatu.<verse eid="NUM 33:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40" />Mwenye jwa Chikanaani jwa ku Aladi, juŵatamaga kulujenda kwa chilambo cha Kanaani ŵapilikene kuti Ŵaisilaeli akuikanga.<verse eid="NUM 33:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41" />Kutyochela ku chitumbi cha Holi Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Salimona. <verse eid="NUM 33:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42" />Kutyochela ku Salimona, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Punoni. <verse eid="NUM 33:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43" />Kutyochela ku Punoni, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Oboti. <verse eid="NUM 33:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44" />Kutyochela ku Oboti, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Iye Abalimu, ku chilambo cha Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 33:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45" />Kutyochela ku Iye Abalimu, ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Diboni Gadi. <verse eid="NUM 33:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46" />Kutyochela ku Diboni Gadi, ŵajesile ni kuŵika chigono chao kwele ku Alimoni Dibilataimu. <verse eid="NUM 33:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47" />Kutyochela ku Alimoni Dibilataimu, ŵajesile ni kuŵika chigono chao ku chitumbi cha Abalimu, chiŵandika ni chitumbi cha Nebo. <verse eid="NUM 33:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48" />Kutyochela ku itumbi ya Abalimu, ŵajesile ni kuŵika chigono chao ku iŵata ya ku Moabu, pesi lusulo lwa Yolodani chiŵandika ni musi wa ku Yeliko. <verse eid="NUM 33:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49" />Ŵaŵisile chigono cho chiŵandika ni lusulo lwa Yolodani pasikati ja Beti Yeshimoti ni lichemba lya Abeli Shitimu ku iŵata ya ku Moabu.<verse eid="NUM 33:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malajisyo gaŵapele Ŵaisilaeli akanaŵe kwinjila ku Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50" />Ku iŵata ya ku Moabu, pesi lusulo lwa Yolodani chiŵandika ni ku Yeliko, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa kuti, <verse eid="NUM 33:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51" />“Mwasalile Ŵaisilaeli kuti pachinjomboche lusulo lwa Yolodani ni kuinjila ku chilambo cha ku Kanaani, <verse eid="NUM 33:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52" />mwatopole achinsyene ilambo yo wose atyoche mbujo mwenu. Tinchigumulanga inyago yao yakusepa ni inyago yekolochekwe kwa kunyelenyendusya chisyano ni kugumulanya pamalo pao paakupopelela. <verse eid="NUM 33:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53" />Tinchijigale chilambo cho ni kuchitenda chenu ni kutama mwelemo, pakuŵapo nampele mwanya chilambo cho chiŵe chenu. <verse eid="NUM 33:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54" />Tinchigaŵanye chilambo cho kwa kutenda kudugudu malinga ni mitundu jenu. Pa lukosyo lwekulungwa nnope mwagaŵile malo jajikulungwa ni pa lukosyo lwenandi mwagaŵile malo jenandi. Chachilichose chichimpegwe kwa kutenda gudugudu chichiŵe chenu. Chinchigaŵanye chilambo malinga ni ngosyo sya achambuje ŵenu. <verse eid="NUM 33:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55" />Nambo iŵaga ngankwatopola achinsyene chilambo cho, nipele ŵele utinchasigasya wo tachisanduka ŵakusausya kwakogoya mpela iswani mmeso mwenu ni miŵa kwakulikose, nipele tachimenyana ni ŵanyamwe ku chilambo chichinkatame. <verse eid="NUM 33:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56" />Iŵaga ngamwatopola uneji chinjintenda mwanya chindu chakogoya mpela munalapilile kwatendela ŵanyawo.”<verse eid="NUM 33:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34" />
  <para style="s">Mipika ja chilambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Musa <verse eid="NUM 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2" />ŵaasalile Ŵaisilaeli malajisyo ga, “Pachinkajinjile ku chilambo cha ku Kanaani, chilambo chingwapa chiŵe chenu, mipika ja chilambo chenu chose tijiŵe mpela yeleyi. <verse eid="NUM 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3" />Chakulujenda mpika wenu chiuŵe kutyochela ku chipululu cha Sini kuukuya mpika wa ku Edomu. Chakungopochelo lyuŵa mpika wenu chakulujenda chiutandilile kumbesi kwa Bahali ja Njete, <verse eid="NUM 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4" />Nipele chiujaule chakulujenda kupitila ku Akilabimu, ni kupitila ku Sini mpaka ku Kadeshi Balinea. Nipele mpika wo tiuendelechele mpaka ku Hasali Adali mpaka ku Asimoni. <verse eid="NUM 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5" />Kutyochela ku Asimoni tiugalauche ni kwaula ku kasulo ka Misili, ni kumalila ku Bahali ja Meditelaniani.<verse eid="NUM 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6" />“Chakumaswelelo lyuŵa mpika wenu tiuŵe Bahali ja Meditelaniani.<verse eid="NUM 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7" />“Chakumpoto mpika wenu tiuŵe nti nnyi: Kutyochela ku Bahali ja Meditelaniani, timmiche alama mpaka ku chitumbi cha Holi. <verse eid="NUM 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8" />Kutyochela ku chitumbi cha Holi timmiche chilosyo mpaka ku Hamati; ni kutyochela kweleko tiujaule mpaka ku Sedadi, <verse eid="NUM 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9" />ni kupitila ku Sifiloni ni kumalila ku Hasali Enani; welewo tiuŵe mpika wenu chakumpoto.<verse eid="NUM 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10" />“Chakungopochelo lyuŵa mpika wenu tiutandilile ku Hasali Enani mpaka ku Shefamu. <verse eid="NUM 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11" />Kutyochela ku Shefamu tiujaule kulujenda mpaka ku Libila, kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa Aini; nipele mpika wo tiujaule chapasi mpaka ku nduluko ja ku ngopokochelo lyuŵa kwa litanda lya Kineleti, <verse eid="NUM 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12" />pelepo tiuseleleche kukuya lusulo lwa Yolodani mpaka ku Bahali ja Njete.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 34:12">“Chelecho ni chichichiŵa chilambo chenu mpela mipika jakwe yajitite kuŵa.”<verse eid="NUM 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13" />Nipele, che Musa waasalile Ŵaisilaeli kuti, “Chelechi ni chilambo chachingaŵilwe kuŵa chenu kwakutenda gudugudu, chilambo chati Ambuje Akunnungu alajisye apegwe ŵandu ŵa ngosyo tisa ni nusu. <verse eid="NUM 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14" />Lukosyo lwa Lobeni ni Gadi ni nusu ja lukosyo lwa Manase amasile kupegwa malo jawo malinga ni mitundu jawo. <verse eid="NUM 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15" />Ngosyo siŵili ni nusu syo apegwilwe malo jawo pesi lusulo lwa Yolodani chakungopochelo, kulolegana ni ku Yeliko.”<verse eid="NUM 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilongola ŵachajimilile yati kugaŵana chilambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa kuti, <verse eid="NUM 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17" />“Jwambopesi che Eleasali ni che Yoshua mwana jwa che Nuni ni uchiŵagaŵile ŵandu chilambo kuŵa chawo. <verse eid="NUM 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18" />Tinjigale sooni chilongola jumo kutyochela pa kila lukosyo kukamuchisya mu kugaŵanya chilambo cho.” <verse eid="NUM 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19" />Gelega gali meena gawo:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 34:19">Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Yuda, ŵasagulikwe che Kalebu mwana jwa che Yefune.<verse eid="NUM 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Simeoni, ŵasagulikwe che Shemueli mwana jwa che Amihudi.<verse eid="NUM 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Benjamini, ŵasagulikwe che Elidadi mwana jwa che Kisiloni.<verse eid="NUM 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Dani, ŵasagulikwe che Buki mwana jwa che Yogili.<verse eid="NUM 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Manase mwana jwa che Yusufu, ŵasagulikwe che Hanieli mwana jwa che Efodi.<verse eid="NUM 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Efulaimu, mwana jwa che Yusufu, ŵasagulikwe che Kemueli mwana jwa che Shifutani.<verse eid="NUM 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Sabuloni, ŵasagulikwe che Elisafani mwana jwa che Palinaki.<verse eid="NUM 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Isakali, ŵasagulikwe che Palitieli mwana jwa che Asani.<verse eid="NUM 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Asheli, ŵasagulikwe che Ahihudi mwana jwa che Shelomi<verse eid="NUM 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Nafutali, ŵasagulikwe che Pedaheli mwana jwa che Amihudi.<verse eid="NUM 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29" />Ŵeleŵa ni ŵandu ŵati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaalajisye ŵaagaŵile Ŵaisilaeli chilambo cha ku Kanaani kuti chiŵe chawo.<verse eid="NUM 34:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35" />
  <para style="s">Misi jiŵapegwilwe Ŵalawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵakungulwiche ni che Musa ku iŵata ya ku Moabu, pesi lusulo lwa Yolodani chiŵandika ni ku Yeliko, ŵasalile kuti, <verse eid="NUM 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2" />“Mwasalile Ŵaisilaeli kuti malinga ni malo gitapegwe kuŵa gawo, chiŵape Ŵalawi misi jakutama ni malo gakulisisya kusyungulila misijo. <verse eid="NUM 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3" />Misi jo tijiŵe jawo, nombewo chatame mwelemo ni malo gakulisisya tigaŵe kwaligongo lya ng'ombe ni ilango yao pamo ni inyama yao ine. <verse eid="NUM 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4" />Malo gakulisisya ga mwelemo gatimwape Ŵalawi kusyungulila misi tigajenele kila upaande mita mia nne na hansini kutyochela ku makumba ga misijo. <verse eid="NUM 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5" />Kwayele, malo ga kulisisya go tigaŵe ga mita mia tisa kila upaande wa musi, musi usyene tiuŵe pambindikati. Malogo tigaŵe malo gao gakulisisya kusyungulila misi jao. <verse eid="NUM 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6" />Timwape Ŵalawi misi sita jakuutuchila mwati mundu aulagaga njakwe pangaŵa kwamele tautuchile kweleko. Pamo ni yeleyo, timwape misi jine alobaini na mbili. <verse eid="NUM 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7" />Misi jitimwape Ŵalawi tijiŵe alobaini na nane; timwape misi jo pamo ni malo gakulisisya ilango. <verse eid="NUM 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8" />Misi jitimwape Ŵalawi kutyochela ku malo ja Ŵaisilaeli tijiŵe malinga ni kukula kwa lukosyo; lukosyo lwekulungwa tilutyosye misi jejinji ni lukosyo lwenandi tilutyosye misi kanandi. Kila lukosyo tilityosye misi jakwe kwaligongo lya Ŵalawi malinga ni malo gatachipegwa gaŵe gawo.”<verse eid="NUM 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misi jakuutuchila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">Chikumbuchisyo cha Malajisyo 19:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Yoshua 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Musa kuti, <verse eid="NUM 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10" />“Mwaasalile Ŵaisilaeli kuti katema patinjomboche lusulo lwa Yolodani ni kwinjila ku chilambo cha ku Kanaani, <verse eid="NUM 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11" />tinsagule misi jati tijiŵe jakuutuchila mwati mundu aulagaga njakwe pangaŵa kwa mele tautuchile kweleko. <verse eid="NUM 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12" />Misi jo tijiŵe malo jakuutuchila kuti jwele jwakuulaga jo akaulajikwa ni mundu jwakuuchisya akanaŵe kulichenjela pankungulu. <verse eid="NUM 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13" />Tinjiŵichile misi sita kwaligongo lya kuutuchila. <verse eid="NUM 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14" />Pa jele misi sita jitinjisagule jo, misi jitatu jiŵeje kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Yolodani ni misi jitatu jiŵeje pa chilambo cha ku Kanaani. <verse eid="NUM 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15" />Misi ji tijiŵe jakuutuchila kwaligongo lya Ŵaisilaeli ni achalendo ŵakutama pasikati jenu, kuti mundu jwalijose jutaulaje mundu njakwe pangaŵa kwa mele akukombola kuutuchila mwelemo.<verse eid="NUM 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16" />“Nambo mundu amputaga njakwe kwa chisyano, ni kuwa, mundu jo ali jwakuulaga, jwelejo nombe aulajikwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17" />Mundu jwalijose amputaga njakwe ni liganga, awaga, mundu jo ali jwakuulaga, jwelejo nombe aulajikwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18" />Iŵaga amputile njakwe kwa chitela chachikukombola kuulaga, awaga, mundu jo ali jwakuulaga, jwelejo nombe aulajikwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19" />Nlongo njakwe mundu jwaulajikwe, tauchisye katema patasimane ni jwakuulaga jo, ammulaje nombe jo.<verse eid="NUM 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20" />“Sooni iŵaga mundu akunchima njakwe kwa moŵa gamajinji, ni antutaga pane kumponya ni chindu pakunjuŵilila, <verse eid="NUM 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21" />pane amputaga lingumi ni kuwa, nipele mundu jwamputile njakwe ni kummulaga jo, jwelejo nombe aulajikwe. Nlongo njakwe mundu jwaulajikwe tauchisye patasimane nawo.<verse eid="NUM 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22" />“Nambo iŵaga mundu antutile njakwe chisisimuchile panganchima pane amponyaga chindu panganjuŵilila, <verse eid="NUM 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23" />pane mundu aponyaga liganga lyalikukombola kuichisya chiwa, ni kummulaga mundu pangaŵa kwamele, nachiŵamuno nganaŵa jwammagongo jwakwe namose nganasaka kuti ammulasye, <verse eid="NUM 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24" />nipele, nkungulu tiulamule pasikati ja mundu jwakuulaga jo ni nlongo njakwe mundu jwaulajikwe jwakusaka kuuchisya, malinga ni malamusi ga. <verse eid="NUM 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25" />Nkungulu tiunkulupusye mundu jwauleje jo mmakono mwa nlongo njakwe mundu jwaulajikwe, ni kummusya ku musi wakuutuchila muŵautuchile. Chatame mwelemo mpaka patachiwa jwambopesi jwankulu jwasagulikwe pa katema ko kwakwajitilila mauta gagakuntendekasya mundu aŵe jwambopesi jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="NUM 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26" />Nambo jwauleje jo akopokaga paasa musi wautuchile pa katema kalikose, <verse eid="NUM 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27" />nombe nlongo njake mundu jwaulajikwe ansimanaga paasa pa mipika ja musi wakuutuchila wo ni kummulaga, jwele mundu jo ngaakola magambo ga kuulaga. <verse eid="NUM 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28" />Pakuŵa mundu jwauleje jo akusachilwa atame nkati mwa musi wakuutuchila mpaka jwambopesi jwankulu patawe; ni jwambopesi jwankulu awaga, jwakuulaga jo akukombola kuuja kumangwakwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29" />Malajisyo ga tigatumiche pa iŵelesi yenu yose, pamalo palipose patintame.<verse eid="NUM 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30" />“Mundu jwalijose jutaulaje mundu, talamulikwe chiwa kwa umboni wa ŵandu ŵaŵili pane kupunda, mundu jwalijose ngaikomboleka kulamulikwa chiwa kwa umboni wa mundu jumo. <verse eid="NUM 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31" />Nkapochela malipilo galigose kuukulupusya umi wa mundu jwauleje, jwasimanikwe ni magambo ni kulamulikwa chiwa, mundu jo aulajikwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32" />Nkapochela namose nkakunda malipilo galigose kutyochela kwa mundu jwautuchile ku musi wakuutuchila kuti aujile kutama kumangwakwe, jwambopesi jwankulu akanaŵe kuwa. <verse eid="NUM 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33" />Mwatendaga yeleyo chinchitende chilambo chinkutama nachikane pakuŵapo une Ambuje Akunnungu nombe ngutama mwelemo. Kuulaga ŵandu kukuchitenda chilambo chikakundikwa ni une, ni ngapagwa mbopesi jajikukombola kuchitenda chilambo cho chikundikwe ni une, ikaŵe mundu jwauleje jo nombejo aulajikwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34" />Nkachitenda chilambo chinkutama nachikane, pakuŵapo uneji Ambuje Akunnungu ngutama mwelemo; pakuŵapo uneji Ambuje Akunnungu ngutama pasikati jenu Ŵaisilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 35:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36" />
  <para style="s">Chilambo chapegwilwe achakongwe ŵalombekwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1" />Ilongola ŵa ŵandu ŵa ntundu wa Gileadi, mwanache jwa che Makili mwanache jwa che Manase, mwanache jwa che Yusufu, ŵajawile kukunguluka ni che Musa ni ilongola ŵane ŵa Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2" />Ŵatite kuti, “Ambuje ŵetu, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanlamulile kwagaŵila Ŵaisilaeli chilambo pakutenda gudugudu, kuti chiŵe chao; ŵanlamulile sooni kuti mwape achiŵali ŵa che Selofehadi nlongo njetu malo ja atati ŵawo. <verse eid="NUM 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3" />Nambo ŵanyawo alombelaga ni Ŵaisilaeli ŵa mitundu jine, malo jetu tijijaule kwa ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sisisyalombele; kwayele malo jetu uweji tijichinandwipa. <verse eid="NUM 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4" />Pa chaka cha kuliusya lisi kwa achinsyene, malo jawo tiliŵalanjikwe pamo ni alila lya lukosyo lutalombele, ni kwayele lukosyo lwetu ngalupata malo jawo sooni.”<verse eid="NUM 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5" />Nipele, che Musa ŵaapele Ŵaisilaeli lilajisyo li kutyochela kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵaasalile kuti “Ŵandu wa lukosyo lwa ntundu wa che Yusufu asasile isyene. <verse eid="NUM 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6" />Yeleyi ni yatite kulamula Ambuje Akunnungu nkati achiŵali ŵa che Selofehadi; akukombola kulombekwa ni mundu jwalijose jwakunsaka, nambo alombele mu ntundu wa achatati ŵao pe yaani lukosyo lwa Manase, <verse eid="NUM 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7" />kuti malo japegwilwe lukosyo lumo akapegwa ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwine pelepo; Mwisilaeli julijose chagose malo ga lukosyo lwakwe. <verse eid="NUM 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8" />Jwankongwe jwalijose jwakwete malo pa lukosyo lumo mwa ngosyo sya Ŵaisilaeli akusachilwa alombekwe ni mundu jwa pa lukosyo lwa atatigwe, kuti Mwisilaeli julijose apegwe malo ga achambujegwe. <verse eid="NUM 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9" />Kwayele ngapapagwa ni malo ja lukosyo lumo jichijipegwe ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwine. Kila lukosyo lwa Ŵaisilaeli tilusigalile pa malo jawo.”<verse eid="NUM 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10" />Achiŵali ŵa che Selofehadi ŵatesile mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵansalile che Musa. <verse eid="NUM 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11" />Ŵanawose, che Mala ni che Tilisa ni che Hogila ni che Milika ni che Noa ŵalombekwe ni ulongo wa kuchitati. <verse eid="NUM 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12" />Ŵalombekwe ni ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Manase mwanache jwa che Yusufu, ni malo jawo jasigalile pa lukosyo lwa atati ŵao.<verse eid="NUM 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13" />Gelego ni malajisyo ni makanyo gati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵapele Ŵaisilaeli kwa litala li che Musa mu iŵata ya ku Moabu, pesi lusulo lwa Yolodani chiwandika ni musi wa ku Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 36:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36" />
</usx>